\id EXO  
\h Memeyekɨ 
\toc1 Memeyekɨ 
\toc2 Memeyekɨ 
\toc3 Mem 
\mt1 Memeyekɨ  
\c 1  
\s1 'Ekipitu 'ixaheritsixi kememɨte'uta'aitɨarie  
\p
\v 1 'Ikɨ mekanihɨkɨtɨni 'Ixaheri niwemama, kepauka yuniwema mewaruwitɨtɨ memu'axɨa 'Ekipitu, Kakuwu yunaitɨ:  
\v 2 Xuweni, Tsimehuni, Rewi, Kura,  
\v 3 'Itsakaxi, Tsawuruni, Wenikamini,  
\v 4 Rani, Nepɨtahari, Kahari meta 'Atsexi.  
\v 5 Yunaitɨ Kakuwu nuiwarimama mepɨhɨkɨtɨkai, haika tewiyari heimana tamamata. 'Ekipitu paitɨri Kutse pukatei.   
\p
\v 6 Hikɨ Kutse meta 'iwamama mekaniukwini meta mɨkɨ xiɨyarimama yunaitɨ.  
\v 7 Peru matsi 'ixaheritsixi, waɨkawa tɨɨri mekaniwarayexeiyakaitɨni, yumɨiretɨ mekanakɨne metɨrɨkaɨyetɨ, mɨkɨ kwieyaritsie mekanakɨnɨximekaitɨni. Kiekari 'ayeutɨ kanayeiximekaitɨni.   
\p
\v 8 Hikɨ 'Ekipitu xewitɨ pɨta ti'aitame kananukakeni Kutse mɨkahetimaikai kemɨtiuyuri,  
\v 9 mɨpaɨ katiniwarutahɨawe yuteɨterima: «Xekeneyukweriwayurieka 'ixaheritsixi wahepaɨtsita, waɨkawa tɨrɨkariya mekanexeiyani, mekaniyɨmɨireniri mekatana'iwani.  
\v 10 Hikɨ tekateniwata'aitɨakuni waɨkawamekɨ tetemaiwawetɨ, xɨka mɨpaɨ tekate'uyurieni matsi waɨkawa mepɨtamɨire, xɨka kuyaxa hayani, memɨtatsi'aye'unieta pɨta mekanakɨnikuni, metatsi'a'iwame mekaniyehuni 'ikɨ kwieyaritsie».   
\p
\v 11 Mɨpaɨ mekateniuyurieni 'ekipitutari, te'aitamete mekaniwarutihɨawe 'ixaheritsixi memɨtewata'aitɨanikɨ, 'uximayatsika mekaniwaruxatɨani waɨriyarika mewapitɨatɨ, Parahuni hetsiemieme kiekari 'ikwai mɨreuta'ɨnarɨwa Pituni mɨtitewa meta Xamɨtsexi.  
\v 12 Peru matsi mɨyamewaruyurieku, matsi waɨkawa mekanixiɨkaitɨni mepɨtamɨirirɨmekai, hikɨ 'ekipitutsixi waɨkawa mekaniwarutimakani.  
\v 13 'Ayumieme kwinimieme mekateniwa'uximayatsitɨakaitɨni, kemɨkareuyewetse hepaɨ mekateniwa'aitɨakaitɨni.  
\v 14 Watukari waɨkawa mekaninanaimakaitɨni, waɨriyarika metewa'aitɨatɨ, kwie memɨhawiyanikɨ, xɨnariya wewiyarikɨ, naime mɨrati'etsiwatsie, tita 'uximayatsika mɨraniere, naime 'uximayatsikatsie 'ixaheritsixi memɨteha'uximayakai 'ekipitutari mewarutate'atɨ mekateniwa'aitɨakaitɨni.   
\p
\v 15 Mana mekanititekaitɨni yuhutatɨ 'ukarawetsixi hepɨrayutsixi teɨteriyari teniweritsitɨwamete, Tsipura meta Puwa metetetewatɨ, ti'aitame 'Ekipitu kiekame mɨpaɨ katiniwaruta'aitɨani:   
\p
\v 16 —Kepauka 'ukarawetsixi hepɨrayutsixi xemɨwaparewie niweriyakɨ, xeyu'ɨwiyatɨ tita mɨtitinuiwa: xɨka 'ukitɨni xewatakukuyatɨ, xɨka 'ukatɨni xekenehayewa 'ayeniereme.   
\p
\v 17 Peru 'ukarawetsixi teniweritsitɨwamete hepɨrayutsixi Kakaɨyari mekanayemakakaitɨni, 'ayumieme ti'aitame 'Ekipitu kiekame kemɨtiwarahɨawekai yamepɨkate'uyuri, 'ukitsi mekaniwaruhayewa me'ayeneniereme.  
\v 18 Hikɨ 'Ekipitu kwieyaritsie ti'aitame, mɨkɨ 'ukarawetsixi teniweritsitɨwamete kaniwarutakwewieni, mɨpaɨ katiniwaruta'iwawiya:  
\p —¿Titayari mɨya xeteheyurie? ¿Titayari tɨɨri 'ukitsi xekatewatakukuya?   
\p
\v 19 Mɨkɨ mɨpaɨ mekaniutiyuani:  
\p —Neuxeitsɨ, 'ukari hepɨrayutsixi 'ukarawetsixi 'ekipitutari wahepaɨ mepɨka'anene, mɨkɨ waɨkawa mepɨtɨrɨkawi yuxaɨta mepɨtiniweya tame teka'aye'axɨaximekaku.   
\p
\v 20 Mɨpaɨ tiuyɨku, matsi 'ixaheritsixi waɨkawa mekaniyutamɨiriya. Meta Kakaɨyari mɨkɨ teniweritsitɨwamete 'aixɨa katiniwaruxeiya,  
\v 21 Kakaɨyari memayemakakaikɨ, kaniwarupitɨani tɨɨri waɨkawa memɨwarayexeiyakɨ.  
\v 22 Hikɨ Parahuni mɨpaɨ katiniwaruta'aitɨani yuteɨterima:  
\p —Yunaime tɨɨri 'ukitsi hepɨrayutsixi hapa xekeniwareukaxɨri memɨtinunuiwa. 'Ukari xekeniwarehayewa.   
\c 2  
\s1 Muitsexi kemɨtiunuiwaxɨ  
\p
\v 1 Xewitɨ kaniuyeikakaitɨni Rewi nuiwarieya, kepauka mutineɨkixɨ mana tsiere mieme kanewitɨni.  
\v 2 Mɨkɨ kaniutihukata nunutsi kanayexeiya, 'ixeiyaka kwinimieme mɨtitemaikɨkaikɨ, kaniti'awieta haika metseri.  
\v 3 Kepaukari mɨkayɨwekai mi'awietanikɨ tsikɨiwiti kaniutawewieni, xɨrɨka kanitawirieni kwetsɨka mɨyɨwi nɨkame, mana nunutsi kanikateni hatetsita kaneikweni, hakatsata kanihɨani hapa mɨye'ukaitɨa, Niru hatetsitayaritsie.  
\v 4 Hikɨ nunutsi kurieya yateewa kaniuyuhayewa, niereke kemɨranuyeyanikekai.   
\p
\v 5 Hikɨ mana kaniukateni 'uka Parahuni niweya ku'ɨwanetɨ, Niru hatuxameyaritsie. Te'i'uximayatsiriwamete hatetsita mekaniu'uwakaitɨni, yapauka Parahuni niweya tsikɨiwiti kaniuxeiya hakatsata kaniyewiekaitɨni, xeime ti'uximayatame kaniutanɨ'ani mituimiekɨ.  
\v 6 Kepauka Parahuni niweya tsikɨiwiti manutiyepi nunutsi kaniuxeiya 'utatsuakame, kanitinenimayata mɨpaɨ kaniutayɨni:  
\p ―Hepɨrayu nunutsi pɨhɨkɨ.   
\p
\v 7 Hikɨ mɨkɨ nunutsi kurieya Parahuni niweya mɨpaɨ katiniutahɨawe:  
\p —Ya xeime 'ukaratsi nepɨti'inimie hepɨrayu tewiyari mitsitsitɨanikɨ, mitaweriyakɨ mɨkɨ nunutsi 'ahetsiemieme.   
\p
\v 8 Mɨkɨ mɨpaɨ katinita'eiya:  
\p —Kenemie kenewitɨmie.  
\p Kurieya kaneyani, peru nunutsi maamaya kani'atɨani.  
\v 9 Parahuni niweya mɨpaɨ katinitahɨawe:  
\p —Kenanutu'i 'ikɨ nunutsi kenetsitsitɨaka keneneutaweriri, ne nepɨmatipitɨaka mɨpaɨ pemɨtiyurienikɨ.  
\p Mɨpaɨ tiɨyɨku mɨkɨ nunutsi maamaya kaneituni 'itsitsitɨatɨ kanitaweriya.  
\v 10 'Utawerekuri nunutsi, kaneiwitɨni Parahuni niweya hetsɨa, mɨkɨ kaniyutaniwetɨani, meta Muitsexi katiniterɨwa mɨpaɨ 'utaitɨ: «Ne hapa nepetitui».   
\s1 Muitsexi kemɨtiuyuta'unaxɨ  
\p
\v 11 Kepauka Muitsexi 'amuyutama, yu'iwama kaniwarekuxeiya, kaniuniere kememɨte'uximatɨariekai. Xeime kaniuxeiya 'ekipitutanaka hepɨrayu tewiyari tiwayakaku.  
\v 12 Hikɨ hanieretɨyaka nixewitɨ hawaikɨ mɨkareyeikakaikɨ mɨkɨ 'ekipitutanaka kaniumieni, kaniti'awieta xiekarita.  
\v 13 'Uxa'arieka hutarieka kanikuyani, hipameta kaniwaruxeiya meyukwitɨweme yu'iwamatɨ hepɨrayutsixi, mimainekai kaniuta'iwawiya:  
\p —¿Titayari 'a'iwa petimiene?   
\p
\v 14 Mɨkɨ kanita'eiya:  
\p —¿Kemɨ'anekuta 'ekɨ matsi'utahɨawixɨ 'itsɨkamekɨ tahetsie pemɨti'aitanikɨ? ¿Netsɨta penenemieni 'ekipitutanaka hepaɨ?  
\p Mɨyamɨtiutahɨawariekɨ Muitsexi waɨkawa kaniutimani mɨpaɨ katiniu'erieni: «Xɨari nepahekɨarixɨ kenemɨtiuyuri».  
\v 15 Mɨyatiɨyɨku Parahuni katinetimani, Muitsexi kanimienikekaitɨni, peru Muitsexi kaniyuta'una Mariyani kwieyaritsie paitɨ kaneyani, putsu matiniere kaniuyuhayewa.   
\p
\v 16 Mawari wewiwame Mariyani kiekame 'atahuta meyupaɨmeme 'ukari kaniwarexeiyakaitɨni, mɨkɨ mekaniuyehanɨtɨkɨkakaitɨni muxatsi mematiharewe memɨtihɨniyakɨ, yupaapa muxatsimama mewatiharitɨanike.  
\v 17 Peru muxatsi wahɨwemete 'ukitsi mana mekani'axekaitɨni mewataweiyake. Heiwa Muitsexi wahetsie kaniutanuani, 'ukitsi kaniwarutaweiya, 'ukari wamuxatsima kaniwarutiharitɨani.  
\v 18 Kepauka 'ukari memakunuaxɨa yupaapa kie Xehueri, mɨkɨ mɨpaɨ katiniwaruta'iwawiya:  
\p —¿Titayari hikɨ kwitɨwa xete'u'axɨa?   
\p
\v 19 Mɨkɨ mɨpaɨ mekaniutiyuani:  
\p —Xewitɨ 'ekipitutanaka tahetsie kanetanuani, muxatsi wahɨwemete haa kememɨtekwerie, matsita haa watihanaka muxatsi kaniwaretiharitɨani.   
\p
\v 20 Mɨkɨta mɨpaɨ katiniwarutahɨawe:  
\p —¿Hakewari mɨkɨ 'uki? ¿Titayari yuxaɨta xeteheiku'eiri? Xekeneta'ini mɨtikwanikɨ.   
\p
\v 21 Muitsexi kaniuyuwaɨriya mɨkɨ hetsɨa mukanikɨ, mɨkɨ kaniwitɨtɨani yuniwe Tsepura.  
\v 22 Mɨkɨ nunutsi xeime kanayexeiya, Muitsexi Keritsuni katiniterɨwa, mɨpaɨ tiu'erieka: «'Ateewapai nepɨkiekame xaɨtsie nepuyeika».   
\p
\v 23 Mɨixa wiyari 'anuyeyaku, ti'aitame 'Ekipitu kiekame kaniumɨni. 'Ixaheritsixi yaxeikɨa mekateniuka'eniwakaitɨni, waɨriyarika te'uximayatamete mehɨkɨtɨtɨ, mekaniutihiwakaitɨni parewiya meheuyehɨatɨ. Wahiwari Kakaɨyari kaniu'enieni mewaɨripiekaku.  
\v 24 Hikɨ 'u'enaka kememɨte'uximatɨariekai kanaye'erieni tɨratu kememɨte'uwewi 'Apɨrahami, 'Itsahaki meta Kakuwu hamatɨa.  
\v 25 Mɨpaɨ Kakaɨyari 'ixaheritsixi katiniwaraye'erieni, maye'akaikɨ yamemɨteyuriekakɨ.   
\c 3  
\s1 Muitsexi 'ɨtsi mɨta'a hamatɨa  
\p
\v 1 Merikɨtsɨ Muitsexi muxatsi kaniwahɨnekaitɨni yumune tewamama Keturu, mawari wewiwame mɨhɨkɨtɨkai Mariyani kiekame, muxatsi kaniware'arieni makumawetsie 'anutaɨyepaitɨ, Huré mɨrakutewatsie kaniye'ani, hɨri Kakaɨyari manuyeika.  
\v 2 Mana 'uyeikakaku Yawé niuki tuayameya kaniuyuhekɨata taitsata 'ɨtsi takaku. Muitsexi mɨpaɨ katiniuniere 'ɨtsi kanitakaitɨni, peru pɨkayexɨximekai.  
\v 3 'Ayumieme mɨpaɨ katiniu'erieni: «Ketɨtɨri. Tsipara nemɨnierimie, titayari katiyetaixime 'ɨtsi».   
\p
\v 4 Kepauka Yawé Muitsexi muxei 'ahurawa 'a'amiekame nierimɨtɨ, kanitahɨawe 'ɨtsi hetsie yewetɨ:  
\p —Muitsexi, Muitsexi.  
\p Mɨkɨta kanita'eiya:  
\p —'Ena nepuwe.   
\p
\v 5 Kakaɨyari mɨpaɨ katinitahɨawe:  
\p —Tawarita 'enahurawa pepɨka'amieni, 'akakai kenanuyehɨnaxɨa, kwie mɨpatsie hetsie pekaniuweni.  
\v 6 Ne 'apaapa nekanikakaɨyarieyatɨni, 'Apɨrahami, 'Itsahaki meta Kakuwu.  
\p Mɨpaɨ tiu'enaka Muitsexi, kaneuyuku'eima yɨhɨxie, 'utimaka Kakaɨyari 'uxeiyaka.  
\v 7 Peru Yawé katinikuxatakaitɨni:  
\p —Yurikɨ nepɨniere kememɨte'uka'eniwa neteɨterima 'Ekipitu kwieyaritsie. Nepɨwa'enie kememɨte'uximatɨarie memɨtewa'aitɨa wahetsiemieme, nepɨtimate kememɨte'uka'eniwa.  
\v 8 Hikɨ newaxɨnake nepɨyɨane 'ekipitutari wahetsɨa, newarayewitɨnike mɨkɨ kwieyaritsie nemɨwaranuwitɨnikɨ, xeime kwie 'aixɨa mɨ'anetsie 'amakuyewatsie, retsi maxuawetsie meta xiete, nekanixatani kananeutsixi wakwieyaritsie meta hetitsixi, 'amuxeutsixi, peretseutsixi, heweutsixi meta kewutseutsixi.  
\v 9 'Ixaheritsixi wahiwari nepu'eni, meta nepɨniere 'ekipitutari kehepaɨ memɨtewananaima.  
\v 10 'Ayumieme kene'akuha'aritɨa. Nekamananunɨ'amɨkɨ Parahuni hetsɨa, pemɨwarayewitɨnikɨ 'ixaheritsixi memɨneteɨterima 'Ekipitu kwieyaritsie.   
\p
\v 11 Peru Muitsexi Kakaɨyari mɨpaɨ katiniutahɨawe:  
\p —¿Ne tita netihɨkɨ Parahuni hɨxie nemɨtaniunikɨ meta 'ixaheritsixi nemɨwarayewitɨnikɨ?   
\p
\v 12 Kakaɨyari mɨpaɨ katinitahɨawe:  
\p —Ne 'ahamatɨa nepuyeikani. Meta ne'inɨari nepɨmatsiwewirieni kename ne nehɨkɨ nemɨmatsihanunɨ'ani: Kepauka pemɨwarayewitɨni neteɨterima 'Ekipitu kwieyaritsie, yunaitɨ xeme xenetsi'ayexeiyatɨ xepakɨne 'ikɨ hɨritsie.   
\p
\v 13 Muitsexi matsi mɨpaɨ kaniutayɨni:  
\p —Xɨka neheyani 'ixaheritsixi xɨka mɨpaɨ netiwaretahɨawe: “Xe'ukiyarima wakakaɨyari pɨnetsiheyenɨ'a xehetsɨa”. ¿Kenetiwaretahɨawe xɨka mɨpaɨ meneteheta'iwawiya: “¿Keri titewa?”   
\p
\v 14 Kakaɨyari Muitsexi mɨpaɨ katiniutahɨawe:  
\p —Ne nepɨhɨkɨ kemɨ'ane nemɨhɨkɨ. Mɨpaɨ pekatiniwarekɨhɨawemɨkɨ 'ixaheritsixi: “Ne nepɨhɨkɨ, pɨnetsiheyenɨ'a xehetsɨa”.   
\p
\v 15 Hikɨ Kakaɨyari Muitsexi mɨpaɨ katiniutahɨawe:  
\p —Mɨpaɨ ketiniwaretahɨawi 'ixaheritsixi: “Yawé xe'ukiyarima wakakaɨyari 'Apɨrahami, 'Itsahaki meta Kakuwu, pɨnetsiheyenɨ'a xehetsɨa. 'Ikɨ pɨhɨkɨ kenemɨtitewa yareuyuhanemekɨ, 'ikɨ pɨhɨkɨ kenemɨtitewa naitɨ nuiwarite manuyekɨne”.  
\v 16 'Ekɨ kenemie 'ukirawetsixi keniwarekuxeɨri 'ixaheritsixi, mɨpaɨ ketiniwaretahɨawi: “Yawé xe'ukiyarima wakakaɨyari 'Apɨrahami, 'Itsahaki, Kakuwu, peyuhekɨataxɨ nehɨxie mɨpaɨ pɨnerahɨawekai: ‘Ne nepɨxexeiya, nepɨniere kexemɨtenanaimarie mana 'Ekipitu kwieyaritsie.  
\v 17 'Ayumieme mɨpaɨ nepɨtiku'eriwa nepɨxe'ayewitɨni kexemɨte'uka'eniwatsie mana 'Ekipitu. Nemɨxe'anuwitɨnikɨ kananeutsixi wakwietsie, hetitsixi, 'amuxeutsixi, peretseutsixi, heweutsixi meta kewutseutsixi. Mɨkɨ kwietsie waɨkawa retsi kanexɨaweni meta xiete.’”  
\v 18 'Ukirawetsixi 'ixaheritsixi mepɨmatsi'anu'enieni, hikɨ mɨkɨ meta 'ekɨ ti'aitame hɨxie xepeti'uni mɨpaɨ xepetiyuani: “Yawé, hepɨrayutsixi takakaɨyari kanekuyeixɨani katatinekuxatɨani. Ketaneupitɨa temɨyehukɨ haika tukari te'uhutɨ mana Yawé takakaɨyari temɨteheitimawirienikɨ”.  
\v 19 Nepɨtimate ti'aitame 'Ekipitu kiekame pɨkaxehepitɨani, waɨriyarika ne'ipitɨayuke xekanayekɨnikuni.  
\v 20 'Ayumieme netɨrɨkariya nepɨhekɨata, nepɨtiwakwinitɨani 'ekipitutari 'inɨari kenemɨtiwewieni mariwemekɨ watsata. Naitɨ mɨkɨ ranuyeyayu Parahuni pɨxepitɨani xemɨyehukɨ.  
\v 21 Peru ne neteɨterima 'ekipitutari 'aixɨa memɨtewamanikɨ nepɨwayuitɨani, mɨpaɨ xeyumamawetɨ xemɨka 'ayekɨkanikɨ 'Ekipitu kwieyaritsie.  
\v 22 Yunaitɨ 'ukarawetsixi 'ixaheritsixi mepɨtetawauxɨani wa'aurie memeutitei wahetsɨa ya tsepa ke'ane hetsɨa, 'urukɨ mɨtiwewiyatɨka meta pɨratakɨ, 'ixurikite yuniwema xemɨwaretiketɨanikɨ 'ukitsi 'ukari. Mɨpaɨ 'ekipitutari xekateniwanawairiekuni.   
\c 4  
\s1 'Inɨari Muitsexi hetsiemieme  
\p
\v 1 Muitsexi tawarita kaniuta'iwauni:  
\p —¿Keneheyɨanenita xɨka yuri mekaneteheta'eririeni xɨka mekanetsihe'enieni? ¿Keneheyɨaneni xɨka mɨpaɨ menetehahɨaweni: “Yawé 'ahɨxie pɨkaheyuhekɨataxɨ”?   
\p
\v 2 Yawé mɨpaɨ katinita'iwawiya:  
\p —¿Tita perakwe'e?  
\p Muitsexi mɨpaɨ kaniutayɨni:  
\p —Kɨye 'itsɨyari nepakwe'e.   
\p
\v 3 Yawé mɨpaɨ katinitahɨawe:  
\p —Kwiepa mɨkawenikɨ keneutatua.  
\p Muitsexi kɨye 'itsɨyari kaniutatuani kwiepa mɨkawenikɨ, hikɨ mɨkɨ kɨye 'itsɨyari kuu kanayani. Muitsexi kanitanautsakekaitɨni 'imakatɨ,  
\v 4 peru Yawé kanita'aitɨani miwiyakɨ kwaxieyatsie. Kepauka Muitsexi kuu muwiyaxɨ kwaxieyatsie, mɨkɨ kɨye kanayani.   
\p
\v 5 —'Ikɨ kanihɨkɨtɨni yuri memɨmateheta'eririeni kename ne Yawé xepaapama wakakaɨyari 'Apɨrahami, 'Itsahaki, Kakuwu ne'unehekɨataxɨ 'ahɨxie.   
\p
\v 6 Tawarita mɨpaɨ Yawé katinitahɨawe:  
\p —Hikɨta 'akamixatɨa keneukume'i.  
\p Muitsexi yukamixatɨa kaneukumeni, kepauka mewakuha mamaya nawiyari tikuyetɨ kanayani kaniutature 'ɨwi hepaɨ.   
\p
\v 7 Tawarita Kakaɨyari mɨpaɨ kaniutayɨni:  
\p —Tawarita 'akamixatɨa keneukume'i.  
\p Muitsexi tawarita yukamixatɨa kaneukumeni, kepauka mewakuha 'aixɨa kani'anekaitɨni naitɨ kemeu'anekai matɨari.   
\p
\v 8 Yawé mɨpaɨ kaniutayɨni:  
\p —Xɨka 'inɨari mexɨakame miemekɨ yuri mekate'uta'erieni, xɨari hutarieka miemekɨ.  
\v 9 Peru xɨka 'ikɨ hutame 'inɨarikɨ yuri mekamete'uta'eririeni, haa keneuhanimie Niru mieme, kenetayeuri kwiepa, kepauka haa manutateni kwiepa xuriya kanayeimɨkɨ.   
\p
\v 10 Muitsexi mɨpaɨ kaniutayɨni:  
\p —Yawé, ne hatsuaku 'aixɨa nepɨkarekuxatani, 'ikɨ pɨkati'ane takai mɨtiuyukatsutɨa 'atu mɨtiuyukatsutɨa yahikɨ penetikuhɨawekaku, heitseriemekɨ waɨriyarika nepɨtiutaxaxata.   
\p
\v 11 Yawé mɨpaɨ kaniutayɨni:  
\p —Ne nepɨhɨkɨ 'ateni nemutawewi. Ne nepɨhɨkɨ Yawé mekaheu'enanakame mɨwarayeitɨwa, mekaniuwaweme, kemɨ'ane meheuneniereme mɨwarayeitɨwa yatɨni mekaheuneniereme.  
\v 12 Kenemie, keneuyukuha'aritɨa ne nepɨmatsiparewieni pemɨtaniunikɨ nematitaxatɨani kepemutaineni.   
\p
\v 13 Hikɨ Muitsexi mɨpaɨ kaniutayɨni:  
\p —Yawé 'aku, waɨkawa nematsiwawirie xeime pɨta pemanunɨ'anikɨ.   
\p
\v 14 Hikɨ Yawé waɨkawa kaniuyeha'ani Muitsexi hetsiemieme, mɨpaɨ katinitahɨawe:  
\p —'Aixɨa kati'ane 'a'iwa 'Aruni rewi tewiyari. Ne nepɨtimate mɨkɨ 'aixɨa pɨtiuxaxata. Hikɨri kanayeyani metsikunakenetɨ, kepauka mɨmetsihexeiya 'iyarieya 'aixɨa kaneyɨmɨkɨ.  
\v 15 'Ekɨ pepɨreitaxatɨani naime kenematiutixatɨa, ne nepɨxeparewieni xemɨtiniunikɨ 'ekɨ, mɨkɨ matɨa, nepɨtixeta'ɨkitɨani kehepaɨ xemɨteyurieka.  
\v 16 Mɨkɨ putaniukani teɨteri wahɨxie 'ahetsiemieme, 'ekɨtɨtɨ pemutaineni, 'ekɨta nehetsiemieme pepɨtikuxaxatɨwani ne nemɨtikuhɨaweni hepaɨ.  
\v 17 Peru mɨkɨ pepɨkakutɨtɨmaiyani kɨye 'itsɨyari, 'ekɨ mɨkɨkɨ 'inɨari pepewewieni mamariwaweme.   
\s1 Muitsexi 'Ekipitu kaneyani  
\p
\v 18 Muitsexi mana mɨyetɨa yumune Keturu hetsɨa kaninuani. Nuaka mɨpaɨ katinitahɨawe:  
\p —Ne nepɨyemie 'Ekipitu, ne'iwama memanu'uwa. Nepɨnierimie 'akuxi xɨka mehe'uwani.  
\p Keturu mɨpaɨ katinitahɨawe:  
\p —Kenemiekuta, 'aixɨa pekereuye'ani.   
\p
\v 19 Mariyani paitɨri Yawé Muitsexi mɨpaɨ katinahɨawekaitɨni: «Kenemie 'Ekipitu, yunaitɨri mekaniukwini memɨmatsimiekukai».  
\v 20 Hikɨ Muitsexi kaniuyukuha'aritɨani yu'ɨya meta yuniwema waranutiyatsaka puxutsie 'Ekipitu kaneyani, yumamatsie Kakaɨyari 'itsɨya kanakwekaitɨni.   
\p
\v 21 Yawé Muitsexi mɨpaɨ katinahɨawekaitɨni mɨkatikuhayeikawanikɨ: «Kepauka 'Ekipitu pemunuani pepɨkatikuhayeikawani tita nematiuta'ɨkitɨa, Parahuni hɨxie 'inɨari pemɨwewienikɨ mamariwaweme. Neta 'iyarieya nepɨtseiriya neteɨterima mɨkawapitɨanikɨ.  
\v 22 Hikɨ 'ekɨ mɨpaɨ pepɨreitahɨawe nehetsiemieme Parahuni: “'Ixaheri neniwe mexɨakame kanihɨkɨtɨni.  
\v 23 Mɨpaɨ nepɨmarahɨawe keneupitɨa neniwe mɨnetsi'ayexeiyanikɨ, peru 'ekɨ pepɨka'itaunie mɨyemiekɨ. 'Ayumieme, 'aniwe mexɨakame tukarieya nekaninawairiemɨkɨ”».   
\p
\v 24 Huyeta, Yawé Muitsexi kananukunake, kutsukaku kanitaxeiya kanimienitɨma,  
\v 25 peru Tsepura tete nawaxayari 'utikweka yuniwe kaniuxiteni xieyameyatsie, hikɨ Muitsexi 'ɨkayatsie kaniuwirieni mɨpaɨ rehɨawetɨ: «Pɨkaheuyewetse nemɨ'iyɨrieka. 'Ayumieme yurikɨ 'ekɨ pepɨnekɨna 'ikɨ xuriya nemutayeurikɨ».  
\v 26 Mɨyatiɨyɨku Yawé Muitsexi kaniuhayewa, peru Tsepura yɨkɨna mɨpaɨ pɨtiuterɨwakai, «pepɨnekɨna 'ikɨ xuriya nemutayeurikɨ» xitekiya 'inɨariyarikɨ.   
\p
\v 27 Yawé 'Aruni mɨpaɨ katiniutahɨawe: «Kenemie Muitsexi kenenakimie makumawetsie paitɨ». 'Aruni kaneyani Muitsexi netaxeiya hɨritsie paitɨ Kakaɨyari manuyeika, kani'itseni.  
\v 28 Hikɨ Muitsexi 'Aruni katiniutaxatɨani naime Yawé kemɨrehɨawekai, naime 'inɨari mamariwaweme kemɨti'ɨkitɨakai.  
\v 29 Hikɨ Muitsexi 'Aruni hamatɨa 'ixaheritsixi mekaniwarukuxeɨrieni.  
\v 30 'Aruni naime katiniwarutaxatɨakaitɨni Muitsexi Yawé kemɨrehɨawekai, yunaime wahɨxie 'inɨari kaniuwewieni,  
\v 31 mɨkɨkɨ teɨteri yuri mekateniuta'erieni. Mɨpaɨ mete'u'enanaka kename Yawé waxeiyakai kememɨte'uka'eniwakai waranuku'erienikekai, 'ixaheritsixi mekaniutihɨxima'uni meta Yawé mariweme mekanayeitɨani.   
\c 5  
\s1 Matɨari Parahuni hɨxie kememɨteye'axɨa  
\p
\v 1 Mɨpaɨ metewarutahɨaweka Muitsexi 'Aruni Parahuni hɨxie mekaniti'uni mɨpaɨ mekatenitahɨawe:  
\p —Mɨpaɨ paine Yawé 'ixaheritsixi takakaɨyari: “Keniwarupitɨa neteɨterima makumawetsie paitɨ memɨyehukɨ 'ixɨarari memɨwewienikɨ nehetsiemieme kemɨnetinake”.   
\p
\v 2 Parahuni mɨpaɨ kaniutayɨni:  
\p —¿Kemɨ'ane mɨkɨ Yawé pɨhɨkɨ, para ne nemenu'enienikɨ 'ixaheritsixi nemɨwapitɨanikɨ? Ne Yawé nepɨkamate, ne nepɨkawapitɨani 'ixaheritsixi memɨyehukɨ.   
\p
\v 3 Mɨkɨta mɨpaɨ mekaniutiyuani:  
\p —Hepɨrayutsixi wakakaɨyari 'upɨtatsihanakirɨme, 'ayumieme tame haika tukari tepuhuni makumawetsiepai, Yawé temɨtehetimawirienikɨ takakaɨyari. Xɨka mɨpaɨ tekate'uyurieni waɨkawa pɨtatiukwinitɨawe, tixaɨtɨ 'upɨranɨ'ani kwiniya yatɨni pɨtatsi'ukwiwe yu'ixiparakɨ.   
\p
\v 4 Ti'aitame 'Ekipitu kiekame mɨpaɨ kaniutayɨni:  
\p —Muitsexi, 'Aruni, teɨteri xepɨkawa'uximatɨaka memɨte'uximayakakɨ. Xekenakunuaxɨa xemɨteha'uximayatsie.  
\v 5 Xekeneutimaixɨa mepɨyuwaɨkawa teɨteri 'ena 'Ekipitu, xemeta xekatewapitɨa memɨte'uximayaka.   
\p
\v 6 Mɨkɨ tukaritsie Parahuni mɨpaɨ katiniwaruta'aitɨani te'aitamete 'ekipitutari meta 'ixaheritsixi memɨtewa'aitɨa:  
\v 7 «Xɨnariya tata'ime memɨtiwewienikɨ 'ɨxa xepɨkawayetuiriwaniri, mɨkɨ mekeheiteɨxiyuni yɨkɨmana.  
\v 8 Peru xeme yaxeikɨa paɨmeme xekeniwawawirieka xɨnariya, xepɨkahenukahɨpani memɨyɨ'ɨraraxie mekanihɨkɨtɨni, 'ayumieme mɨpaɨ mekanetenikɨhɨaweni: “Ketaneupitɨa takakaɨyari temɨtemawirieyukɨ”.  
\v 9 Kwinimieme ti'uxiyakame xekeniwa'aitɨaka. Xeketeniwa'aitɨaka yamemɨte'uximayakakɨ. Mɨpaɨ 'itarika mepɨkahanu'enieni».   
\p
\v 10 Te'aitamete 'ekipitutari mekanayekɨne 'ixaheritsixi memɨtewata'aitɨanikɨ, meta teɨteri memɨtewa'aitɨa mɨpaɨ mekateniwarutahɨawe: «Parahuni mɨpaɨ kanaineni: “'Ɨxari xepɨkayetuiriyarieniri.  
\v 11 Xemeri xekaniwauyuni tsepa hakewa xemeikaxeiya, perutsɨ yaxeikɨa paɨmeme xepɨtiwewiwani kexemɨte'aitɨarie”».   
\p
\v 12 Mɨpaɨ tiuyɨku 'ixaheritsixi mekaneutayeixɨani 'Ekipitu kwieyaritsie meteheuteɨxɨtɨkaitɨ mɨraku'etsitɨretsie, 'ɨxa memɨyetuiriyarɨwakaitsiemieme.  
\v 13 Memɨtewa'aitɨa mekaniyeweiyakaitɨni mɨpaɨ metewakɨhɨawetɨ: «Xeketenaye'atɨwani kexemɨte'aitɨarie 'ɨxa xemɨyetuiriyaruwakai hepaɨ».  
\v 14 Matsita memɨte'aita Parahuni hetsɨa miemete 'ixaheritsixi memanuyetei mekaniwatiwayakaitɨni mɨpaɨ metewaku'iwawiyatɨ: «¿Titayari takai meta hikɨ xekate'aye'atɨa kepapaɨmeme xemɨ'aitɨarie, meripai xemitiwewiwakai hepaɨ?»   
\p
\v 15 Memanuyetei 'ixaheritsixi mekanekɨne Parahuni hetsɨa, mɨpaɨ mekateneitahɨawe:  
\p —¿Titayari 'ekɨ mɨyapetiwayuriene te'a'uximayatamete?  
\v 16 'Ɨxari xemɨkatatsiyetuiriwa. Mɨyatɨtɨ yaxeikɨa papaɨmeme tetewawiyarie xɨnariya, 'etsimɨpaɨmeni hepaɨ tetetiweiwa. Ti'aitame 'ateɨterima 'aixɨa mepɨkateyurie.   
\p
\v 17 Parahuni mɨpaɨ kaniutayɨni:  
\p —Xemɨyɨ'ɨraraxie, xemɨyɨ'ɨraraxie xekanihɨmetɨni. 'Ayumieme mɨpaɨ xekaniutiyuaneni: “Ketaneupitɨa Yawé takakaɨyari temɨtemawirieyukɨ”.  
\v 18 Hikɨ xekenehu xeketene'uximayaka. 'Ɨxa xepɨkayetuiriyarieniri, peru yaxeikɨa paɨmeme xepɨtiwewiwani xɨnariya.   
\p
\v 19 Te'uximayatamete memanuyetei 'ixaheritsixi mɨpaɨ mekatenetimani mexɨima katinaniuwakaitɨni, kepauka mɨpaɨ mɨtiutaniukie kename yaxeikɨa papaɨmeme meyetuayanikekai.  
\v 20 Muitsexi hetsɨa meta 'Aruni hetsɨa me'u'axɨaka kitenie memuwakwewiekai,  
\v 21 mɨpaɨ mekateniwarutahɨawe: «Yawé kexeheutixeiyaxɨani kexehanutaxɨrieni. Xeme ya'ane xeheutiwiwiexɨaku 'axatepu'ɨatɨka Parahuni hɨxie yaxeikɨa memɨte'i'uximayatsirie wahɨxie, xeme xekateniuyurieni 'ixipara xemɨwarukweitɨa memɨtatsikwinikɨ».   
\s1 Kakaɨyari yaputayɨ kename waxɨna  
\p
\v 22 Muitsexi Yawé mɨpaɨ katiniutahɨawe:  
\p —Neuxei, Yawé, ¿titayari 'ikɨ kiekari 'axapetiyuriene? ¿Mɨpaɨ mɨti'anenikɨ penereyenɨ'a?  
\v 23 Kepaukapai Parahuni hɨxie nemutaniu 'ahetsiemieme, tixaɨtɨ 'atsipɨkatiyuriwe matsi pɨta pɨwananaima 'ikɨ teɨteri memɨ'ateɨterima. 'Ekɨta 'atsipepɨkatiyuriwe pewaxɨnake.   
\c 6  
\p
\v 1 Yawé mɨpaɨ katinita'eiya:  
\p —Patsɨ pekaninierimɨkɨ kenemɨtiyurieni Parahuni hetsɨa. Netɨrɨkariya xeikɨa kanixepitɨamɨkɨ xemɨyehukɨ, netɨrɨkariyakɨ xeikɨa mɨkɨ kwieyaritsie xekanayeweiyariekuni.   
\p
\v 2 Hutarieka, Kakaɨyari Muitsexi hamatɨa katiniutaxata mɨpaɨ katinitahɨawe: «Ne Yawé nepɨhɨkɨ.  
\v 3 Ne nepɨnehekɨataxɨ 'Apɨrahami, 'Itsahaki, meta Kakuwu wahɨxie, ne Kakaɨyari Naimekɨmɨtɨrɨkaɨye, peru kenemɨtitewa yemekɨ nepɨkawarutaxatɨa, Yawé nemɨtitewa.  
\v 4 Metatsiere tɨratu tepuwewi kwie Kanani miemekɨ wahetsiemieme mayanikɨ, meripaitɨ memakutekaitsie 'ateewa kiekatari wahepaɨ me'anetɨ.  
\v 5 Meta nepɨwa'enie 'ixaheritsixi kememɨte'uka'eniwa, 'ekipitutari waɨriyarika te'uximayatamete memɨwarayeitɨakɨ, nepaye'eri tɨratu kenemɨtiuwewi.  
\v 6 'Ayumieme kenemie mɨpaɨ ketiniwaretahɨawi 'ixaheritsixi: “Ne Yawé nepɨhɨkɨ, ne nepɨxexɨna 'ekipitutari kememɨtexe'uximatɨa, ne nepɨxexɨna kexemɨte'uximayatamete, ne nepɨxexɨna waɨkawa 'inɨari newewietɨ meta mamariwawemekɨ 'aixɨa nepɨtiyurieni.  
\v 7 Ne, xeme nekiekari nepɨxe'ayeitɨani, neta xekakaɨyari. Mɨpaɨ 'ana mepɨtehetimani, kename ne Yawé nexekakaɨyari, nemɨxe'ɨxɨnaxɨ 'ekipitutari kememɨtexe'uximatɨakai.  
\v 8 Nekanixe'anuwitɨmɨkɨ kwietsie mɨpaɨ kenemɨtinehɨritɨa 'Apɨrahami, 'Itsahaki, Kakuwu, nemɨwayetuirienikekai, ne Yawé, nepɨxeyetuirieni mɨkɨ kwie mana xemɨtitenikɨ”».   
\p
\v 9 Muitsexi, 'ikɨ naime tiniwarutaxatɨani 'ixaheritsixi peru memutiwaɨripiekaikɨri, mete'uka'eniwatɨ mete'aitɨarietɨ 'ayumieme mepɨka'i'eni.  
\v 10 Hikɨ Yawé mɨpaɨ Muitsexi katiniutahɨawe:   
\p
\v 11 —Kenemie Parahuni hɨxie ti'aitame 'Ekipitu kwieyaritsie. Mɨpaɨ ketinetahɨawi, kewarupitɨani memɨyehukɨ 'ixaheritsixi mɨkɨ kwieyaritsie.   
\p
\v 12 Peru Muitsexi Yawé mɨpaɨ katiniutahɨawe:  
\p —'Ixaheritsixi matsi mepɨkanetsiheu'enieri Parahuni kenetiu'enieni meta 'aixɨa nepɨkatiuxaxata.   
\p
\v 13 Hutarieka Yawé Muitsexi 'Aruni mame kaniwarutahɨawe, 'ixaheritsixi wahetsiemieme meta Parahuni ti'aitame hetsiemieme katiniwarutaxatɨani, mɨpaɨta katiniwaruta'aitɨani 'ixaheritsixi 'Ekipitu memɨwarayewitɨnikɨ.   
\s1 Muitsexi 'Aruni wa'ukiyarima  
\p
\v 14 'Ikɨ mepakɨ 'ixaheritsixi wa'ukiyarima:  
\b  
\li1 Xuweni niwemama 'Ixaheri matɨarieya: Kanuki, Paru, Ketsiruni meta Karimi. Mɨkɨ mepɨhɨkɨ Xuweni nuiwarimama.   
\li1
\v 15 Tsimehuni niwemama: Kemueri, Kamini, 'Uhari, Kakini, Tsukaxi, meta Tsahuri maamaya kananeu tewiyari pɨhɨkɨtɨkai. Mɨkɨ mepɨhɨkɨ Tsimehuni nuiwarimama.   
\li1
\v 16 Kememɨteheuku'uxa mɨkɨ nuiwari memaka'utɨarietsie, 'ikɨ Rewi niwemama mepɨhɨkɨ: Keritsuni, Kuhati meta Merari. Xeitsienituyari heimana xeitewiyari heimana tamamata heimana 'atahuta wiyari puyuri.   
\li2
\v 17 Keritsuni niwemama wanuiwaritsie: Riwini meta Tsimi.   
\li2
\v 18 Kuhati niwemama: 'Amirani, 'Itsaxi, Hewuruni meta 'Utsiheri. Xeitsienituyari heimana xeitewiyari heimana tamamata heimana haika wiyari puyuri.   
\li2
\v 19 Merari niwemama: Makiri meta Mutsihí.  
\p 'Ikɨ Rewi nuiwarimama mepɨhɨkɨ kememɨteheku'uxa.   
\li1
\v 20 'Amirani, xeitsienituyari heimana xeitewiyari heimana tamamata heimana 'atahuta wiyari puyuri, yutetei kaniutiwitɨni Kukaweri titewakame, mɨkɨ yuhutame mekaniwarayexeiya tɨɨri: 'Aruni meta Muitsexi.   
\li1
\v 21 'Itsaxi niwemama: Kure, Nepeki meta Tsikɨri.   
\li1
\v 22 'Utsiheri niwemama: Mitsaheri, 'Eritsapani, meta Tsitiri.   
\li1
\v 23 'Aruni 'Eritsaweti kaniutiwitɨni, 'Aminarawi nu'aya Nahatsuni 'iwaya, mɨkɨ yunaukame mekaniwarayexeiya tɨɨri: Narawi, 'Awihu, 'Eriyatsaxi meta 'Itamaxi.   
\li1
\v 24 Kure niwemama: 'Atsixi, 'Erikana meta 'Awiyatsahapi. Mɨkɨ Kure nuiwarimama mekanihɨkɨtɨni.   
\li1
\v 25 'Eriyatsaxi 'Aruni nu'aya xeime kaniutiwitɨni Putiheri niweya, xeime nunutsi mekanayexeiya Pinexi mekateniterɨwa.  
\b  
\p 'Ikɨ Rewi nuiwarimama wa'ukiyarima mepakɨ, kememɨteheku'uxa memaka'utɨarietsie.   
\b  
\p
\v 26 'Aruni meta Muitsexi, mɨkɨ mepɨhɨkɨtɨkai Yawé mɨwanɨ'akai 'ixaheritsixi memɨwarayewitɨnikɨ 'Ekipitu kwieyaritsie yayupapaɨmeme.  
\v 27 'Ikɨ mepɨhɨkɨ Parahuni hɨxie memutiniu, ti'aitame 'Ekipitu kiekame hetsɨa, memɨwarayewitɨnikɨ 'ixaheritsixi 'Ekipitu kwieyaritsie.   
\s1 'Aruni, Muitsexi niukameya  
\p
\v 28 Kepauka Yawé Muitsexi hamatɨa mɨtiutaxa 'Ekipitu,  
\v 29 mɨpaɨ katinitahɨawe:  
\p —Ne Yawé nekanihɨkɨtɨni. Parahuni ti'aitame 'Ekipitu kiekame naime ketinetaxatɨa kenemɨmatitahɨawe.   
\p
\v 30 Peru Muitsexi Yawé mɨpaɨ katiniutahɨawe:  
\p —¿Neranu'enienikuta Parahuni, ne 'aixɨa nepɨkatiuxaxata?   
\c 7  
\p
\v 1 Yawé Muitsexi mɨpaɨ katiniutahɨawe:  
\p —Mɨpaɨ ketinemaika Kakaɨyari tewiyari pepayani Parahuni hɨxie. 'A'iwa 'Aruni 'aniukame payani.  
\v 2 'Ekɨ pɨ'ahɨritɨarika naime pemɨtikuxaxatɨwani kenematikuhɨaweni, 'a'iwata 'Aruni Parahuni pɨtawawirieni mɨwapitɨanikɨ memɨyehukɨ mɨkɨ kwieyaritsie.  
\v 3 Ne Parahuni 'iyarieya nepɨtseiriya tsepa 'inɨari mamariwaweme nemutiwewi 'Ekipitu.  
\v 4 Mɨkɨ pɨkaxe'enieni, hikɨ matsi ne naime netɨrɨkariya 'Ekipitu nepɨtiwewieni, mariwemekɨ netiyurienetɨ kemɨtiheitserie, nepɨwarayewitɨni kwinimieme memɨyupaɨme neteɨterima 'ixaheritsixi.  
\v 5 Kepauka ne mariweme nemɨtiyurieni 'Ekipitu kwieyaritsie, kepauka ne 'ixaheritsixi nemɨwarayewitɨni, 'ana 'ekipitutari mɨpaɨ mepɨtehetimani kename ne Yawé nehɨkɨ.   
\s1 Muitsexi 'itsɨya  
\p
\v 6 Muitsexi 'Aruni hamatɨa yamekatenikakɨne Yawé yemekɨ kemainekai.  
\v 7 Kepauka Parahuni hɨxie memutiniu, Muitsexi nauka tewiyari wiyari kanexeiyakaitɨni, meta 'Aruni nauka tewiyari heimana haika wiyari kanexeiyakaitɨni.   
\p
\v 8 Yawé Muitsexi 'Aruni mame mɨpaɨ katiniwarutahɨawe:  
\v 9 «Kepauka Parahuni 'inɨari mɨxewawirieka, 'Aruni ketineutaxatɨa, kɨye 'itsɨyari ke'utikweni kwiepa ke'ikahɨani Parahuni hɨxie. Mɨpaɨ 'ana kɨye kuu kanayeimɨkɨ».   
\p
\v 10 Muitsexi 'Aruni hamatɨa Parahuni hetsɨa mekanekɨne, mekatenaye'atɨani Yawé kemɨtiwarahɨawekai. 'Aruni yu'itsɨ nehɨani kwiepa Parahuni hɨxie meta memɨte'i'uximayatsirie wahɨxie, mɨkɨ kɨye kuu kanayani.  
\v 11 Peru Parahuni memɨtemaiwawe kaniwaruta'inienita meta memɨteyukewaiya, mɨkɨta 'awie memɨte'uyematekɨ mɨkɨ temaiwawemete yaxeikɨa mekateniuyurieni:  
\v 12 Yuxexuitɨ yu'itsɨ mekanexɨriexɨani, yaxeikɨa naitɨ kɨyexi kuuterixiyari mekanakɨne. Matsi 'Aruni kɨyeya mɨkɨ wakɨyexi yunaime kaniwarutikwani.  
\v 13 Mɨya tiuyɨku Yawé kemɨtiwarahɨawekai, Parahuni yu'iyari kaniutseiriya pɨkawaru'eni kememɨtekuxatakai.   
\s1 Xuriya kememɨte'unetɨa  
\p
\v 14 Yawé Muitsexi mɨpaɨ katiniutahɨawe: «Parahuni yu'iyari pɨtse'iriya pɨkayuwaɨri neteɨterima mɨwatatuanikɨ.  
\v 15 Kenemie ximeri mɨ'ɨwamietsie kenekwewieka Niru hatetsitayaritsie, hikɨ pekananukukemɨkɨ pe'enukunakeke 'akɨye pe'akwetɨ kuu mayeika.  
\v 16 Mana mɨpaɨ ketinetahɨawi: “Yawé hepɨrayutsixi wakakaɨyari pɨnetsiheyenɨ'a mɨpaɨ nematitahɨawekɨ: ‘Keniwarupitɨa neteɨterima memayekɨnekɨ, memɨnetsihayexeiyanikɨ humapaitɨ makumawetsiepai.’ Hikɨ pemɨka'awaɨriyakɨ,  
\v 17 Yawé mɨpaɨ kanaineni: ‘Hikɨ pepɨretimani kename ne Yawé nehɨkɨ.’ 'Ikɨ kɨye nemekwe'ekɨ haa Niru mieme nekaniwamɨkɨ, hikɨ mɨkɨ haa naitɨ xuriya kanayeimɨkɨ.  
\v 18 Tsapari yunaitɨ mekanikwikuni, haa 'axa'u'ɨatɨ kanayeimɨkɨ, 'ekipitutari mana mepɨkatihareni”».   
\p
\v 19 Yawé Muitsexi mɨpaɨta katiniutahɨawe: «'Aruni mɨpaɨ ketineutahɨawi, yu'itsɨ ke'utikweni hapa keheitatsera 'Ekipitu miemetsie, naitɨ 'akite, hamuyehapane, meta haa mukamarike mukumane xuriya mayanikɨ. Xuriya puxɨaweni naitɨ kemɨyewa 'Ekipitu kwieyaritsie, kɨyexi tsiepaitɨ, tetexi tsiepaitɨ naitɨ».   
\p
\v 20 Muitsexi 'Aruni hamatɨa Yawé mekananu'enieni kemɨtiwa'aitɨakai. Parahuni yaxeikɨata memɨte'i'uximayatsirie wahɨxie 'Aruni yɨkɨye teikɨ netsera haa Niru mieme kaniuwani. Hikɨ naitɨ haa mana mieme xuriya kanayani.  
\v 21 Tsapari mekaniukwini Niru hetsie memɨye'uwakai, haa 'axakaniu'ɨakaitɨni 'ekipitutari mana memɨhareka mepɨkayɨwawekai. Naitsarie 'Ekipitu kwieyaritsie xuriya hayari kanixuawekaitɨni.   
\p
\v 22 Yaxeikɨata temaiwawemete 'awie memɨte'uyematekɨ mɨkɨ 'ekipitutari yaxeikɨa mekateniuyurieni, mɨpaɨ Parahuni yu'iyari kaniutseiriya kemainekai Yawé kemɨtiwarahɨawekai, 'Aruni pɨka'anu'eni meta Muitsexi.  
\v 23 Wa'atɨtɨ tixaɨtɨ 'atsipɨkatiɨyɨ ta'aurie haweka yuparatsiyuta kaneyani.  
\v 24 Hikɨ 'ekipitutari putsu mekaniutiwewietɨkɨne Niru hatetsitayaritsie, haa 'aixɨa mɨ'ane mehauwautɨkaitɨ, memɨkayɨwawekaikɨri hatɨa mieme memɨtiharenikɨ.   
\s1 Temutsi kememɨte'unetɨarie  
\p
\v 25 'Atahuta tukari panukatɨa kepauka Yawé Niru hayari muwa.   
\c 8  
\p
\v 1 Yawé Muitsexi mɨpaɨ katiniuta'aitɨani: «Kenemie Parahuni hetsɨa mɨpaɨ ketinetahɨawi, Yawé mɨpaɨ paine: “Keniwarupitɨa neteɨterima memɨyehukɨ memɨnetsi'ayexeiyanikɨ.  
\v 2 Xɨka pekawarupitɨani temutsi nepɨwanetɨani naitsarie 'akwie kemɨyewa.  
\v 3 Niru hatɨayari mukwakeni hepaɨ temutsi wahekɨ puyɨneni, 'aparatsiyuta mepeutahaxɨani, pemuyehuputsie paitɨ meta 'a'itaritsie, yaxeikɨata 'ahetsɨa te'uximayatamete wakiita paitɨ, 'ateɨterima wakiita, 'ahuxunuta meta titɨxɨmete.  
\v 4 'Ahetsie mepɨtimakixɨani, 'ateɨterima wahetsie meta 'ahetsɨa memɨte'uximaya”».   
\p
\v 5 Hikɨ Yawé Muitsexi mɨpaɨ katiniutahɨawe: «'Aruni mɨpaɨ ketineutahɨawi yu'itsɨ haa manuyehapane keheutatsera, 'aki manuyehapane, harakuna mayemanetsie, naitsarie 'Ekipitu kwieyaritsie temutsi memɨtixuawerekɨ».   
\p
\v 6 'Aruni yu'itsɨ kaneutatsera haa 'ekipitu miemetetsie, temutsi mekaniutixuawere naitsarie.  
\v 7 Hikɨ temaiwawemete 'awie kememɨte'uyemate yaxeikɨa mekateniuyurieni, mɨpaɨ mete'uyurieku temutsi mekaniutixuawere naitsarie 'Ekipitu.  
\v 8 Hikɨ Parahuni, Muitsexi 'Aruni mame kaniwarutakwewieni. Mɨpaɨ katiniwarutahɨawe:  
\p —Yawé xekeneutawawiri temutsi mɨwataweiyakɨ nehetsie meta neteɨterima wahetsie, neta nepɨxepitɨani xemɨyehukɨ xemɨteheitimawirienikɨ.   
\p
\v 9 Muitsexi mɨpaɨ katinita'eiya:  
\p —Yanetineutahɨawi kepauka nepitawawirieni Yawé 'ahetsiemieme, 'ahetsɨa memɨte'uximaya meta 'ateɨterima wahetsiemieme. Temutsi Niru hatɨayaritsie mekaniyuhayewakuni xeikɨa, 'ahetsie meta 'akie mepɨkatixuawere.   
\p
\v 10 Parahuni mɨpaɨ katinita'eiya:  
\p —'Uxa'a kwitɨwa.  
\p Muitsexi mɨpaɨ kaniutayɨni:  
\p —Mɨpaɨ kaniyɨmɨkɨ, pekatinetimaimɨkɨ xewitɨ kakaɨyari kaniumaweni Yawé takakaɨyari hepaɨ 'anetɨ.  
\v 11 Temutsi mekaniyehuni mekanikumawerikuni 'ahetsie 'akiita meta 'ahetsɨa memɨte'uximaya wahetsie metatsiere 'ateɨterima wahetsie, Niru hatɨayaritsie xeikɨa mekaniyuhayewakuni.   
\p
\v 12 Yapauka mewayekɨneka Muitsexi 'Aruni matɨa Parahuni hamatɨa metehetaxataka, Muitsexi Yawé kaniutawawirieni temutsi mɨwakumaweriyakɨ Parahuni hetsɨa mɨwareyenɨ'akai.  
\v 13 Muitsexi Yawé kemɨtiutahɨawekai nenu'enieni, temutsi mekaniutayuani mekwi'itɨ, kiita, takwa meta yeuta.  
\v 14 Teɨteri mekaniwakuxexeɨriwakaitɨni wa'ɨakariyari naitɨ 'Ekipitu kanakɨnɨkaitɨni.  
\v 15 Hikɨ Parahuni 'aixɨa 'iyarieya kaniuyɨni, peru Yawé 'iyarieya kaniutseiriya, Yawé kemɨtiwarahɨawekai, Muitsexi 'Aruni mame pɨkawa'enimɨkɨkai.   
\s1 Xaipɨtsi kememɨte'unetɨarie  
\p
\v 16 Yawé Muitsexi mɨpaɨ katiniutahɨawe 'Aruni mɨpaɨ mɨtitahɨawekɨ: «'A'itsɨ keneutatsera kwiepa ketineukawaxɨa, naitɨ 'Ekipitu kwieyaritsie kwauni xaipɨtsi memayexɨrienikɨ».  
\v 17 Mɨpaɨ katiniuyurieni. Hikɨ 'Aruni yu'itsɨkɨ kwiepa katiniukawaxɨani, hikɨ kwaunitɨtɨ xaipɨtsi mekanayexɨrieni teɨteri mekaniwakukewekaitɨni meta tewaxi. Naitsarie 'Ekipitu kwieyaritsie kwauni xaipɨtsi mekanakɨne.   
\p
\v 18 Temaiwawemete 'awie memɨte'uyemate mɨpaɨtsiere mekateniyurienikekaitɨni mekaniuyutatexieni. Matsi xaipɨtsi teɨteri meta watewama mekaniwakukewekaitɨni.  
\v 19 Mɨpaɨ mekaniutiyuani temaiwawemete Parahuni hɨxie: «Yemekɨ Kakaɨyari wahamatɨa puyeika». Peru yu'iyari kaniutseiriya pɨkawaru'eni, Yawé kemɨtiwarahɨawekai.   
\s1 Nakatarixi kememɨte'utixuawerixɨ  
\p
\v 20 Yawé Muitsexi mɨpaɨ katiniutahɨawe: «'Uxa'a ximeri pekananukukemɨkɨ, Parahuni 'utɨa pekaniyemieni, hata mɨkatenitsie mɨpaɨ pekatinitahɨawimɨkɨ: “Mɨpaɨ paine Yawé: ‘Neteɨterima keniwarupitɨa memɨyehukɨ memɨnetsi'ayexeiyanikɨ.  
\v 21 Xɨka pekawarupitɨani, yɨmɨireme nakatarixi nepɨwaranunɨ'ani 'ahetsie, meta 'ahetsɨa memɨte'uximaya, 'ateɨterima wahetsie meta 'akie. Naitɨ 'ekipitutari wakiita meta kwiepa memanu'uwa mepɨtihɨne nakatarixi.  
\v 22 Kepauka mɨpaɨ mɨtiyɨni, Kutseheni xeikɨa mepɨkatixuawere, mana neteɨterima memɨtiteikɨ, 'ana mɨpaɨ pepɨretimani ne Yawé, 'ikɨ kwieyaritsie nepuyeika.  
\v 23 Yɨkɨmeteyuxexeiyame neteɨterima nepɨwarayeitɨani 'ateɨterima wahetsɨa, 'ikɨ 'inɨari mɨmariwe 'uxa'a paye'ani’”».   
\p
\v 24 Mɨpaɨ katiniuyurieni Yawé. Haiwitɨri 'a'ayetsutsuitɨ nakatexɨani Parahuni paratsiyuyatsie meta hetsɨana memɨte'uximaya wakii hetsie meta naitsarie 'Ekipitu, nakatarixi xeikɨa mekanihɨkɨakaitɨni. Nakatarixi wahekɨ 'Ekipitu kiekariyaritsie 'axakatinayeyɨni.  
\v 25 Hikɨ Parahuni, Muitsexi 'Aruni mame kaniwarutakwewieni, mɨpaɨ katiniwarutahɨawe:  
\p —Xekenehu xeketeneutimawiri yukakaɨyari 'ena 'ikɨ kwieyaritsie.   
\p
\v 26 Muitsexi mɨpaɨ kaniutayɨni:  
\p —Mɨpaɨ 'aixɨa pɨkayɨni, tame temɨtetimawa Yawé hetsiemieme 'ekipitutari wahepaɨtsita puxurikime, xɨka wahɨxie tete'utimawa wahepaɨtsita mɨkareuyewetse hepaɨ xɨari mepɨtatsitituaxa.  
\v 27 Tepɨyehukaku haika tukari te'uhutɨ makumawetsie paitɨ, mana temɨteheitimawirienikɨ Yawé takakaɨyari mɨpaɨ katatini'aitɨaka.   
\p
\v 28 Parahuni mɨpaɨ katinita'eiya:  
\p —Nepɨxepitɨani xemɨte'imawirieyukɨ Yawé yukakaɨyari humapaitɨ. Peru 'ateewapai xekahekɨkatɨ, meta xepeitawawirieni nehetsiemieme.   
\p
\v 29 Muitsexi Parahuni mɨpaɨ katiniutahɨawe:  
\p —Ne'anuyeyame 'uwa ne Yawé 'ahetsiemieme nepeitawawirieni, hikɨ 'uxa'a nakatarixi wahepaɨ memɨ'anene mepumaweni 'ahetsie, 'ahetsɨa memɨte'uximaya meta 'ateɨterima wahetsie. Perutsɨ pepɨkatatiku'itaiyani, pekatatsipitɨanike pekatiutaine temɨtemawayukɨ Yawé hetsiemieme.   
\p
\v 30 Muitsexi hewayeyaka Yawé nenewieri kaniupitɨani Parahuni hetsiemieme.  
\v 31 Yawé kani'enieni Muitsexi Parahuni hetsiemieme kemɨtitawawiriekai, nakatarixi kaniwarukumaweriya Parahunitsie. Memɨte'uximaya, meta teɨterimama wahetsie nixewitɨ pɨkayuhayewaxɨ.  
\v 32 Matsi Parahuni tawarita yu'iyari kaniutse'iriya, pɨkawarupitɨa memɨyehukɨ.   
\c 9  
\s1 Wakaitsixi kememɨte'ukwi kwiniyakɨ  
\p
\v 1 Hikɨ Yawé Muitsexi kaniutanɨ'ani, Parahuni mɨpaɨ mɨtitaxatɨanikɨ: «Mɨpaɨ kanaineni Yawé hepɨrayutsixi teɨteriyari wakakaɨyari: “Keniwarupitɨa neteɨterima memayekɨnekɨ memɨnetsi'ayexeiyanikɨ”.  
\v 2 Xɨka pekawarupitɨani memɨyehukɨ, xɨka 'akuxi pewarukununuitɨwani,  
\v 3 Yawé yɨtɨrɨkariyakɨ kwiniya pɨnetɨani 'atewama wahetsie, kawayutsixi, puxuri, kameyutsixi, wakaitsixi meta 'amuxatsi.  
\v 4 Peru Yawé 'ixaheritsixi watewama meta 'ekipitutari watewama wahamatɨa yukɨmeteyuxexeiyame pɨwarayeitɨani, 'ayumieme 'ixaheritsixi watewama nixewitɨ pɨkamɨni».   
\p
\v 5 Hikɨ Yawé tukari kaniutipini, mɨpaɨ kaniutayɨni: «'Uxa'a, ne Yawé mɨpaɨ nekatiniyurimɨkɨ 'ikɨ kwieyaritsie».  
\v 6 Mɨpaɨ katiniuyɨni, 'uxa'arieka mekaniukwini yunaitɨ 'ekipitutari watewama, peru 'ixaheritsixi watewama nixewitɨ pɨka'umɨ.  
\v 7 Hikɨ Parahuni hipame kaniwarenɨ'ani, memɨwaxeiyayukɨ 'ixaheritsixi watewama, mɨkɨ mekaniwaretaxeiya yaxeikɨa meyupaɨmeme, nixewitɨ pɨkahemɨkikai. Peru hikɨ Parahuni yu'iyari kaniutseiriya pɨkawarupitɨa memɨyehukɨ.   
\s1 Kememɨte'uti'etsataxɨ  
\p
\v 8 Merikɨtsɨ Yawé mɨpaɨ katiniwarutahɨawe Muitsexi 'Aruni mame: «Xekeniwayetuka naxi 'uxunuta mieme 'etsipeme, mɨkɨ Muitsexi teikɨ keheiwiwieni Parahuni hɨxie.  
\v 9 Mɨkɨ naxi tumuanari miyɨanitɨ kanayeimɨkɨ, kanikawiwimɨkɨ naitsarie 'Ekipitu kwieyaritsie, mekaniti'etsatakuni, teɨteri meta watewama yunaitɨ».   
\p
\v 10 Muitsexi 'Aruni matɨa naxi mekanetuni 'uxunutamieme, Parahuni hɨxie meti'uka Muitsexi kaneiwiwieni 'ekatsie, 'anari mekaniuti'etsata, teɨteri yaxeikɨata watewama.  
\v 11 Temaiwawemete mepɨkayɨwawekai Muitsexi hepaɨ memɨteyurienikɨ, mɨkɨtsɨ yunaitɨ meta mana kiekatari mekaneu'etsatɨkateitɨni.  
\v 12 Peru Yawé Parahuni 'iyarieya kaniutseiriya, Yawé Muitsexi kemɨtiutahɨawekai, 'ayumieme Parahuni Muitsexi 'Aruni mame pɨkawa'enimɨkɨkai.   
\s1 Kemɨtiukawiyexɨ teematɨ  
\p
\v 13 Merikɨtsɨ Yawé Muitsexi tawarita kanitanɨ'ani, 'uxa'arieka ximeri kaneyani Parahuni mɨtitaxatɨanikɨ: «Yawé mɨpaɨ kanaineni hepɨrayutsixi wakakaɨyari: “Keniwarupitɨa neteɨterima memɨnetsi'ayexeiyanikɨ.  
\v 14 Hikɨri 'imatɨrieka waɨkawa mariwemekɨ nepɨmatsi'anunɨ'airieni kwiniya 'ahetsiemieme, yaxeikɨata te'a'uximayatsiriwamete wahetsie, para mɨpaɨ pemɨretimanikɨ kename xewitɨ 'umawe 'ena kwiepa nehepaɨ tiyurienetɨ.  
\v 15 Xɨka hikɨ kwitɨwa mɨpaɨ netiuyurieni 'ahetsie, 'ateɨterima wahetsieta kwiniya kwi mayakamekɨ yunaitɨ xekanikwikuni.  
\v 16 Peru hikɨ nepɨmatsihayewa 'akuxi para pemɨretimanikɨ kenemɨtiyurieni, para nemukuxaxatsiwanikɨ naitsarie kwiepa.  
\v 17 'Ekɨ matsi yaxeikɨa pepɨtiyuriene, neteɨterima pekawapitɨatɨ mɨkɨ memayekɨnekɨ.  
\v 18 'Ayumieme 'uxa'a hikɨ hepaɨ 'upaukakaku, nekanenunɨ'amɨkɨ wiyeri teemakame mɨkatiyɨwekai hepaɨ hatsuaku 'Ekipitu mukamarixɨtsietɨtɨ.  
\v 19 Mexɨima ketineuta'aita 'atewama kiitɨa memɨwareuta'arienikɨ ketipaɨmeme pemɨrexeiya yeuta, yaxeikɨata teɨteri, kemɨ'ane takwa muyeikani tee hetsiena kanikaxɨrimɨkɨ kanimiemɨkɨ”».   
\p
\v 20 Hipatɨ Parahuni te'uximayatsiriwamete mekaniutimamani Yawé niukieya me'u'enieka, meyumexɨitɨatɨ kiita mekaniwareuta'ɨna yuteɨterima meta yutewama,  
\v 21 hipatɨta mepɨkahenu'eni Yawé niukieya, mepɨwaruhayewaxɨ tehɨwemete yaxeikɨata yutewama.   
\p
\v 22 Merikɨtsɨ Yawé mɨpaɨ Muitsexi katiniutahɨawe: «'Amamate teikɨ keneutitseraxɨa, para naitsarie mɨkaxɨrienikɨ tee wiyeriyari 'Ekipitu kwieyaritsie, teɨteri wahetsie yaxeikɨata wawaxata meta watewama wahetsie».   
\p
\v 23 Muitsexi yu'itsɨ 'anukukweka muyuawitsie kaneititsera, Yawé yakatiniuyurieni tee mɨkaxɨrienikɨ naitsarie 'Ekipitu: tɨranari kaneyenɨ'ani, tee wiyerimatɨ mɨkaxɨrienikɨ meta merɨkariya.  
\v 24 'Anari kaniukawiye teematɨ, kanikaxɨrɨwekaitɨni taimatɨ. Naitsarie 'Ekipitu kwieyaritsie hatsuaku mɨkareyɨwekai hepaɨ katiniuyɨni.  
\v 25 Mɨkɨ tee wiyeriyari naime katiniwareuyehɨani mɨkɨ kwieyaritsie, teɨteri meta yeutari, yaxeikɨata mɨti'etsiekai meta kɨyexite.  
\v 26 Kutseheni mɨrakutewatsie xeikɨa tee wiyeriyari pɨka'ukaxɨri hakewa 'ixaheritsixi memetitekai.   
\p
\v 27 Merikɨtsɨ Parahuni katiniwarutanɨ'airieni, Muitsexi 'Aruni mame mɨpaɨ katiniwarutahɨawe:  
\p —Ne hikɨ nepɨretima 'axakenemɨtiyuriene. Yawé 'aixɨa pɨtatsiyuriene, tame pɨta 'axatepɨteyurie neteɨterima teyunaitɨ.  
\v 28 Hawaikɨ tawariri nepɨkawakunuitɨani, nepɨwapitɨani memayekɨnekɨ, perutsɨ Yawé xekenetawawiri nehetsimieme, tɨranari meta tee wiyeriyari mɨkaxuawenikɨ.   
\p
\v 29 Mɨpaɨ kaniutayɨni Muitsexi:  
\p —Kepauka nemayeyani 'ikɨ kiekaritsie, Yawé nenewieri nepɨpitɨani, 'anari kayuwatɨ tɨranari kanitamarimɨkɨ meta tee wiyerimatɨ, mɨpaɨ pepɨretimani kename kwie Yawé tipiinieya.  
\v 30 Matsi 'akuxi ne mɨpaɨ nepɨtimate, 'ekɨri meta te'uximayatamete, xepɨka'imakaxe Yawé Kakaɨyari 'akuxi.   
\p
\v 31 Rinu 'iteɨriyari meta tsewara naitɨ putitsanixɨ, 'ariri tsewara pɨtihariximekai, meta rinu 'iteɨriyari puxutukairi.  
\v 32 Peru tɨriku xeikɨa pɨkaheuyewe, meta 'etsiperita tɨriku hepaɨ mɨ'anene, mɨkɨ pɨkamexɨa 'arike putixuxuawere.   
\p
\v 33 Merikɨte Muitsexi 'anuyeyaka Parahuni mɨtiwa'aitatsie, nenewieri Yawé kaniupitɨani, 'anari kwitɨwa kaneunuani tɨranari meta tee wiyerimatɨ, kwiepa naitsarie.  
\v 34 Kepauka munierixɨ Parahuni kawiyekakuri tee meta tɨranari meta merɨkariya kayuwatɨ putamarixi. Mɨkɨ yaxeikɨata waɨkawa tiyurienetɨ patɨa, meta te'i'uximayatsiriwamete mepɨka'uyuwaɨri hepaɨna yu'iyaritsie.  
\v 35 Yaxeikɨa puyɨ Yawé Muitsexi kemɨrehɨawekai, ti'aitame Parahuni yu'iyaritsie pɨtse'ikai pɨkawarupitɨa 'ixaheritsixi memayekɨnekɨ.   
\c 10  
\s1 'Utsikari kememɨte'utixuawerixɨ  
\p
\v 1 Hikɨ Yawé Muitsexi mɨpaɨ katiniutahɨawe: «Kenemie Parahuni ketinetaxatɨa, netsɨ nepɨtiuyuri kayuwaɨriyame nemayeitɨa meta te'i'uximayatsiriwamete wa'iyari nemutseiriyaxɨa, yanemɨtiyurienikɨ wahɨxie 'inɨari mamariwawemekɨ.  
\v 2 'Ayumieme nepɨtiuyuri para pemɨtiwataxatɨanikɨ, 'aniwema 'ateukarima 'ekipitutari kenemɨtiwarukwinitɨa, 'inɨari kenemɨtiuwewi wahetsɨa. 'Ana mɨpaɨ mepɨtehetimani kename ne Yawé nehɨkɨ».   
\p
\v 3 Muitsexi 'Aruni hamatɨa Parahuni hɨxie mekaniti'uni mɨpaɨ mekatenitahɨawe: «Yawé mɨpaɨ kanaineni, hepɨrayutsixi wakakaɨyari: “¿Kepaukake pepɨkatunumakeni nehetɨa? Keniwarupitɨa memayekɨnekɨ neteɨterima, para memɨnetsi'ayexeiyanikɨ.  
\v 4 Xɨka pekawarupitɨani memɨyehukɨ, 'uxa'a kwitɨwa 'utsikari mepɨtixuawere naitsarie 'akwietsie.  
\v 5 Yuwaɨkawatɨ mepɨtixuawere kwie pɨkayuhekɨaka, mepɨtekuxɨxɨani 'etsiwa mutiyuhayewaxɨ tee 'uxɨrieku, tinaime mepɨtekakɨme kɨyexite.  
\v 6 'Akiita mekanitahɨnikuni, te'uximayatamete wahetsɨa meta yaxeikɨa 'ekipitutari yunaime wakiita. Waɨkawa pɨtiyɨni kememɨkatenieriwawekai xepaapama kepauka kiekari memukamatsie hikɨ 'ena matimietsie 'akuxi”».  
\p Mɨpaɨ 'utayɨka Muitsexi ta'aurie kanaweni, kaniwayeyani Parahuni mɨtiwa'aitatsie.  
\v 7 Merikɨtsɨ Parahuni mɨtiwa'aitɨakai mɨpaɨ mekatenitahɨawe:  
\p —¿Kepaukake 'ikɨ pɨtihayewa tawiniyari hɨkɨtɨtɨ? Keniwarupitɨa memeuhunikɨ teɨterimama, para memeyexeiyanikɨ Yawé yukakaɨyari. 'Ekɨ xɨari 'atsipepɨkatimate mepɨte'uka'eniwa 'ekipitutari.   
\p
\v 8 Parahuni katiniwarutanɨ'airieni, Muitsexi 'Aruni mame, mɨpaɨ katiniwarutahɨawe:  
\p —Xekenehu Yawé nenewieri xekenepitɨayu yukakaɨyari. Kemɨ'ane xemɨyehu yaxekeneteneutahɨawi.   
\p
\v 9 Muitsexi mɨpaɨ kaniutayɨni:  
\p —Teyunaitɨ tekaniyehuni, temari meta 'ukirawetsixi tahetsɨamiemete yaxeikɨata mepɨtatsi'anuweiya 'ukitsi 'ukari taniwema, tatewamata muxatsi meta wakaitsixi, 'ixɨararitsɨ tekanewewikuni Yawé hetsiemieme.   
\p
\v 10 Parahuni mɨpaɨ kaniutayɨni:  
\p —Yawé xehamatɨa keheyeikani, xɨka nexe'upitɨani xemɨyehukɨ xe'ɨitama yunaime meta xeniwema. Puyuhekɨa heitseriemekɨ xepɨka'utiyuane.  
\v 11 Kemɨtixenake mɨpaɨ pɨkatiyɨni. Xɨka xeniu Yawé xehetahɨawikuni 'ukitsi xeikɨa xekenehu.  
\p Muitsexi 'Aruni hamatɨa mekaniwayexɨriyani Parahuni mɨtiwa'aitatsie.  
\v 12 Merikɨte Yawé mɨpaɨ Muitsexi katiniutahɨawe: «'Amamá keneutatsera naitsarie 'Ekipitu, memɨ'axɨanikɨ 'utsikari naitsarie kwiepa mɨtixuawe memɨtekakɨmekɨ meta naime tee wiyeriyari mɨtiuhayewaxɨ».   
\p
\v 13 Muitsexi yu'itsɨ kaniutatsera 'Ekipitu kwieyaritsie naime, Yawé mɨpaɨ katiniuyurieni mɨkɨ tukaritsie kaniu'ekakaitɨni meta tɨkarikɨ, mɨkɨ 'eka tau manatineikatsie patineikakai. Hutarieka mukatarixɨtsie 'eka kaniwa'atɨani 'utsikari,  
\v 14 naitsarie mekaniutixuawere mɨkɨ kwieyaritsie. Mekaniyumɨirekaitɨni hatsuaku mɨkareyuwekai hepaɨ, tawari mɨpaɨ pɨkatiyɨni.  
\v 15 Mepɨyumɨirekai tekɨmemete, kwiepa pɨka'akuhekɨakai mɨkɨ tinaime mekateniukuxɨxɨani, 'iteɨrite meta 'ikwaxite naime muhayewakai tee wiyeriyari, naitsarie 'Ekipitutsie tupiriyate tixaɨ mepɨkate'uhayewaxɨ.   
\p
\v 16 Parahuni yumexɨitɨatɨ pɨtiwarutanɨ'airi Muitsexi 'Aruni mame, mɨpaɨ katiniwarutahɨawe: «'Axanepɨtiuyuri Yawé mɨxekakaɨyari hetsɨa, yaxeikɨata xehetsɨa.  
\v 17 Ne nepɨxewawirie xemɨneteheuyehɨwiriekakɨ ke'axanemɨtiuyuri tawarita, meta Yawé yukakaɨyari xekenetawawiri tsikere ne nekie makumawenikɨ 'etsiwa».   
\p
\v 18 Hikɨ kepauka mɨwayetɨa Muitsexi Parahuni hɨxie, Yawé putawawiri Parahuni hetsiemieme.  
\v 19 Hikɨ Yawé 'eka kaniupata, meta karima puku'ekaxɨ tau makayuyuipiketsie 'atineka pɨwareuta'enitsitɨa 'utsikari, Haramara Mɨxeta hetsie pɨwareutaxɨri. Hikɨ naitsarie 'Ekipitu kwieyaritsie mepukumawerixɨ 'utsikari.  
\v 20 Peru yaxeikɨa Yawé Parahuni 'iyarieya putseiriyaxɨ, pɨkawarupitɨa memayekɨnekɨ 'ixaheritsixi teɨteriyari.   
\s1 Yɨriya 'uximatɨarikayari  
\p
\v 21 Yawé Muitsexi mɨpaɨ katiniutahɨawe: «'Aheima keneme'i muyuawitsie, naitsarie mɨkɨyɨrekɨ waɨkawa yemekɨ yumayɨinɨatɨ».  
\v 22 Muitsexi yumamatekɨ teikɨ kanemeni muyuawitsie, 'ana haika tukari kaniukuyɨre kwinimieme 'Ekipitu kwieyaritsie.  
\v 23 Mɨkɨ tukaritsie 'ekipitutari mepɨkayuxeiyakai, hawaikɨ meuyani pɨkayɨwekai. Matsi 'ixaheritsixi wakiita hekɨariya puxuawekai.   
\p
\v 24 Hikɨ Parahuni Muitsexi katiniutanɨ'airieni, mɨpaɨ katinitahɨawe:  
\p —Xekeneuhuni Yawé xekenayexeiyani. Yuniwema xekeniwarawitɨtɨ, muxatsi meta wakaitsixi xekeniwaruku'eirieka.   
\p
\v 25 Muitsexi mɨpaɨ katinitahɨawe:  
\p —Kamɨtsɨ 'ekɨ mawari temewewienikɨ petatiyetuirieni, Yawé takakaɨyari mawari temewewirienikɨ,  
\v 26 matsi tatewama tahamatɨa mekaniyehuni. Hawaikɨ xeikarutsayaritɨma pɨkayuhayewa. Tame mawari temewewienikɨ Yawé takakaɨyari hetsiemieme peuyewetse tatewama wahetsie temɨwaranayehapani, peru 'atsitepɨkatemate kemɨ'ane temɨwayurieni muwapaike teheta'axɨame.   
\p
\v 27 Perutsɨ Yawé yaxeikɨa pɨtiuyuri Parahuni 'iyarieyatsie, mɨkɨ pɨkawarupitɨa memɨyehukɨ,  
\v 28 matsi karima Muitsexi mɨpaɨ pɨtiuhiwi:  
\p —Kenanuyeye'a. 'Amarima 'aixɨa tawarita 'uwa pepɨkahamieni nehetsɨa peye'anike. Kepauka tawarita nehetsɨa pemɨye'ani pekanimieriemɨkɨ.   
\p
\v 29 Muitsexi mɨpaɨ katinita'eiya:  
\p —'Aixɨa pekanaineni. Hatsuakuri 'ahetsɨa nepɨkahayeneni.   
\c 11  
\s1 Tɨɨri mexɨakate wakwiniya  
\p
\v 1 Merikɨtsɨ Yawé Muitsexi mɨpaɨ katiniutahɨawe: «Tawarita nepenunɨ'airieni kwiniya Parahuni, yaxeikɨata 'ekipitutari wahetsiemieme, mɨpaɨ tiyɨyu pɨxepitɨani xemɨyehukɨ. Kepauka mɨpaɨ mɨtiyɨni, pɨxe'anuyeweiya yuheyemekɨ.  
\v 2 Mɨpaɨ ketiniwaretahɨawi 'ateɨterima yunaime, mɨkɨ 'ukitsi meta 'ukari meketewaretawawirieni, xe'aurie memekutetɨka huru meta pɨrata».   
\p
\v 3 Yawé yakatiniuyurieni 'ekipitutari 'ixaheritsixi 'aixɨa memɨtewaxeiyakɨ, Muitsexi matsi naitsarie 'aixɨa pɨtimatiwakai, Parahuni te'uximayatametemama meta 'aixɨa mepɨte'ixeiyakai.   
\p
\v 4 Muitsexi mɨpaɨ katiniwarutahɨawe: «Yawé mɨpaɨ kanaineni: “Tɨkari hixɨapa 'Ekipitu naime nepayekexiya,  
\v 5 yunaitɨ tɨɨri mexɨakate 'ekipitutari mekanikwikuni: Parahuni matɨarieya hikɨ 'uwenitsie mayerɨni hetsie metsutɨtɨ murinatsie ti'uximayatame nu'ayatsie paitɨ me'u'atɨ, yaxeikɨata watewama mexɨakate memutinunuiwaxɨ.  
\v 6 Naitsarie 'Ekipitu kwieyaritsie hiwerika putixuawere, kemɨkatiyɨwekai pɨtiyɨni.  
\v 7 Peru 'ixaheritsixi wahetsɨa tsɨkɨ pɨkahetaha'ani. Mexɨakate teɨteri meta watewama tɨma mepɨkatekwini. 'Anari mɨpaɨ xepɨtehetimani Yawé yɨkɨmeteyuxexeiyame pɨwarayeitɨani 'ixaheritsixi 'ekipitutari wahamatɨa.  
\v 8 Yunaitɨ mɨkɨ 'ahetsɨa te'uximayatamete mekanenanukuwaukuni, metitunuma'utɨ mɨpaɨ mepɨnetetatsuariwiya: ‘'Ari keneumieni, yunaime pewarawitɨtɨ keyupaɨmetɨ mematsi'aweiya.’ Kepauka mɨpaɨ mɨtiyɨni ne nekaniyemieni”».  
\p Hikɨ Mutsexi waɨkawa ha'atɨ kaniwayeyani Parahuni mɨtiwa'aitatsie, mɨpaɨ 'utaitɨ.  
\v 9 Yawé Muitsexi mɨpaɨ katiniutahɨawekaitɨni kename Parahuni kahenu'enienikekai, meta kename mɨpaɨ matsi reuyewekai, Yawé mariweme mɨtiyurienikɨ 'Ekipitu waɨkawamexɨa.   
\p
\v 10 Muitsexi 'Aruni matɨa 'inɨari 'ikɨ mɨmamariwawe mepuwewi Parahuni hɨxie, peru Yawé 'iyarieya putseiriyaxɨ, mɨkɨ kwieyaritsie memayekɨne 'ixaheritsixi pɨkawarupitɨa.   
\c 12  
\s1 Patsikwa 'ikwaiyari  
\r (Mem 12:14-20 – Maw 23:4-8, 'Inɨa 28:16-25, Hut 16:1-8)  
\p
\v 1 Merikɨtsɨ 'Ekipitu kwieyatrisie Yawé katiniwarutaxatɨani Muitsexi 'Aruni mame. Mɨpaɨ katiniwarutahɨawe:  
\v 2 «'Ikɨ metseriyari xehetsiemieme mauyewetse yemekɨ pɨhɨkɨtɨni, 'ikɨ mexɨakame metseriyaritsie xeiwiyari 'aye'axekaku.  
\v 3 Yunaime 'ixaheritsixi wahamatɨa xeketenetixata, mɨpaɨ xeketeniwaretahɨawi 'ikɨ metseriyaritsie tamamata tukariyaritsie yunaitɨ xeinuiwari memukutetɨkatsie yuxexuime muxatsi mepɨwakwini.  
\v 4 Xɨka xeme hipatɨ xekayumɨireni xeime muxa xemitaxɨnikɨ xekayɨwaweniri, pɨyɨweni matsi mɨwarumini 'ahurawa kiekatari yu'iwama, me'itaxɨweme teɨteri kememɨyupaɨmeni yuxexuitɨ mekeheitatuixɨani me'itixɨwaweme.  
\v 5 Tewaxi xeiwiyari mepexeiyatɨkani, tsepa muxa ya tsipu 'aixɨa 'anekame.  
\v 6 Mɨkɨ mepɨwa'ɨwiyani, tamamata heimana nauka tukari 'ikɨ metseriyaritsie, mɨkɨ tukaritsie mepɨwatimawa 'ixaheritsixi taikai kuyɨreyu.  
\v 7 Meta xuriya xepɨkwewieni yapapaɨmeme, xemitiwirienikɨ kitenie kɨyeyaritsie meta manuyekatsie, kiita hakewa muxa xemetakwani.  
\v 8 Mɨkɨ tɨkaritsie kwitɨwa xepitikwani wai warɨkarietɨkaime, tupiriya matsiwi meta paa mɨkakuxanariyarietɨka matɨa.  
\v 9 Hawaikɨ yuime xepɨkakwaka meta 'etsariekame, matsi pɨta warɨkariekame tɨtsie, mu'uya naime 'ɨkateya mamateya meta kwinuriteya naime.  
\v 10 Tixaɨtɨ xepɨkatekuhayeikawani. Xɨka xe'itatexieni, 'uxa'arieka xekanitataiyakuni.  
\v 11 Mɨkɨ muxa mɨpaɨ xekatenikwaikuni: yukamixa xehanakatɨtɨkaitɨ hixɨapa xehayɨhɨatɨkaitɨ, yukakaitsie xe'u'utɨ, 'itsɨ xe'u'ɨtɨ meta mexɨima xekanitakwaikuni. 'Ikɨ Patsikwa Yawé hetsiemieme kanixatsiwani.   
\p
\v 12 »Mɨkɨ tɨkariyaritsie 'Ekipitu kwieyaritsie nekaniye'amɨkɨ, yunaime tɨɨri mexɨakate nekaniwakwimɨkɨ, yaxeikɨata tewaxi meta nekaniwaranutaxɨrimɨkɨ kakaɨyarixi 'Ekipitu miemete, ne Yawé nekanihɨkɨtɨni.  
\v 13 Xuriya kani'inɨaritɨkamɨkɨ kemɨ'ane kiita xemayetetɨkani, kepauka nemixeiya 'ateewa nepuyeyani. Hikɨ kepauka nemɨwakwini 'ekipitutari, nixewitɨ kwiniya xehetsie pɨkaye'ani mɨtiyumemiwa.   
\p
\v 14 »'Ikɨ tukari 'aitsikayarikɨ xekena'eriwani yuheyemekɨ: 'Ikɨ 'ixɨarari kanihɨkɨtɨni Yawé hetsiemieme, 'uxa'atɨniwarie xeniwema mɨpaɨ meketeyurieka.  
\v 15 'Atahuta tukari paa mɨkakuxanariyarie xekanikwakakuni, xeme mexɨakame tukaritsie tikuxanariyame yukiita xekaniwayewiwikuni. Kemɨ'ane mitikwani heiwa mɨkɨ 'atahuta tukaritsie mɨkɨ 'ixaheritsixi watsata kananuyehɨiyamɨkɨ.  
\v 16 Mexɨakame tukaritsie 'ixɨarari patsiekamekɨ xepuyukuxeɨrieni, meta tawari 'atahuta tukaritsie. Mɨkɨ tukaritsie tixaɨtɨkɨtɨma xepɨkate'uximayaka, xeikɨa pɨyɨweni yu'ikwai mɨtiukawewieni yuxexuitɨ ketipaɨmeme xemɨtekwa'a. Mɨkɨ xeikɨa xemɨtewewieka pɨyɨweni.   
\p
\v 17 »Paa mɨkakuxanariyarietɨka 'ixɨarariyari xekaniwewiekuni, mɨkɨ tukaritsie nemɨxe'ayewitɨkɨ 'Ekipitu yaxeyupapaɨmeme. 'Inɨari niukiyari mɨpaɨ paineni, 'uxa'atɨniwarie xeniwema mɨpaɨ mepɨteyurieka mepetinenetɨwani mɨkɨ tukaritsie.  
\v 18 Paa mepɨtikwani mɨkakuxanariyarietɨka tamamata heimana nauka tukariyaritsie mexɨakame metseriyaritsie taikai me'itsutɨame xeitewiyari heimana xewi taikaiyaritsie 'utiniereme, mɨkɨ metseritsie.  
\v 19 'Atahuta tukari xepɨkaheixeiyani tikuxanariyame yukie. Kemɨ'ane tikuxanariyamekɨ mɨtiukwani, tsepa 'ateewapai kiekame yatɨni 'ixaheri tewiyari mɨhɨkɨ, mɨkɨ 'ixaheritsixi wahamatɨa pɨkayuhayewani.  
\v 20 Tixaɨtɨ tɨma xepɨkatekwaka tikuxanariyame mɨtinɨ'ɨ. Tsepa hakewa xeme'uwani, xepeitikwani paa kakuxanariyariekame».   
\p
\v 21 Hikɨ Muitsexi kaniwaruta'inieni yunaime 'ixaheritsixi wa'ukiyarima mɨpaɨ katiniwarutahɨawe: «Yapauka yukuraruta xekenehu muxatsi xekeniwaranuyehapani yutɨɨriyama wahetsiemieme, xekeniwarukuya Patsikwa 'ixɨarariyari xemɨwewienikɨ.  
\v 22 Xeimanukuyarikɨ tupiriya xekeneutihawiyaka muxa xuriyayakɨ yukii kitenieyaritsie matiwetɨkatsie xekeneutiwiri meta manuyekatsie, 'ana xewitɨ pɨkahewayeyeikani 'uxa'ariekake ximeri.  
\v 23 Kepauka Yawé, mana muyeyani kiekaritsie mɨwakwinikɨ 'ekipitutari. Mɨkɨ pixeiya kitenie xuriyakɨ ra'utɨkaime 'ana yateewa puyeyani, 'ana pɨka'ipitɨani yunɨ'ari mɨtiyumemiwa, muwa pɨkaheutahani mɨxekwinikɨ.   
\p
\v 24 »Yaxeketenekakɨni 'ikɨ kenemɨtixekɨhɨawe. 'Ikɨ 'inɨari niukiyari yuheyemekɨ pɨhɨkɨtɨni xehetsiemieme meta xeniwema wahetsiemieme.  
\v 25 Kepauka kwiepa xemeta'axɨani kwie Yawé mɨxexatɨatsie, xeme mɨpaɨ xepɨtehekahuni 'ikɨ yeiyaritsie.  
\v 26 Kepauka memɨxeku'iwawiyani xeniwema: “¿Ketita ti'inɨariyari xeme xehetsiemieme 'ikɨ yeiyari?”,  
\v 27 mɨpaɨ xepɨtewata'eiya: “'Ikɨ mawari Patsikwa 'ixɨarariyari Yawé hetsiemieme pɨhɨkɨ, kepauka 'Ekipitu 'ixaheritsixi wakii 'aurie puyetɨa yateewa. Pɨwarukwi mɨkɨ 'ekipitutari, peru tame taniwema pɨwarutawikweitsitɨa”».  
\p Mɨpaɨ mete'u'enanaka 'ixaheritsixi Yawé hɨxie mekaniukahɨxima'uni,  
\v 28 hikɨ yamekatenikakɨne Yawé Muitsexi meta 'Aruni kemɨtiwarahɨawekai.   
\s1 Mexɨakate tɨɨri kememɨte'ukwi 'Ekipitu  
\p
\v 29 Hikɨ tɨkari hixɨapa Yawé kaniwarukwini yunaime tɨɨri mexɨakate mana kiekatari, yunaitɨ yaxeikɨa katiniwaruyurieni meta Parahuni nu'aya meta pɨretsutsixi waniwema mexɨakate, meta tewaxi waniwema mexɨakate.  
\v 30 Yunaitɨ 'Ekipitu kiekatari mepanuku'ui mɨkɨ tɨkaritsie, yaxeikɨa Parahuni meta te'i'uximayatsiriwamete, waɨkawa putixuawerixɨ hiwerika mɨkɨ kiekaritsie. Hawaikɨ pɨkahekumawekai 'ekipitutari wakiita naitsarie mepuxuawekai mekwikwi'itɨ.   
\p
\v 31 Hikɨ mɨkɨ tɨkaritsie kwitɨwa Parahuni pɨtiwarutanɨ'airi Muitsexi 'Aruni mame, mɨpaɨ pɨtiwarutahɨawixɨ: «Xekeneuhuni 'ateewapai. Xekenayekɨni nekiekaritsie xeme meta 'ixaheritsixi. Yawé xekenayexeiyani, xemɨnetekɨhɨawe hepaɨ.  
\v 32 Xeketeniwara'arietɨ yumuxatsi meta yuwakaitsixi xemutiyuane hepaɨ, peru 'ariri xeiya xekeneuhuni, xɨka mɨpaɨ xe'uyɨni ne 'aixɨa nekani'itɨariemɨkɨ».   
\p
\v 33 'Ekipitutari, mepɨwamexɨitɨakai 'ixaheritsixi mɨkɨ kwieyaritsie memayekɨnekɨ. Mɨpaɨ meputiyuanekai: «Xɨka mekahekɨne tame tekanikwikuni».  
\v 34 Hikɨ 'ixaheritsixi, mepikuha'aritɨa yutɨxi 'akuxi kakuxanariyariekame, me'iti'eimaka yu'ixurikitekɨ, mekaneitɨni.  
\v 35 Meta, 'ekipitutari mepɨte'utawawiyarie Muitsexi kemɨtiwaruta'aitɨakai 'ixaheritsixi, hurukɨ meta pɨratakɨ mɨtiwewiyatɨka meta 'ixurikite 'aixɨa mɨti'anene mekateniwarutawawirieni.  
\v 36 Yawé 'ekipitutari yapɨtiwaru'iyaritɨa 'ixaheritsixi memɨwatinenimayatakɨ, mɨkɨ mepɨtewarumi ketita memɨte'utawau. Mɨpaɨ 'ixaheritsixi 'ekipitutari mepɨtewarunawairi tinaime.   
\s1 Kememɨte'ayekɨ  
\p
\v 37 'Ixaheritsixi Xamɨtsexi mekanayekɨne, Tsukuti hepa mekanekɨne. Meka'inɨaritɨ 'ukari meta tɨɨri, 'ataxewi tsienituyari miriyari (600.000) mekaniyupaɨmekaitɨni 'ukitsi yɨ'ɨkama memuhukai.  
\v 38 Mɨkɨ meta wahamatɨa mekanayekɨne yuwaɨkawatɨ hipatɨ teɨteri meta yumɨiretɨ tewaxi, muxatsi meta wakaitsixi.  
\v 39 'Ekipitu tɨxi memeiyetɨkai mɨkɨkɨ paa mɨkakuxanariyarietɨka mekaniutiwewieni, mɨkɨ tɨxi 'akuxi pɨkatsinakai. Memayeweiyariekɨ 'Ekipitu, 'ayumieme tukari mepɨkahehɨi, yu'ikwai memekawewienikɨ.   
\p
\v 40 'Ixaheritsixi teɨteriyari 'Ekipitu mepɨtitekai, nauka tsienituyari heimana xeitewiyari heimana tamamata wiyari.  
\v 41 Merikɨte mɨpaɨ paɨmetɨ wiyari 'aye'aku Yawé kaniwarayewitɨni yuteɨterima 'Ekipitu.  
\v 42 Mɨkɨ tɨkaritsie Yawé pɨkakutsukai 'ixaheritsixi wa'ɨwiyatɨ 'Ekipitu mɨwarayewitɨnikɨ. 'Ayumieme xemeta nuiwarite xepɨkakutsuni temanutihutsie mɨpaɨ xeketeneyurieka, mɨkɨ tɨkariyaritsie xehe'eriwatɨ meripaitɨ kemɨtiuyuri Yawé xehetsiemieme.   
\s1 Kemɨtikuyɨne Patsikwa hetsiemieme  
\p
\v 43 Yawé mɨpaɨ katiniwarutahɨawe Muitsexi 'Aruni mame: «Mɨpaɨ xekatenikakɨnikuni Patsikwa 'ixɨarariyari hetsiemieme:  
\p »Nixewitɨ teewatanaka mana pɨkatikwaka.   
\p
\v 44 »Mana memɨtekwaka mekaniyɨwaweni te'a'uximayatsiriwamete 'atuminikɨ pemɨwarutinanai, peru xɨka xitekiya 'inɨariyari pewaruwewirieni meripaitɨ.   
\p
\v 45 »Nixewitɨ ti'uximayatame mɨtikwaka pɨkayɨwe yapaɨmexɨa mana muta'axe, meta ti'uximayatame tumini mɨ'iwane.   
\p
\v 46 »Patsikwa 'ixɨarariyari kiita kanikwaiwani, meta pɨkayɨwe takwa wai 'etsipeme mɨwayetuni. Yaxeikɨata nixeime 'ume xepɨka'anumurani xemimawa 'umeyari.   
\p
\v 47 »Yunaitɨ 'ixaheritsixi peuyewetse memiwewieni Patsikwa 'ixɨarariyari.   
\p
\v 48 »Yunaitɨ teewanarixi xehamatɨa memutetɨka xɨka xewitɨ Patsikwa 'ixɨarariyari heuwewimɨkɨni Yawé hetsiemieme, kaniyɨweni meri yuniwema xitekiya 'inɨariyari mɨwawewirieni yunaime 'ukitsi, 'anake pɨyɨweni Patsikwa 'ixɨarariyaritsie mɨtiukwani xekwieyaritsie munuiwakametɨni hepaɨ.  
\p »Xɨka ka'inɨaritɨarieka xitekiyakɨ pɨkayɨwe mɨtikwaka.   
\p
\v 49 »'Ikɨ 'inɨari niukiyari 'ena nuiwakate pɨwahetsiemiemetɨni meta teewanarixi xehamatɨa memɨtitei».   
\p
\v 50 Yunaitɨ 'ixaheritsixi yamepɨtekakɨ Yawé Muitsexi 'Aruni mame kemɨtiwarahɨawekai.  
\v 51 Kwitɨwa mɨkɨ tukaritsie Yawé pɨwarayewitɨ 'ixaheritsixi 'Ekipitu kwieyaritsie, meyumɨireme.   
\c 13  
\s1 'Ixaheritsixi kememɨte'uyuri yuniwema mexɨakate wahekɨ  
\p
\v 1 Merikɨtsɨ Yawé Muitsexi mɨpaɨ katiniutahɨawe:  
\v 2 «Mepatsiekame keniwarayeitɨa matɨari memutinunuiwaxɨ. Nehetsɨa mekanimiemetetɨni yunaitɨ mexɨakate 'ixaheritsixi meta xetewama matɨari 'ukitsi memɨtinunuiwa».   
\p
\v 3 Muitsexi mɨpaɨ katiniwarutahɨawe yunaime 'ixaheritsixi: «Xekena'eriwani 'ikɨ tukari kepauka xemayekɨ 'Ekipitu, hakewa xemɨtehe'uximayakai xekatehepitɨarietɨ meta hakewa Yawé mɨxehayewitɨ yutɨrɨkariyakɨ yatiyurienetɨ. Paa xepɨkakwaka kuxanariyariekame.  
\v 4 Xeme hikɨ xekanayekɨnikuni, 'ikɨ weiya\f + \fr 13:4 \ft Hepɨrayukɨ \fq 'Awiwi\ft  panuyɨne.\f* metseriyaritsie.  
\v 5 Mɨkɨ metseriyaritsie meta xekaneiwewikuni 'ixɨarari, kepauka Yawé mɨxeheta'atɨani kwie xe'ukiyarima mɨwaruxatɨatsie kename wayetuirieni. Kanixatsiwani kananeutsixi wakwietsie, meta hetitsixi, 'amuxeutsixi, heweutsixi meta kewutseutsixi: kwiepa hakewa retsi waɨkawa meta xiete maxuawe.  
\v 6 'Atahuta tukari xekanitikwaikuni paa kakuxanariyarietɨkaime, 'atahutariekatsie tukari 'ixɨarari Yawé hetsiemieme xepɨwewieni.  
\v 7 Xemanu'uwa pɨtiumaweni tixaɨtɨ tikuxanariyame tinɨtɨ. Hawaikɨ yemekɨ tikuxanariyame xepɨkahexeiyani. Xekanitikwaikuni paa kakuxaxanime mɨkɨ 'atahuta tukari.   
\p
\v 8 »Mɨkɨ tukaritsie yuniwema mɨpaɨ xepɨtewatahɨawe: “'Ikɨ mɨya temɨteyurie Yawé hetsiemieme tekateniyurieka, kemɨtiuyuri tahetsiemieme 'Ekipitu kepauka temayekɨtsie”.  
\v 9 'Ikɨ pɨ'inɨaritɨni xehetsiemieme xemamatsie ya xekanata pɨxehaye'eritɨwani kename, Yawé niukieya xeteta payekani mɨkɨ 'Ekipitu mɨxe'ayewitɨ, waɨkawa yutɨrɨkariyakɨ tiyurienetɨ.  
\v 10 Xeiwiyari 'anuyeyeikakaku, mɨkɨ tukaritsie 'ikɨ 'inɨari niukiyari xepaye'atɨwani.   
\p
\v 11 »Kepauka Yawé mɨxeheutahatɨani kananeutsixi wakwietsie meta xɨka 'ari xeyetuirieni, kemɨtixe'utahɨawixɨ xeme meta xe'ukiyarima,  
\v 12 xekaniyetuiriekuni yunaime mexɨakate meta tewaxi waniwema matɨari miemete 'ukitsi, mɨkɨtsɨ Yawé hetsiemieme mekanihɨkɨtɨni.  
\v 13 Puxu niweya mexɨakame mitawikweitsitɨani pɨyɨwe xeime muxakɨ, xɨkate ka'utawikweitsitɨarieni, yukɨipitɨa pɨwamurarieni. Xemeta yaxeikɨa yunaitɨ yuniwema mexɨakate meta yunuiwarima xemɨwatawikweitsitɨani peuyewetse.   
\p
\v 14 »'Uxa'atɨni warie, kepauka memɨxeteta'iwawiya xeniwema: “¿'Ikɨta tita ti'inɨariyari?”, mɨpaɨ xepɨtewatahɨawe: “Yawé waɨkawa mariweme tiyurienetɨ pɨtatsi'ayewitɨ 'Ekipitu kwieyaritsie hakewa waɨriyarika temɨtehe'aitɨariekai.  
\v 15 Kepauka Parahuni ti'aitame mɨkatatsihepitɨa temayekɨnekɨ, Yawé tɨɨri mexɨakate pɨwarekwi yunaime 'ekipitutari, yaxeikɨata watewama mexɨakate. 'Ayumieme Yawé tatewama mexɨakate 'ukitsi tepitimawiriwa, mɨpaɨ taniwema mexɨakate tepɨtewarutawikweitsitɨwa”.  
\v 16 Mɨkɨ pɨ'inɨaritɨni xemamatsie yatɨni xekanata, Yawé mɨxe'ayewitɨ 'Ekipitu yutɨrɨkariyakɨ tiyurienetɨ».   
\s1 Kememɨte'anukɨ Haramara Mɨxetatsie  
\p
\v 17 Kepauka Parahuni mɨwarupitɨa memɨyehukɨ 'ixaheritsixi, Kakaɨyari pɨkawarewitɨ piritsiteutsixi wakwietsie, mana matsi pehurakai, mɨpaɨ pɨtiu'eri: «Xɨka mehetakwi'iwa mepetimamani mepeyuti'iyaritɨani 'Ekipitu mepakunuaxɨani yu'utɨma».  
\v 18 'Ayumieme pɨwarewitɨ makumawetsie 'ateewapai watatunitsitɨanike, mekanekɨne Haramara Mɨxeta hepatsie.  
\p 'Ixaheritsixi mekanayekɨne 'Ekipitu memeuyukwiyuni hepaɨ meteheuku'utɨ.  
\v 19 Muitsexi Kutse 'umeyariteya kane'ɨni, kemɨtiwaruhɨritɨakai 'ixaheritsixi teɨteriyari. Kutse mɨpaɨ kaniutayɨkaitɨni: «Mɨpaɨ xeketenemaika Kakaɨyari kanayenemɨkɨ xeparewienike. Kepauka mɨpaɨ mɨtiyɨni, ne'umete xekenanu'ɨi».   
\p
\v 20 'Ixaheritsixi mekanayekɨne Tsukuti mɨrakutewatsie, 'Etami mekaniu'axɨani, makumawe mɨyetsutɨtsie.  
\v 21 Tukarikɨ, Yawé kaniumiekatɨni wahɨxie haiwitɨritɨtɨ, 'a'uwetɨ waxeitsitɨatɨ huye kemɨreuyune, yɨwikɨtata pɨwahekɨariwiyakai tai 'a'uwetɨ panuyekatei xawatɨtɨ. 'Ayumieme mepɨyɨwawekai memuhunikɨ tukarikɨ meta tɨkarikɨ.  
\v 22 Hatsuaku pɨkatiuhayewaxɨ hai 'amuyekatei teɨteri waruwitɨximetɨ tukarikɨ meta tai 'amuwekai yɨwikɨta waruwitɨximetɨ.   
\c 14  
\p
\v 1 Yawé Muitsexi mɨpaɨ katiniutahɨawe:  
\v 2 «'Ixaheritsixi mɨpaɨ ketiniwarutahɨawi meke'ukunuaxɨani Pi-'Akiruti hɨxie mekekuyaxe, Mikiruri meta haramara wahixɨapa. Haramara tetsita mekekuyaxe, Wahari-Tsepuni hɨxie.  
\v 3 Parahuni mɨpaɨ pɨti'erieni: “'Ixaheritsixi mekaneuyexɨrieni mɨkɨ kwieyaritsie. Makumawe kaniwakunaka”.  
\v 4 Ne, nepipitɨani 'iyarieya tse'ime Parahuni, mɨxe'anukuweiyakɨ. Peru ne mariweme nepaneyeitɨani Parahuni hɨxie meta kuyaximama wahɨxie. 'Ana 'ekipitutari mɨpaɨ mepɨtehetimani kename ne Yawé nehɨkɨ».  
\p Hikɨ mɨpaɨ mekaniuyɨni 'ixaheritsixi.  
\v 5 Kepauka 'Ekipitu ti'aitame mɨretima, kename teɨteri mehekɨnekai, hikɨ mɨkɨ meta te'i'uximayatametemama mepuyupataxɨ, mɨpaɨ meputiyua 'ixaheritsixi wahetsiemieme: «Neuxei ketete'uyuri. ¿Titayari tetewarupitɨa 'ixaheritsixi memɨyehukɨ meta yu'uximayatsika memuku'eirienikɨ?»  
\v 6 Merikɨte 'ana kwitɨwa Parahuni katiniuta'aita kaxetaya mukuha'aritsienikɨ meta kuyaximama memuyukuha'aritɨanikɨ,  
\v 7 kaniwaruta'inieni 'ataxewime tsienituyari kaxetate 'aixɨa mɨ'anene, meta hipame kaxetate 'Ekipitu mieme, xexuitɨ kaxetatetsie kuyaxi mekanati'utɨkateitɨni.   
\p
\v 8 Yawé Parahuni 'iyarieya kaniutseiriya 'Ekipitu ti'aitame, para 'ixaheritsixi mɨwaranukuweiyakɨ, mɨkɨ mekaniuhukaitɨni mete'ayu'iwake meyu'erietɨ.  
\v 9 Yunaitɨ Parahuni kuyaximama mekaniwaranukuweiya, kawayutsixi wahetsie me'utetɨ, kaxetate kuyaxa miemete mewaruhapatɨ, hikɨ 'ixaheritsixi mekaniwaranuku'axe haramara tetsita paitɨ mekaniwarutaxeiya, hehurakaku Pi-'Akiruti meta Wahari-Tsepuni hɨxie.   
\p
\v 10 Parahuni kanaye'aximekaitɨni. Kepauka 'ixaheritsixi memɨyu'ɨwiyaxɨ 'ekipitutari mepɨwaruxei 'ari hura me'ahukame, hikɨ waɨkawa mekaniutimamani, Yawé mekaniutahɨawe.  
\v 11 Hikɨ mɨpaɨ Muitsexi mekateniutatieni:  
\p —Kamɨtsɨ karexɨawekai 'Ekipitu kwie temekateukienikɨ, ¿titayari petareyewitɨ 'enapaitɨ makumawetsie temɨkwinikɨ? ¿Kehapaɨtɨtɨ pepɨtatsiyuriene?  
\v 12 Yatepaitɨkatei 'Ekipitu paitɨ: “Ketaneuhayewa. Pɨtatsinake 'ekipitutari temɨtewa'uximayatsirieka”. Matsi 'aixɨa pɨ'anekai temɨteware'uximayatsiriekakɨ, 'ena temɨkakwinikɨ makumawetsie.   
\p
\v 13 Muitsexi mɨpaɨ kaniutayɨni:  
\p —Xepɨkaheumamaka. Xeme kayuwatɨ xeketeneteni, hikɨ kwitɨwa xemunenierixɨ xepɨhɨkɨtɨni, Yawé wikweitsitɨarika kemɨrexeiya xehetsiemieme. Hikɨ mɨkɨ 'ekipitutari xemɨwaxeiya hatsuakuri tawarita xepɨkawaxeiya.  
\v 14 Xeme kayuwatɨ xekeneumaka, Yawé pɨta puyutamieni xehetsiemieme.   
\p
\v 15 Peru Yawé mɨpaɨ Muitsexi katiniutahɨawe: «¿Ketitayari ne penerahɨawe? 'Ixaheritsixi mɨpaɨ ketiniwarutahɨawi memayekɨnekɨ.  
\v 16 'Ekɨta 'a'itsɨ keneutatsera haramara heima, haa kananutayepierimɨkɨ mana memukɨnekɨ 'ixaheritsixi 'ayewakikaku.  
\v 17 Ne 'ekipitutari wa'iyari nepɨtseiriya para memɨxe'anukuweiyakɨ. Ne mariweme nepɨtiyurieni. Parahuni kuyaximama, kaxetate meta teɨterimama memutei nepɨwareuyehɨani.  
\v 18 Kepauka mɨpaɨ nemɨtiyurieni, 'ana 'ekipitutari mɨpaɨ mepɨtehetimani kename ne Yawé nehɨkɨ».   
\p
\v 19 Hikɨ niuki tuayame Kakaɨyari hetsɨa mieme 'ixaheritsixi wahɨxie mumiekai, ta'aurie kanaweni wa'utɨma pɨta kaniyuhayewa. Yaxeikɨata kaniuyɨni hai 'amuwekai wa'utɨma pɨta kaniutakeni,  
\v 20 'ekipitutari wahɨxie tai puke 'ixaheritsixi wahekɨariwiyatɨ. Mɨkɨ tɨkaritsie mɨkɨ hai hipame wahetsiemieme pɨyɨriyatɨkai hipame wahetsiemiemeta pɨhekɨariyatɨkai, 'ayumieme mɨpaɨ ti'anekaku mepɨkayɨwawekai memuyuxeiyanikɨ.   
\p
\v 21 Hikɨ Muitsexi yu'itsɨ kaneutatsera haramara heima, Yawé 'eka kaneyenɨ'ani mɨkɨ tɨkarikɨ tau manatineika mieme karima kaniu'ekakaitɨni 'anari haramara kananutayepiere, ya'atayeutɨ heutanetɨ kanayewani, kwie wakitɨ kanahekɨare. Haa haramara kananutayepiere,  
\v 22 'ixaheritsixi mana mekaniukɨne kwie wakimetsie me'uhutɨ. Haramara kaniti'ukaitɨni 'ixumeri hepaɨ watserieta meta wa'utata.   
\p
\v 23 Hikɨ 'ekipitutari mekaniwaranukuweiya. Yunaitɨ memutekai kawayutsixi wahetsie meta kaxetatetsie, yunaitɨ Parahuni hetsɨamiemete mekanekɨneta wa'utɨma.  
\v 24 Merikɨte kepauka mɨkahekɨarirɨmekairi, Yawé kaniwaruxeiya kuyaxi 'ekipitutari, tai haikɨriyaritsie paitɨ meta haiwitɨritsie paitɨ, hikɨ 'ana mɨkɨ 'axapɨwaruyuri:  
\v 25 mɨpaɨ katiniuyurieni, wakaxetate pukahapawakai mɨpaɨ tiuyurieku 'uxi mepɨyɨakai mepɨka'ayekɨniwawekai. Hikɨ 'ayumieme mɨpaɨ 'ekipitutari mekateniutihiwatɨkɨne: «Tepɨwahayewa 'ixaheritsixi, Yawé puyumiene wahetsiemieme, pɨtatsikwine».   
\p
\v 26 Hikɨ Yawé mɨpaɨ Muitsexi katiniutahɨawe: «'Amamá keneutatsera haramara heima, para haa mɨwareuyehɨanikɨ 'ekipitutari meta wakaxetate metatsierie teɨteri memutei».  
\v 27 Merikɨte Muitsexi yu'itsɨ kaneutatsera haa heima, 'ari katarirɨmekaku, hikɨ haramara 'aixɨa kaniuyɨni matɨari hepaɨ. 'Ekipitutari me'uyuta'unaku yu'utɨma haa puwaranukunakixɨ, mɨpaɨ Yawé pɨtiwareuyehɨa haramara tetɨata.  
\v 28 Haramara heitserie 'anuyemareku, kaniwarukayunitɨani kaxetate meta teɨteri memutei Parahuni hetsɨa miemete, meta yunaitɨ kemɨ'ane 'ixaheritsixi memɨwaranukuweiyakai. Mɨkɨ nixewitɨ pɨka'utawikwei.  
\v 29 Peru 'ixaheritsixi teɨteriyari mekananukɨne kwie wakimetsie haramaratsietɨtɨ, mɨkɨ wahetsiemieme haa 'ixumeriyari kanihɨkɨtɨkaitɨni watserieta meta wa'utata.   
\p
\v 30 Mɨkɨ tukaritsie Yawé mɨpaɨ katiniwaruwikweitsitɨani 'ixaheritsixi 'ekipitutari mewakwikukaku. 'Ixaheritsixi 'ekipitutari wakaxarite mekaniuxeiya haramara tetsitapaitɨ metiheikame.  
\v 31 Mɨya mete'uneniereka 'ixaheritsixi, yutɨrɨkariyakɨ kemɨtiuyuri 'ekipitutari wahetsie, mɨkɨ mekaniutimamani Yawé yuri mekateniuta'eririeni, yaxeikɨata Muitsexi 'iparewiwameya.   
\c 15  
\s1 Muitsexi kemɨtitanɨawaxɨ  
\p
\v 1 Hikɨ Muitsexi meta 'ixaheritsixi xeime kwikari mekaniutakwika Yawé hetsiemieme, mɨpaɨ kananuyɨneni:  
\q1 Yawé nepɨtanɨawa, mariwemekɨ mɨrayu'iwaxɨkɨ  
\q2 haramaratsie pɨwareukaxɨri kawayutsixi meta teɨteri memutekai.   
\q1
\v 2 Yawé pɨnetɨrɨkariya meta pɨnekwikari,  
\q2 mɨkɨ pɨnetsiwikweitsitɨwame.  
\q1 Mɨkɨ pɨnekakaɨyari, nepinɨawani,  
\q2 mɨkɨ nepaapa Kakaɨyarieya pɨhɨkɨ, 'ayumieme 'aixɨa nepaineni hetsiena mieme.   
\q1
\v 3 Yawé kuya meuyutamiewe kanihɨkɨtɨni,  
\q2 Yawé katinitewaka.   
\q1
\v 4 Yawé haramaratsie kaniwareukaxɨrieni,  
\q2 Parahuni kaxetatemama meta kuyaximama.  
\q1 Te'uximayatamete 'ekipitutari 'aixɨa memɨtekahu paratsiyuta  
\q2 mekaniukayunixɨani Haramara Mɨxeta hetsie.   
\q1
\v 5 Haramara 'amatiyewatsie mekaniukayunixɨani,  
\q2 meukatewatsiepaitɨ tetexi hepaɨ mekaniukayunixɨani.   
\b  
\q1
\v 6 Yawé, 'atɨrɨkariya pepuhekɨataxɨ mariwemekɨ,  
\q2 Yawé, memɨtatsi'aye'uniekai pepɨwarutitsanaxɨa.   
\q1
\v 7 Mariwemekɨ pepɨtiuyuri  
\q2 pepɨwaruka'unaxɨ 'aneneɨkixiwima,  
\q1 waɨkawamekɨ pepuyeha'a,  
\q2 xatsi hepaɨ xeikɨa mepɨte'utai.   
\q1
\v 8 Xei 'iiyayarikɨ pepɨtiuyuri,  
\q2 haa manutayepierekɨ,  
\q1 hamewari kayuwatɨ pɨtiu'ui 'ixumeri hepaɨ pɨtiyuxexeiyakai,  
\q2 haa pɨkakuyuatɨkatei tetɨata paitɨ.   
\b  
\q1
\v 9 Taneɨkixiwima mɨpaɨ meputiyuanekai:  
\q2 «Hikɨmɨ tepɨwaruweiyani,  
\q1 nepɨwaranuku'axe.  
\q2 Tinaime tepɨtewarenawairieni wapiini, waɨkawa temɨtehexeyanikɨ.  
\q1 Ta'ixipara tepɨwatihapaxɨani  
\q2 tamamakɨ tepɨwarekwini».   
\q1
\v 10 Peru 'ekɨ xeimieme pewaruhɨtsieku haramara pɨwareukakwai,  
\q2 mepukayunixɨa tepɨa mahete hepaɨ.   
\b  
\q1
\v 11 Yawé, xewitɨ pumawe kakaɨyarixi watsata 'ahepaɨ 'anetɨ.  
\q2 Xewitɨ pumawe 'ahepaɨ timariwetɨ meta 'ahepaɨ tipatsietɨ.  
\q1 'Ekɨ, mariweme pemɨtiyuriwe,  
\q2 'ekɨ yemekɨ pepɨtatsihɨxiyatsitɨa 'atɨrɨkariyakɨ.   
\q1
\v 12 Kepauka 'ekɨ 'atserie pemutatseraxɨ,  
\q2 kwie pɨwareukakwai.   
\b  
\q1
\v 13 Waɨkawamekɨ pewanaki'erietɨ pepɨwaruwitɨxime 'ateɨterima pemɨwarutawikweitsitɨa,  
\q2 'atɨrɨkariyakɨ pepɨwaruwitɨxime 'akiekari makupatsie.   
\q1
\v 14 Naitsarie kwiepa nuiwarite mepɨtimamani me'enaname,  
\q2 kepauka memɨtehetimani piritsiteutsixi mepetinututuixieni.   
\q1
\v 15 'Erumi kiekatari wa'ukiyarima waɨkawa mepɨtimamani,  
\q2 waɨkawa meputiyɨyɨakatɨkani 'itsɨkate Muhawi kiekatari.  
\q1 Meta Kanani kiekatari meputiweranaxɨa,   
\q2
\v 16 mɨkɨtsɨ wahetsie pɨtinakeni marika.  
\q1 Yawé, kepemɨtitɨrɨkaɨyekɨ,  
\q2 mekaniuwawetɨ mepakɨne tetexi wahepaɨ  
\q1 kepaukake 'ateɨterima memanuyekɨne,  
\q2 teɨteri 'ahetsiemieme pemɨwarutinanai.   
\q1
\v 17 'Ekɨ pepɨwareutawitɨni, pepɨwaka'iteɨta,  
\q2 'iya hɨritsie kemɨ'ane 'ahetsɨamɨmieme,  
\q1 Yawé, 'ekɨ hakewa pemeyeika,  
\q2 hakewa 'ekɨ, Yawé, 'atuki pemeyutawewiri.   
\b  
\q1
\v 18 Yawé katini'aitakamɨkɨ yuheyeme, tukarikɨ.   
\s1 Miriyami kwikarieya  
\p
\v 19 Kepauka Parahuni kawayutsiximama meta kaxetamama teɨteri me'utetɨ haramaratsie memanukɨnekekai, Yawé yakatiniuyurieni haa waheima muyeurienikɨ. 'Ixaheritsixi mekayu'iyaritɨatɨ mepanukɨ kwie wakimetsie.  
\v 20 Merikɨtsɨ Miriyami Kakaɨyari niukameya, 'Aruni taruya, kaitsawiwame kaniuti'ɨni, hipatɨta 'ukari mekaniweiyakaitɨni yukaitsakɨ mete'ukayuitɨwatɨ meta mete'ukaye'atɨ.  
\v 21 Miriyami mɨpaɨ katiniukwikakaitɨni:  
\q1 Yawé xekenenɨawani, mɨkɨ mariwemekɨ mɨrayu'iwaxɨkɨ,  
\q2 kawayutsixi wahetsie memutei  
\q1 meta kawayutsixi haramaratsie pɨwareukaxɨri.   
\s1 Haa matsiwi Maraha meta Herimi  
\p
\v 22 Merikɨtsɨ Muitsexi kaniwaruta'aitɨani 'ixaheritsixi Haramara Mɨxeta hetsie memayekɨnekɨ meta makumawetsie memɨtayunekɨ Tsuhuxi kwieyaritsie. 'Ixaheritsixi mana mekaniuhukaitɨni haika tukari makumawetsie haa mekataxeiyawawetɨ.  
\v 23 Hikɨ mekaniuta'axɨani Maraha mɨrakutewatsie, mana mɨpaɨ katinakutewakaitɨni mana haa hatsiwitɨ muxuawekaikɨ, mana mepɨkatenewiekairi meheuharikutɨ.  
\v 24 Merikɨte mɨkɨ mekaniutiniukixietɨkɨne Muitsexi hepaɨtsita, mɨpaɨ mete'iku'iwawiyatɨ: «¿Ketita tetetihareni?»  
\v 25 Muitsexi Yawé kaniutawawirieni, mɨkɨ pixeitsitɨa kɨye yatewime, mɨkɨ Muitsexi hapa kaneikahɨani, yapauka haa 'aixɨa ha'anetɨ kanayani.  
\p Mana Yawé kaniwaruta'inɨata, kaniwarupitɨani 'inɨari niukiyari kememɨtekahuni.  
\v 26 Mɨpaɨ katiniwarutahɨawe: «Netsɨ Yawé xekakaɨyari nekanihɨkɨtɨni. Xɨka neniuki xe'enietɨ yaxetekahuni heitseriemekɨ, xɨka 'inɨari niukiyaritsie yaxetekahuni kemɨreuyewetse meta ne'aitsikatsie, ne hatsuaku kwiniya nepɨkahanɨ'ani xehetsie, 'ekipitutsie kenemɨtiuyuri. Netsɨ Yawé nekanihɨkɨtɨni, hatsuaku kwiniya xehetsie pɨkatinake».   
\p
\v 27 'Arikeke 'ixaheritsixi mekaneta'axɨani, 'Erimi mɨrakutewatsie, hakewa tamamata heimana huta haixayari mexuawekai meta haika tewiyari heimana tamamata takɨ mati'u, mana mekaniyuhayewa, haa mayema 'aurie.   
\c 16  
\s1 Manana payari meta xɨ'aurixi  
\p
\v 1 Merikɨtsɨ yunaitɨ 'ixaheritsixi 'Erimi mekaniyekɨne, mekaneta'axɨani makumawetsie Tsini paitɨ, mɨkɨ 'Erimi meta Tsinahi wahixɨapa pɨti'anekai. 'Ikɨta pɨtiuyɨ xeimetseri 'anukamiekaku heimana tamamata heimana 'auxɨwi tukaritsie, 'inɨaritɨ kepauka memayekɨtsie 'Ekipitu.  
\v 2 Mana makumawetsie me'u'uwatɨ, 'ixaheritsixi mekaniwarutiniukimani Muitsexi 'Aruni mame.   
\p
\v 3 Mɨpaɨ 'ixaheritsixi mekaniutiyuanekaitɨni:  
\p —Matsi 'aixɨa pɨ'anekai xɨka Yawé tatsihekwinike 'Ekipitu paitɨ. Mana 'aixɨa tepɨtehetikwa'akai wai 'itsarikɨ meta pakɨ yemekɨ tepetihuxarɨwekai. Xeme xepɨtatsiheyewitɨ, 'ena makumawetsie teyunaime xemɨtatsikwinikɨ haakakɨ.   
\p
\v 4 Hikɨ Yawé mɨpaɨ Muitsexi katiniutahɨawe: «Yanepɨtiyurieni mɨkawiyekɨ paa muyuawitsie mieme. 'Ixaheritsixi yunaitɨ meke'ikuteɨxɨni xeitukaritsie mieme yuxexuitɨ, nekaniwata'inɨatamɨkɨ xɨka 'aku yametekakɨnikuni yatɨ pɨtikatixaɨ.  
\v 5 'Ataxewirieka tukaritsie mepikuteɨxɨ huta tukaritsie mieme, mɨpaɨ memɨteha'aritsiekakɨ».   
\p
\v 6 Merikɨtsɨ Muitsexi 'Aruni matɨa 'ixaheritsixi mɨpaɨ mekateniwarutahɨawe:  
\p —'Ikɨ taikaiyaritsie xepɨtehetimani kename Yawé tiuyuri 'Ekipitu mɨxe'ayewitɨ,  
\v 7 meta 'uxa'a ximeri xepixeiya Yawé kemɨtimariwe. Mɨkɨri pɨtimate ke'axaxemutiyuane hetsiena mieme. Tame tixaɨ tepɨkatehɨkɨ ketitayari 'axaxetatekuhɨaweni.   
\p
\v 8 Muitsexi mɨpaɨ katiniwarutahɨawe:  
\p —'Ikɨ taikaiyaritsie Yawé wai kanixemimɨkɨ, paa xetikwame xekanitihuxaikuni kanixe'u'enieni hepaɨtsitana 'axakexemutiyua. Tame tixaɨtɨ tepɨkatehɨkɨ. Xeme ke'axaxemutiyuane tahetsiemieme xepɨka'utiyuane, Yawé hetsiemieme pɨta xekaniutiyuaneni.   
\p
\v 9 Hikɨ Muitsexi mɨpaɨ 'Aruni katiniutahɨawe:  
\p —'Ixaheritsixi yunaime mɨpaɨ ketiniwarutahɨawi, 'ahurawa meke'akɨne Yawé hetsɨa, mɨkɨ kaniwaru'enieni 'axakememutiyuanekai hetsiena mieme.   
\p
\v 10 Mexi'akuxi tikuxatakai 'Aruni, yunaime 'ixaheritsixi wahamatɨa mana, mekanixeiya makumawetsie haiwitɨritsie Yawé kemɨtimariwe.   
\p
\v 11 Yawé Muitsexi katiniutaxatɨani mɨpaɨ katinitahɨawe:  
\v 12 «Nekaniwaru'enieni 'ixaheritsixi kememɨteniukixie. Mɨpaɨ ketiniwarutahɨawi kakɨyɨriwekaku 'akuxi, wai xekanitikwaikuni, 'uxa'ata ximeri pakɨ xekanitihuxaikuni. 'Anari mɨpaɨ mekatenetimaikuni kename Yawé wakakaɨyari nehɨkɨ».   
\p
\v 13 Mɨkɨ kwitɨwa taikaiyaritsie mematitekaitsie meputixuawerixɨ xɨ'aurixi, meta 'uxa'arieka mematiteitsie naitsarie pakutuxakai 'ɨwi hepaɨ.  
\v 14 Mɨkɨ 'ukumawereku makumawetsie puyuhayewaxɨ 'etsiwa witsi'anenetɨ, tee hepaɨ 'anenetɨ.  
\v 15 'Ixaheritsixi memɨkatemaikaikɨ ketitamɨtihɨkɨtɨkai, me'ixeiyatɨ mɨpaɨ mepɨteyuku'iwawiyakai: «¿Ketita tihɨkɨ 'ikɨ?» Muitsexi mɨpaɨ katiniwarutahɨawe:  
\p —Mɨkɨ paa kanihɨkɨtɨni Yawé mɨxemikwa xemitikwanikɨ.  
\v 16 'Ikɨ kanihɨkɨtɨni 'aitɨarika Yawé kemaine: “Xeme yuxexuitɨ xekeneukuteɨxi, kepaɨmeme xemeuyehɨwa para yunaime xetɨɨriyama wahetsiemieme, xete'inɨaritɨatɨ huta kakuniyari yuxexuime wahetsiemieme”.   
\p
\v 17 Mɨpaɨ mekateniuyurieni 'ixaheritsixi. Hipatɨ waɨkawa mekanikuteɨxɨ, hipatɨta 'etsiwa xeikɨa.  
\v 18 Perutsɨ kepauka memiti'inɨataxɨ ti'inɨnɨatamekɨ, kemɨ'ane waɨkawa meikuteɨxixɨ pɨkayukuhayeikawakai, kemɨ'ane 'etsiwa mikuteɨxixɨ pɨkaheuyewekai, yuxexuitɨ mekanikuteɨxɨ yunakeme xeikɨa.  
\v 19 Hikɨ Muitsexi mɨpaɨ katiniwarutahɨawe:  
\p —Xewitɨ pɨka'iti'uta 'uxa'arieka mieme mayanikɨ.   
\p
\v 20 Hipatɨ Muitsexi mepɨkahanu'eni, mekaniti'uta 'uxa'arieka mieme mayanikɨ, perutsɨ memiti'utaxɨ kaniutikwitsieni 'axa'u'ɨatɨkaitɨ kanayani. Hikɨ Muitsexi kaniuyeha'ani wahetsiemieme.   
\p
\v 21 Yunaitɨ mekanikuteɨxɨkaitɨni ximeri yuxexuitɨ kememɨteheiyehɨakai, mɨkɨtsɨ tau xɨriyarikɨ pɨtipaparikekai.  
\v 22 Perutsɨ 'ataxewirieka tukaritsie mekanikuteɨxɨ hutakɨamieme kepaɨmeme memɨkema, tatsɨari nauka 'inɨariyari yuxexuitɨ, 'ayumieme mɨkɨ memanuyetei mepekɨ Muitsexi metehetaxatɨanike.   
\p
\v 23 Mɨpaɨ katiniwaruta'eiya:  
\p —Mɨpaɨ katina'aitani Yawé. 'Uxa'a xawatikɨ 'uxipiya tukari pɨhɨkɨ mɨpatsie Yawe hetsiemieme. 'Ayumieme xeketeneutiwarɨka yatɨni xeketeneuka'etsa hikɨ tita xemɨteheuyehɨwa. Tita mɨtiyuhayewa, xeketeneuti'uta 'uxa'arieka mieme mɨrayanikɨ.   
\p
\v 24 Mɨpaɨ mepɨte'uyuri 'ixaheritsixi kemɨtiwaruta'aitɨa Muitsexi, mepiti'utaxɨ 'uxa'arieka mieme muyuhayewaxɨ, mɨkɨ hawaikɨ pɨka'utipɨnixɨ meta pɨka'utikwitsi.   
\p
\v 25 Muitsexi mɨpaɨ katiniwarutahɨawe:  
\p —Hikɨ xawatikɨ xekeneutikwa'i, hikɨ 'uxipiya tukari kanihɨkɨtɨni Yawé hetsiemieme. Hikɨri xepɨkaheitaxeiya xemetiteɨxɨkaitsie.  
\v 26 'Ataxewime tukari xeikɨa xepikuteɨxɨni, 'atahutarieka tukaritsie, tixaɨtɨ xepɨkatehetaxeiya.   
\p
\v 27 Hipatɨ 'ixaheritsixi mekanekɨne meheiteɨxiyuka 'atahutarieka tukaritsie, peru tixaɨtɨ mepɨkatehetaxei,  
\v 28 hikɨ 'ayumieme Yawé Muitsexi mɨpaɨ katiniutahɨawe: «¿Kamɨtsɨ kepaukake menetsiheu'enietɨ mepakɨne, yameteyurietɨ naime 'aitɨarikatsie?  
\v 29 Mɨpaɨ xeketemaika, ne Yawé, 'uxipiya tukari nenixe'upitɨani xawati tukaritsie. 'Ayumieme 'ataxewirieka tukaritsie paa nekanixeyetuiriwani huta tukari mieme. 'Atahutarieka tukaritsie xewitɨ tɨma pɨkahayeyeikani. Yunaitɨ 'axeikɨa meke'ukutetɨkani».   
\p
\v 30 Mɨpaɨ mekaniuyɨni 'ana 'ixaheritsixi mekaniuka'uxipieni 'atahutarieka tukaritsie.  
\v 31 Mɨkɨ paa mepɨte'iterɨwaxɨ «manana». Kanituxakaitɨni, tsiranituru hatsiyari hepaɨ 'anenetɨ, meta pakakatei paa mɨxietematɨka hepaɨ.   
\p
\v 32 Muitsexi mɨpaɨ kaniutayɨni:  
\p —Yawé mɨpaɨ kanaineni: “Huta kakuniyari xekeneuti'uta manana payari, para xeniwema xemanutihutsie mieme, mɨkɨ memixeiyakɨ paa nemɨxe'umi makumawetsie, kepauka nemɨxe'ayewitɨ 'Ekipitu”.   
\p
\v 33 Mɨpaɨ Muitsexi 'Aruni katiniutahɨawe:  
\p —Keneukutu'i manana xarita keneukayetsa huta kakuniyari. Hikɨ Yawé hɨxie keneukuwi, para temiti'utakɨ tanuiwarima memeitimanikɨ.   
\p
\v 34 'Aruni muwa kanikuwieni tɨratu kakuniyari hɨxie, para mu'utɨnikɨ Yawé Muitsexi kemɨtiutahɨawixɨ.  
\v 35 'Ixaheritsixi mɨkɨ mekanikwakaitɨni manana huta tewiyari wiyari, kepaukake memeta'axɨa Kanani kwieyaritsie paitɨ, mɨkɨ wakwie wakiekari patɨa.   
\p
\v 36 Huta kakuniyari 'inɨariyari «kumeri» mepɨte'iterɨwakai, meta «hepari» tamamata 'inɨariyari mepɨte'iterɨwakai.   
\c 17  
\s1 Haa tetetsie kemɨrane  
\p
\v 1 Yunaitɨ 'ixaheritsixi mekanayekɨne makumawetsie Tsini mɨrakutewatsie me'u'uxipiximetɨ, Yawé kemɨtiwanɨ'akai. Mekaniu'axɨani Xepirini mɨrakutewatsie, peru mana haa pumawekai wahetsiemieme,  
\v 2 hikɨ Muitsexi mekaniutiniukimani mɨpaɨ me'utiyuatɨ. Mɨpaɨ mekatenitawawirieni:  
\p —Haa ketaneyetuiri temɨtiharenikɨ.  
\p Muitsexi mɨpaɨ katiniwarutahɨawe yuhetsie nuatɨ:  
\p —¿Titayari xenete'anutate'a? ¿Ketitayari Yawé xeteniukima?   
\p
\v 3 Peru 'ixaheritsixi waɨkawa mepeuharikukai, Muitsexi hepaɨtsita mepɨniukixiekai. Mɨpaɨ mekatenikɨhɨawekaitɨni:  
\p —¿Ketitayari petarayewitɨ 'Ekipitu kwieyaritsie? Kauka xeikɨa petatsiheyewitɨ teyeharikwitɨwetɨ temɨkwinikɨ, taniwema meta tatewama.   
\p
\v 4 Hikɨ Muitsexi Yawé kaniutahɨawe, mɨpaɨ katinita'iwawiya:  
\p —¿Kenetiyurieni 'ikɨ teɨteri wahetsiemieme? Peuyewetse 'etsiwa xeikɨa memɨnetsimienikɨ tetexikɨ.   
\p
\v 5 Yawé mɨpaɨ katinita'aitɨani:  
\p —Keniwaranuwitɨki pe'anuyekaitɨ hipame 'ahamatɨa 'ixaheritsixi wa'ukiyarima, 'a'itsɨ kenakwetɨ kɨmana Niru hayari pemuwa. Kenemie,  
\v 6 ne nepɨmatsihetakwewieka tete manuka Huré mɨrakutewatsie paitɨ. Mana pepiwani tete xeimieme xeikɨa, mɨkɨtsie haa paneni yunaitɨ 'ixaheritsixi memɨtiharenikɨ.  
\p Muitsexi mɨpaɨ pɨtiuyuri, 'ixaheritsixi wa'ukiyarima wahɨxie.  
\v 7 Metatsiere mana, Matsaha mekateniuterɨwa meta Meriwa, mɨkɨ panuyɨne 'ixaheritsixi mepuniukixi, Yawé hepaɨtsita meputiniukixi, mɨpaɨ mete'uhiwatɨ: «¿Yawé tiuyeika 'aku tahamatɨa, nutsu pɨkatixaɨ?»   
\s1 'Ixaheritsixi 'amarekitsixi kememɨtewara'iwaxɨ  
\p
\v 8 'Amarekitsixi mekaniu'axɨani Xepirini mehanexɨaka, 'ixaheritsixi mekaniwarutakwini.  
\v 9 Hikɨ Muitsexi Kutsuhexi mɨpaɨ katiniuta'aitɨani: «'Ekɨ keniwaranuyeteɨxi 'ukitsi hipame, xekenehu xekeniwakwiyu 'amarekitsixi. 'Uxa'a ne yemuritsie nepakakani Kakaɨyari 'itsɨya ne'akwetɨ».   
\p
\v 10 Kutsuhexi mɨpaɨ pɨtiuyuri Muitsexi kemɨtita'aitɨa, mekaniwarutakwini 'amarekitsixi. Muitsexi, 'Aruni meta Kuxi yemuritsie 'emanutitewatsie mekaneutiyune.  
\v 11 Kepauka Muitsexi yumamate teikɨ metseratɨkani 'ixaheritsixi yuneukixiwima mepɨwara'iwakai, kepauka muti'uxikekai teikɨ hemetɨ 'ana mepɨtehayu'iwakai 'amarekitsixi.  
\v 12 Kepauka Muitsexi mamateya muti'uxixɨa teikɨ hemetɨ, tete me'akurupaka hetɨana menitayeni hetsiena mayerɨnikɨ, hikɨ 'Aruni meta Kuxi matɨa mekanenukutuikaxɨani mamateyatsie mekaniparewieni, xewitɨ 'utatanatsie xewitɨta tserietana, mɨpaɨke Muitsexi pɨyɨwekai yumamate tukarikɨ teikɨ metseratɨkani kepaukake tau makayunixɨ.  
\v 13 Mɨpaɨ Kutsuhexi pɨtiwara'iwaxɨ 'amarekitsixi 'ixiparakɨ.   
\p
\v 14 Merikɨtsɨ Yawé Muitsexi mɨpaɨ katiniutahɨawe: «Ketinaka'utɨa 'ikɨ nawi kwikwiekametsie, naime kemɨtiuyɨ, xewitɨ mɨkaratɨtɨmaiyanikɨ, meta Kutsuhexi mɨpaɨ ketimaika: Ne yunaime nepɨwareuyehɨani muyuawi hetɨa, mɨkɨ 'amarekitsixi meta waniwema».   
\p
\v 15 Mana Muitsexi mawari taiyame tenariyari kaniutawewieni, mɨpaɨta katiniterɨwa «Yawé nehetsie pununuwame».  
\v 16 Mɨpaɨta kaniutayɨni: «Nepitikweni Yawé kuyaximama wapatera. Yawé yuheyemekɨ 'amareki paye'unieka».   
\c 18  
\s1 Keturu Muitsexi kemɨreku'iwataxɨ  
\p
\v 1 Kakaɨyari naime kemɨtiuyuri Muitsexi hetsiemieme meta Yawé yuteɨterima wahetsiemieme 'ixaheritsixi kemɨtiwarayewitɨ 'Ekipitu kwieyaritsie, Muitsexi munieya Keturu mawari wewiwame katiniutamarieni, Mariyani kwieyaritsie.  
\v 2 Kepauka Muitsexi Tsepura yu'ɨya menɨ'a Keturu hetsɨa, mɨkɨ kiena me'u'axɨaku yuniwe mamayatsie kanawiere,  
\v 3 meta niwemama meyuhutatɨ. Mɨkɨ xewitɨ nunutsi pɨtitewakai Keritsuni, mɨpaɨ mutayɨkɨ Muitsexi: «Teewa kiekame nepɨhɨkɨ xeime kwieyaritsie ne'uyeikatɨ neka'imatemetsie».  
\v 4 Xewitɨta 'Eriyetsexi pɨtitewakai. Muitsexi mɨpaɨ mutayɨkaikɨ: «Nepaapa Kakaɨyarieya pɨnetsi'uparewi, pɨnetsi'utawikweitsitɨa Parahuni netsimiemɨkɨkaku».   
\p
\v 5 Hikɨ Keturu kaneyani makumawetsie Muitsexi metahɨawekɨ 'ɨyaya 'awitɨtɨ meta niwemama, mɨkɨ mana penuakairi Kakaɨyari hɨrieya hetɨa.  
\v 6 Keturu mɨpaɨ niuki katineinɨ'airiekaitɨniri: «Ne, 'amune Keturu, nekameneuxeiyamieni. 'A'ɨya meta 'aniwema meyuhutatɨ mepɨnetsihaweiya».   
\p
\v 7 Muitsexi kanayeyani henukunakeke yumune, hikɨ hɨxiena kaniutihɨximakeni meta kani'itseni. Hikɨ 'ari me'uyutapaka mekaneutahaxɨani 'ixuriki kiiyarita.  
\v 8 Muwa Muitsexi naime katinitaxatɨani yumune, Yawé kemɨtiuyuri Parahuni 'Ekipitu kiekame hɨxie meta 'ixaheritsixi wahetsiemieme naime kwaniwemekɨ kememɨte'uhukai huyeta Yawé kemɨtiwaparewiekai.   
\p
\v 9 Keturu kaniyutemawiekaitɨni tiutamarieka Yawé 'aixɨa mɨtiuka'iyarikaikɨ 'Ixaheri hetsiemieme, meta 'ekipitutari watsata mɨwarayehapakɨ.  
\v 10 Hikɨ mɨpaɨ kaniutayɨni: «'Aixɨa keraniuwani Yawé hetsiemieme, 'ekipitutari watsata mɨxehetawikweitsitɨa. 'Aixɨa keraniuwani kemɨ'ane 'ixaheritsixi mɨwaretawikweitsitɨa ti'aitame Parahuni tɨrɨkariyayatsie.  
\v 11 Hikɨri nepɨtimate Yawé matsi pɨmariwe keyuri hipatɨ kakaɨyarixi, 'ixaheritsixi mepɨnanaimariekai 'ekipitutari mariwemete mepayuyeitɨakai».  
\v 12 Mɨpaɨ 'utayɨka, Keturu mawari taiyariyari kaniuwewieni meta hipame mawari Kakaɨyari hetsiemieme, 'Aruni meta yunaitɨ 'ixaheritsixi wa'ukiyarima mekananukayaxe mekateniukwani Muitsexi munieya hamatɨa Kakaɨyari hɨxie.   
\p
\v 13 'Uxa'arieka, Muitsexi 'akanayerɨni 'ixaheritsixi wa'enienike tita memɨtehayexeiyakai hamatɨana, 'itsɨkame kanihɨkɨtɨkaitɨni wahetsiemieme, 'ixaheritsixi hɨxiena mekaniti'uni ximeripaitɨ meta mana meti'ukaku tau kanakayune.  
\v 14 Keturu kepauka yumune Muitsexi muxei kemɨtiyurienekai teɨteri wahamatɨa, mɨpaɨ katinitahɨawe:  
\p —Ketɨtɨ teɨteri pepɨwayuriene. ¿Ketitayari tukarikɨ meta tɨkarikɨ mana meteku'u, 'ekɨta 'axaɨta 'aperaka?   
\p
\v 15 Muitsexi mɨpaɨ katinita'eiya:  
\p —Teɨteri nehetsɨa mepɨ'axe Kakaɨyari memɨtahɨawekɨ.  
\v 16 Kepauka memɨyu'uximatɨa mepɨ'axe nehetsɨa mepɨnetekuxaxatɨwa, naime nepɨwahekɨatɨa rayehutame kemɨti'ane. Meta, nepɨwakuxaxatɨwa kemaine 'inɨari niukiyari meta 'ɨkitɨarika Kakaɨyari hetsɨa mieme.   
\p
\v 17 Munieya mɨpaɨ katinitahɨawe:  
\p —'Aixɨa puka'ane mɨya pemɨyɨane,  
\v 18 peputi'uxike 'ekɨ meta teɨteri 'ahɨxie memɨti'u. 'Ikɨ 'uximayatsika kanikwaniweni, 'axaɨtame pepɨkayɨwe.  
\v 19 Keneu'eni 'ɨxatsi kemɨ'ane nemɨmatsitaxatɨani, meta Kakaɨyari kematsiparewieka. 'Ekɨ pemanuyeka pepɨhɨkɨtɨni Kakaɨyari hetsiemieme, meta 'ekɨ pepɨtiwahekɨatɨwametɨni ke'aneme 'uximatɨarika memexeiyani.  
\v 20 Kaneuyeweka mɨkɨ pemɨtiwati'ɨkitɨanikɨ 'inɨari niukiyaritsie meta 'ɨkitɨarika Kakaɨyari hetsiemieme, meta yapemɨtiwatahɨawekɨ kememɨte'u'uwani meta kememɨtehahɨawarɨwa memɨte'aye'atɨakakɨ.  
\v 21 'Ekɨ keniwaranayexeiya hipame 'ukitsi 'aixɨa memaitɨka Kakaɨyari hetsiemieme, yurikɨ yuri memɨte'erie Kakaɨyari memayemakaxe kwamanarika memɨkanaki'erie, xeime keneuhɨritɨa xeimiriyari wa'ukiyari mayanikɨ, xeimeta xeitsienituyari wa'ukiyari, xeimeta huta tewiyari heimana tamamata wa'ukiyari, xeimeta tamamata wa'ukiyari.  
\v 22 Mɨkɨ mepɨyɨaka 'itsɨkate wahepaɨ yamemɨte'uximayaka, mɨkɨ mepɨte'uximayaka nenika mɨti'anenetsie, xewitɨri xɨka kwinimieme rayexeiyani 'uximatɨarikatsie 'ahetsɨa meke'i'atɨani. Mɨpaɨ 'a'uximayatsika pa'exanaxɨani, mɨkɨ memɨmatsiparewienikɨ.  
\v 23 Xɨka mɨpaɨ petikamieni, Kakaɨyari kemɨmati'aitɨa, kwitɨwa 'aixɨa pɨtikuyɨneni meta teɨteri 'aixɨa 'anemekɨ meyutemamawietɨ mepekɨkani yukie.   
\p
\v 24 Muitsexi yumune kaniu'enieni kemɨtitahɨawixɨ.  
\v 25 Niwaranuyexeiya hipame 'ixaheritsixi watsata meyɨwaweme, mɨkɨ memanuyetei kaniwarayeitɨani, xeime xeimiriyari wa'ukiyari kanayeitɨani, xeimeta xeitsienituyari wa'ukiyari, xeimeta huta tewiyari heimana tamamata wa'ukiyari, xeimeta tamamata wa'ukiyari.  
\v 26 Mɨkɨ 'itsɨkate wahepaɨ mepɨteyuriekai yamete'uximayatɨ, mɨkɨ nenika mɨti'anenekɨ 'aixɨa mepɨte'akayuruwakai, peru waɨkawa mukwaniwetɨka Muitsexi hetsɨa mepɨwarenɨ'awakai.   
\p
\v 27 'Imatɨrieka Muitsexi yumune hamatɨa mekaniyutateutɨaxɨani, mɨkɨta yukie kaneyani.   
\c 19  
\s1 'Ixaheritsixi Tsinahi kememɨte'u'axɨa  
\p
\v 1 'Ixaheritsixi mekaniu'axɨani makumawe Tsinahi mɨrakutewatsie, haika metseri 'anukamiekaku 'Ekipitu kepauka memɨyekɨ.  
\v 2 Kepauka Xepirini memɨyekɨ, mɨkɨ kwieyaritsie mepeutahaxɨa Tsinahi makumawetsie, mana mekanikuyaxe hɨri hɨxie,  
\v 3 mɨkɨ hɨritsie Muitsexi kanitiyune Kakaɨyari hamatɨa mɨretaxatakɨ. Mana Yawé, mɨpaɨ katinitahɨawe:  
\q1 «Mɨpaɨ ketiniwarutahɨawi Kakuwu tɨɨriyamama,  
\q2 yaxeikɨata 'Ixaheri nuiwarimama:   
\q1
\v 4 “Xeme xemunenierixɨ xepɨhɨkɨ kenemɨtiuyuri 'Ekipitu,  
\q2 meta nehetsɨa kenemɨtixe'atɨa  
\q2 werika 'anayatsie xe'atetɨ xemu'axɨani hepaɨ.   
\q1
\v 5 Xɨka hikɨ xeme naimekɨ yaxetekakɨne,  
\q2 netɨratu xɨka xehaye'atɨani,  
\q1 neteɨterima xepɨhɨkɨtɨni  
\q2 yunaime nuiwarite kwiepa memɨtama wahɨxie.  
\q1 Tsepa naitɨ kwie nehetsɨa mɨmieme,   
\q2
\v 6 xeme nehetsiemieme mawari wewiwamete nehetsɨa miemete xepɨhɨkɨtɨni,  
\q2 meta nuiwari xemɨpatsie”.  
\p »Naime 'ikɨ 'ixaheritsixi ketiniwarutaxatɨa».   
\b  
\p
\v 7 Hikɨ Muitsexi 'ukateka kaniwarukuxeɨrieni wa'ukiyarima naime tiwataxatɨanike Yawé kemɨrehɨawekai,  
\v 8 meta mɨkɨ yunaitɨ mɨpaɨ mekaniutiyuani: «Yatepɨtekakɨne naimetsie Yawé kemɨtatita'aitɨani».  
\p Hikɨ Muitsexi kaneyani Yawé katinetaxatɨani kememutiyua teɨteri,  
\v 9 hikɨ Yawé mɨpaɨ katinitahɨawe:  
\p —Ne 'ahetsɨa nepɨnehekɨata haiwitɨritsie ka'anuyehekɨakametsie, nepɨmatsitahɨawe 'ixaheritsixi memɨnetsi'enienikɨ, yuri memɨmate'eririekakɨ yuheyemekɨ.  
\p Muitsexi Yawé yakatiniutahɨawe teɨteri kememaitɨkatei,  
\v 10 hikɨ Yawé mɨpaɨ katinitahɨawe:  
\p —Kenemie mepatsiekame keniwarayeitɨa 'ixaheritsixi hikɨ meta 'uxa'a. Mɨpaɨ ketiniwaretahɨawi mekeheyuti'ekwa,  
\v 11 hairieka tukaritsie mekeheha'aritsieka, 'ana mɨkɨ tukaritsie nepɨnehekɨata Tsinahi yemuriyaritsie nepɨkateni yunaitɨ teɨteri menetsixeiyakaku.  
\v 12 'Inɨari kuraruyari kenateka hɨri warie mana 'ixaheritsixi memɨka'utikɨkanikɨ. Mɨpaɨ ketiniwarutahɨawi xewitɨ pɨka'anɨtiyeikani hɨritsiepai meta yu'ɨka tapa miemekɨ mana pɨkaheutakekani, meta kemɨ'ane mimayɨani kanimɨmɨkɨ.  
\v 13 Tsepa mɨtewi yatsepa tewatsiekame mɨyɨane, kanimɨmɨkɨ. Kemɨ'ane mimayɨani, kanimieriemɨkɨ tetexikɨ yatɨni 'ɨrɨtekɨ. Kepaukake kuxineta metayuani karima 'anake mepɨyɨwaweni.   
\p
\v 14 Hikɨ Muitsexi kaniukateni hɨritsie 'akaneka, mepatsiekame 'ixaheritsixi kaniwarayeitɨani, mɨkɨta mekaniyuti'ekwa.  
\v 15 Mɨpaɨta Muitsexi katiniwarutahɨawe: «Xekeneyukuha'aritɨa hairieka tukaritsie miemekɨ, yu'ɨitama xepɨkawakumaɨwani».   
\p
\v 16 Hairieka tukaritsie ximeri tɨranari kaneyuani muyuawitsie meta merɨkariya, hikɨ mana hɨritsie panukate haiwitɨri ka'anuyehekɨakametsie. Meta kuxineta karima kanetayuani naitsarie 'ixaheritsixi memakutei putayuanekai.  
\v 17 Hikɨ Muitsexi 'ixaheritsixi kaniwarayewitɨni Kakaɨyari memanunakekɨ, mɨkɨ Tsinahi yemuriyaritɨa mekaniti'uni.  
\v 18 Hɨri pɨkahekɨakai kɨtsikɨ, Yawé mɨkɨtsie muyeikakaikɨ taitsie yewetɨ. Pɨwaɨkawakai kɨtsi hɨritsie metineikakai, teka hepaɨ pɨtiyuxexeiyakai, meta naitɨ hɨri karima putayuanekai,  
\v 19 meta kuxineta matsi karima peyuatɨyeikakai. Hikɨ Muitsexi kaniutaniuni, Kakaɨyari meta kanita'eiya tɨranarikɨ.   
\p
\v 20 Yawé kananukateni Tsinahi hɨriyaritsie 'amanutitewitsie paitɨ, mana Muitsexi kaniutahɨawe manutiyanikɨ. Kepauka Muitsexi hɨritsie mana mutine,  
\v 21 Yawé mɨpaɨ katinitahɨawe:  
\p —Kenanukayaka 'ixaheritsixi keniwareta'imaiya kuraru 'inɨariyari manuyeka mepɨka'anayekɨkani menetsixeiyakutɨ, kapa yumɨiretɨ me'ukwinikɨ.  
\v 22 Yaxeikɨata mawari wewiwamete hurawa xɨka me'ukɨne mekepatsieka, xɨka mɨpaɨ meka'aneneni, ne nekaniwakwimɨkɨ.   
\p
\v 23 Muitsexi Yawé mɨpaɨ katiniutahɨawe:  
\p —Teɨteri mepɨkayɨwawe memanutikɨnekɨ 'ikɨ hɨri Tsinahi hetsie paitɨ, 'ekɨtsɨ 'ari pekatanayehɨtɨani, mɨpaɨ pepɨnetiutahɨawixɨ: “Kuraru 'inɨariyari kenateka hɨriwarie, meta nehetsɨa mieme patsiekame kenayeitɨa”.   
\p
\v 24 Yawé mɨpaɨ katinita'eiya:  
\p —Keneukayaka 'Aruni keneta'ini 'ahamatɨa matiyanikɨ. Peru pɨkayɨweni mawari wewiwamete meta teɨteri mematikɨnekɨ 'enapaitɨ nehetsɨa, xɨka mɨpaɨ me'uyɨni, mekanikwikuni.   
\p
\v 25 Hikɨ Muitsexi 'uye'aka 'ixaheritsixi yaxeikɨata katiniwarutahɨawe.   
\c 20  
\s1 Tamamata 'aitsikayari  
\r (Mem 20:1-17 – Hut 5:6-21)  
\p
\v 1 Kakaɨyari 'aitsika kaniwayetuirieni, 'inɨari niukiyari memetimanikɨ:   
\b  
\li1
\v 2 «Netsɨ Yawé nekanihɨkɨtɨni 'akakaɨyari. Ne nepɨmatsi'ayewitɨ 'Ekipitu, hakewa waɨkawa pemɨre'uximayakai pekarepitɨarietɨ.   
\li1
\v 3 »Hipame tawarita kakaɨyarixi pepɨkawarayexeiyani ne xeikɨa.   
\li1
\v 4 »Tixaɨtɨ pepɨkatiwewieka taheima mieme hepaɨ ti'anekame, kwiepa memɨtexuawe hepaɨ ti'anekame, meta hapa memɨteye'uwa hepaɨ ti'anekame meta kwie hetɨa memɨtexuawe.  
\v 5 Mɨkɨ wahɨxie pepɨkatitunumakekani, pepɨkawarayexeiyani. Ne, Yawé 'akakaɨyari nemɨtiyukakwerie nekanihɨkɨtɨni. Kepauka wapaapama 'axamemɨte'u'iyari kepauka memɨnetsixani'erie, ne waniwema nepɨwa'uximatɨa, wateukarima, watutsima meta mɨkɨ waniwema.  
\v 6 Matsi kepauka, memɨnetsinaki'erie, kepauka yamemɨtekahu ne'aitsikatsie, ne nenaki'eriya wahetsiemieme matsiɨkɨme nekanayeitɨwani xeimiriyari nuiwariyaritsie.   
\li1
\v 7 »Ne Yawé kenemɨtitewa yakɨ xeikɨa pepɨkanetsikuxatani, ne nepɨka'itinenimayata kemɨ'ane kanetsi'enietɨ mɨnetsi'utaterɨwani.   
\li1
\v 8 »Kena'eriwani xawati tukari, patsiekame xemeyexeiyanikɨ.  
\v 9 'Ataxewime tukari xeikɨa pepɨti'uximayaka, tsepa naimekɨ kepemɨti'uximayaka pɨyɨweni,  
\v 10 peru 'atahutarieka tukaritsie pepɨka'uxipieni pemeyexeiyanikɨ Yawé 'akakaɨyari. Mɨkɨ tukaritsie pepɨkati'uximayaka meta 'aniwema 'ukitsi 'ukari, meta te'a'uximayatsiriwamete 'ukari 'ukitsi meta 'atewama meta teewanarixi 'akiekaritsie memɨtitei.  
\v 11 Kena'eriwani 'ataxewime tukari Yawé pɨtiutiwewi muyuawi, kwie, haramara, meta yunaime mana memɨteye'uwa, hikɨ 'atahutarieka kaniuka'uxipieni. 'Ayumieme Yawé mɨkɨ 'uxipiya tukari patsiekame kanayeitɨani.   
\li1
\v 12 »Keniwareu'enieka 'apaapa meta 'amaama, mɨpaɨ petiyurienetɨ 'apepɨreutere kwiepa Yawé 'akakaɨyari mɨmatsipitɨa.   
\li1
\v 13 »Pepɨkati'amemiwani.   
\li1
\v 14 »Xeime 'ɨyaya kɨnaya pepɨkakumaɨwani.   
\li1
\v 15 »Pepɨkatinawayani.   
\li1
\v 16 »Xeime 'a'iwatsie pepɨkatiuhɨpani 'itarikakɨ.   
\li1
\v 17 »'A'iwa kiiya pepɨkahiwe'erieka, meta 'ɨyaya, meta 'iparewiwameya 'uki 'uka, meta tuuruya, puxuya, naime tita mɨrexeiya pepɨkatihiwe'erieka».   
\s1 'Ixaheritsixi kememɨte'utimama  
\p
\v 18 Hikɨ 'ixaheritsixi kepauka memi'eniekai tɨranari meta kepauka merɨkariya memɨxeiyakai meta kɨtsi hɨritsie matineikakaikɨ kwinimieme mekatenimamakaitɨni 'ateewa mekaniti'ukaitɨni.  
\v 19 Hikɨ Muitsexi mɨpaɨ mekateniutahɨawe:  
\p —'Ekɨ ketatinekuxaxatɨwani, tepɨmatsi'enieka. Xɨka Kakaɨyari tatiutaxatɨani xɨari tepɨkwini.   
\p
\v 20 Muitsexi mɨpaɨ katiniwarutahɨawe:  
\p —Xepɨkamamaka, Kakaɨyari kaninuani xeta'inɨatake, xe'eyemakatɨ, 'axaxemɨkateyuriekakɨ.   
\p
\v 21 Hikɨ Muitsexi 'ahurawa kaniuyani haiwitɨri mɨka'anuyehekɨatsie Kakaɨyari hakewa mewekai, peru 'ixaheritsixi 'ateewa mekaniti'ukaitɨni.   
\s1 Mawari taiyame tenariyari  
\p
\v 22 Yawé Muitsexi mɨpaɨ katinita'aitɨani:  
\p «'Ixaheritsixi mɨpaɨ ketiniwarutahɨawi: “Xeme xekatenimaika muyuawitsiepai nekanixe'utahɨawe.  
\v 23 Xepɨkanetsi hiweritɨaka, kakaɨyarixi pɨratakɨ meta hurukɨ xepɨkawawewieka meta wahɨxie xepɨka'ukatunuma'uweni.  
\v 24 Mɨrayutimawatɨre tenariyari xekeneneutawewiri kwiepa, mana mawari taiyariyari xemɨnetsi'utiwewiriwanikɨ meta mana kename 'aixɨa meteyuxeiyani hepaɨtsita, muxatsi meta tuurutsixi xewamawatɨ. Ne nepunuani hakewa xemɨnetsihahɨaweni, hikɨ 'aixɨa nepɨxeyurieni.  
\v 25 Xɨka mawari wewiwame xenetsi'utawewirieni tetexikɨ, xepɨka'itiparekutɨwani tixaɨtɨkɨ tepɨakɨ, mɨkɨ tetexi kapatsiekame payeitɨwa.  
\v 26 'Imɨmɨi xepɨkaheukuwewiwani nemawari wewiwametsie, manutiyanitsie mɨka'anamamawerenikɨ”.   
\c 21  
\s1 Kememɨte'uximayaka hepɨrayutsixi  
\r (Mem 21:2-6 – Hut 15:12-18)  
\p
\v 1 »'Ikɨ 'aitsika pekaniwayetuiriemɨkɨ:   
\p
\v 2 »Xɨka xewitɨ hepɨrayu tewiyari 'unaneni waɨriyarika mɨti'uximayakakɨ, mɨkɨ 'ataxewime wiyari pɨtita'uximayatsirieni, matsi 'atahuta wiyaritsie pɨxɨne tixaɨtɨkɨ katiyutuame.   
\p
\v 3 »Kepauka munanaiya waɨriyarika mɨti'uximayakakɨ xɨka yuxaɨta nuani, mɨpaɨta yuxaɨta kaniyemieni.  
\p »Xɨka nuani neɨketɨ, kaniyemienita 'ewitɨtɨ.   
\p
\v 4 »Xɨka ti'aitɨwameya 'uka 'iwitɨtɨani, 'uka ti'aitɨwameya hetsɨa mɨmiemekɨ, xɨka tɨɨri mewarayexeiya, mɨkɨta ti'aitɨwameya hetsɨa mekaniyuhayewakuni tsepa memɨ'ukitsi ya'ukari. Hikɨ ti'uximayatame yuxaɨta kaniyemieni.   
\p
\v 5 »Xɨka ti'uximayatame heitseriemekɨ mɨpaɨ 'utayɨni: “Tsepa ne nepɨkaxɨne, ne nepinaki'erie neti'aitɨwame, meta ne'ɨya metatsiere neniwema”,  
\v 6 'ana kutsiyarieya penuwitɨni 'itsɨkate wahetsɨa, muwa kitenie heutikerieme yunakatsie pe'inɨaritɨarieni. Mɨpaɨ 'itɨarieme yuheyeme yukutsiyari hetsɨa puyuhayewa.   
\p
\v 7 »Xɨka xewitɨ yuniwe 'ukatɨme 'utuani ti'uximayatame mayanikɨ, mɨkɨ 'uka hatsuaku pɨkaxɨne ti'uximayatame 'uki hepaɨ.   
\p
\v 8 »Xɨka kemɨ'ane minanai mɨkɨ 'uka ka'utiwitɨni, xeikɨa mɨka'inakekɨ, mɨkɨ pɨyɨweni marieya mɨrayukatuanikɨ hetsiena mieme. Mitixani'erikɨ mituanikɨ pɨkayɨweni teewapai kiekame hetsɨa, paapaya hamatɨa kememɨte'uxatakai mɨkaraye'atɨakɨ.   
\p
\v 9 »Merikɨteta ti'aitɨwameya 'uka yuniwe pɨta xɨka 'uwitɨtɨani, kaneuyeweka yemekɨ yuniwe hepaɨ mɨtixeiyani.   
\p
\v 10 »Xɨkata xeime pɨta 'ukaratsi 'utiwitɨni, pɨkayɨwe mɨtiwakweririeka yu'ɨitama, yaxeikɨata 'aixɨa ketiwaxeiyani, tiwamikwatɨ meta tiwaketɨatɨ meta yunaime wahamatɨa 'ukahuputɨ.   
\p
\v 11 »Xɨka mɨkɨ haikamekɨ hetsiena mieme yakatikamiemi, pɨyɨwe 'ukaratsi meyani peru nitixaɨtɨkɨ hetsienamieme katiyutuiyatɨ.   
\s1 Teyukwikate kememɨte'apiniyarieni  
\p
\v 12 »Kemɨ'ane xeime mɨtiukwinitɨani mimieni, mɨkɨta pɨmierieni.   
\p
\v 13 »Xɨka mɨpaɨ kara'eriwatɨ tiuyurieni, Kakaɨyari pɨta yahainekaku tiɨyɨni, tiyumiekame pɨyɨwe muyuta'una hakewatsɨ ne nemetaxata.   
\p
\v 14 »Xɨka 'imani mɨtiuyumi, mɨkɨ ke'umierieni tsepa muyu'awieta netukita mawari taiyametsie.   
\p
\v 15 »Kemɨ'ane yupaapa meta yumaama mɨmieni, mɨkɨta ke'umierieni.   
\p
\v 16 »Kemɨ'ane xeime tewi mɨnawani, meta xɨka 'ituani, xɨka hahekɨare 'akuxi ka'ituawetɨ, mɨkɨ ke'umierieni.   
\p
\v 17 »Kemɨ'ane yupaapa yatɨni yumaama yuniukikɨ 'axa'aneme 'ipitɨani, mɨkɨ ke'umierieni.   
\p
\v 18 »Xɨka meyukwitɨwetɨ yu'iwa xewitɨ tiukwinitɨani tetekɨ, yatɨni yumamakɨ, xɨka mɨkɨ 'utatsie kakaitɨ 'ayani kayuawetɨ,  
\v 19 mɨkɨ mɨtikwinitɨa katinayukatuamɨkɨ mu'uayemarienikɨ meta 'uximayatsiyakɨ kemɨreutere. Hikɨ kepaukake mɨtikuye kewetɨmayani yuxaɨta yatɨni 'itsɨ hakwetɨ, 'anake kanixɨnimɨkɨ, hetsiena pɨkarahɨiyani.   
\p
\v 20 »Xɨka xewitɨ tiyu'uximayatame hekuwaxɨani kɨyekɨ 'ukitɨme yatɨni 'ukatɨme, xɨka mɨkɨ 'umɨni, kananutahɨiyamɨkɨ ti'aitɨwameya.  
\v 21 Peru xɨka xeitukari huta tukari 'anukayayu ti'uximayatame 'aixɨa reka'erieni, mikuwaxɨa pɨka'anutahɨiyani hetsɨana mɨmiemetɨkaikɨ ti'uximayatame.   
\p
\v 22 »Xɨka hipatɨ meyukwitɨwetɨ xeime hukame me'uwani, xɨka mɨkɨ ka'umɨni peru xɨka 'umɨni nunutsi 'anuyeweni, pɨrayukatuani kemɨ'ane mɨtiuyuri, kɨnaya kemɨtitawauni peru kemɨtiheitserie.   
\p
\v 23 »Xɨka 'ukaratsi kwinimieme 'uyɨni, mɨpaɨ katinika'inɨarini: xɨka 'umɨni mɨkɨta ke'umierieni,  
\v 24 xɨka xeime hɨxieya watituni mɨkɨta hɨxieya kewatitɨiyani, xɨka tameya 'anaye'una mɨkɨta tameya ke'anaye'unarieni, xɨka mamaya wayemura mɨkɨta mamaya yaxeikɨa, yatɨni 'ɨkaya xɨka wayemura mɨkɨta 'ɨkaya kewayemurarieni,  
\v 25 xɨka 'itaiya mɨkɨta ke'utaiyarieni, xɨka 'iwani mɨkɨta ke'uweiyani, xɨka 'ixuritɨani mɨkɨta ke'uxuritɨarieni.   
\p
\v 26 »Xɨka xewitɨ 'iyehutsuni hɨxitana tiyu'uximayatame 'ukitɨme yatɨni 'ukatɨme, xɨka hɨxieya 'uyetuni, 'aixɨa pɨ'ane xɨka heinɨ'ani, mɨkɨkɨ pɨxɨne.   
\p
\v 27 »Xɨka xewitɨ tiyu'uximayatame tameya 'anaye'una 'uki yatɨni 'uka, mɨrekapitɨanikɨ keheinɨ'ani mɨkɨkɨ pɨxɨne.   
\p
\v 28 »Xɨka tuuru xeime 'utsikɨpa, xɨka tewi 'ɨmɨni tsepa 'uki yatɨni 'uka, mɨkɨ tuuru ke'umierieni tetexikɨ ke'utituaxiexɨani, peru waiyarieya pɨkatikwaiwani. Hikɨ tewakame hetsie pɨkarahɨiwanita.   
\p
\v 29 »Xɨka tuuru tiyutsikɨpani, ke'umierieni tetexikɨ tituaxiexɨame xɨka tewi 'umieni 'ukaratsi yatɨni 'uki. Kutsiyarieya xɨka 'imaikaitɨni kename tuuruya tiyutsikɨpa, mɨyatɨtɨ xɨka ka'ekuwieni, mɨkɨta kutsiyarieya ke'umierieni.   
\p
\v 30 »Xɨka mumierietsie mieme ra'iwauriwani, kerayukatuani pɨta.   
\p
\v 31 »Yaxeikɨata 'ikɨ 'aitsika pɨ'ane xɨka tuuru xeime nunutsi hetsikɨpa yatɨni 'uka nunutsi.   
\p
\v 32 »Xɨka tuuru xeime 'utsikɨpa ti'uximayatame 'uki yatɨni 'ukatɨme, turu kutsiyarieya pɨtiyutuani xeitewiyari heimana tamamata pɨrata tuminiyarikɨ ti'uximayatame kutsiyarieya pɨrakapitɨani. Mɨkɨta tuuru ke'umierieni tetexikɨ.   
\p
\v 33 »Xɨka xewitɨ putsu 'utawewieka 'inɨkatɨtɨ 'ewatitenime 'uhayewa xɨka ka'enuyenani, xɨka tuuru muwa heukaweni yatɨni puxu,  
\v 34 putsu kutsiyarieya pɨrayukatuani tewakame pɨrakapitɨani kemɨraye'aka, peru wakaxi mɨmɨki putsu kutsiyari pɨhetsiemiemetɨni.   
\p
\v 35 »Xɨka xewitɨ tuuru xeime tuuru 'utsikɨpa, mutsikɨparie xɨka 'umɨni, mayeniere ke'utuiyani, yuhutatɨ wakutsiyarima mɨkɨ tuminiyari hixɨata meke'ɨni, meta mumierie waiyarieya hixɨata mekekɨne.   
\p
\v 36 »Tuuru xɨka mɨpaɨ ti'iyamakaitɨni, xɨka kutsiyarieya 'imaikaitɨni kename tuuruya tiyutsikɨpakai peru mɨyatɨtɨ kahekuwieni, kutsiyarieya xeime pɨyetuani wakaxi, peru mɨmɨki hetsiena pɨmiemetɨni.   
\c 22  
\s1 Piinitɨarika  
\p
\v 1 »Xɨka xewitɨ tuuru 'unawani yatɨni muxa, xɨka 'imieni yatɨni xɨka 'ituani, kutsiyarieya pɨyetuirieni yu'auxɨwime tewaxi tuuru munawakɨ, muxa hetsiemiemeta yunaukame muxatsi.   
\p
\v 2 »Xɨka xewitɨ tinawanetɨ 'uxeiyarieni, xɨka 'umierieni, mɨkɨ hepaɨtsita 'atsipɨkatitaniukieni.   
\p
\v 3 »Xɨka mɨkɨ tinawayame 'umierieni hekɨta, mɨkɨ mími hetsie pɨrahɨiyani.  
\p »Tinawayame peuyewetse mɨtiyutuanikɨ tita mɨrenawa. Xɨka ka'iyemanani mɨtiyutuanikɨ, kanituiyamɨkɨ ti'uximayatamekɨ mɨpaɨ mɨtiyutuanikɨ.   
\p
\v 4 »Xɨka tewá hetaxeiyarieni 'akuxi hetsɨana 'ayenieretɨ, mɨkɨ piyetuani 'akuxi xeime tawarita heutinɨkame, tsepa tuuru yatɨni puxu yatɨni muxa.   
\p
\v 5 »Xɨka xewitɨ yutewama tiwaminekaku xeime haraweritana meheutahaxɨani, mɨkɨ kawa'ɨwiyakaku xeime haraweritana mete'ukwani, tewakame pɨrayukatuani 'itsanari 'aixɨa mɨ'anenekɨ.   
\p
\v 6 »Xɨka xewitɨ 'ɨxapa 'uta'ukwani, tɨriku xɨka hayetani yatɨni 'etsari mukuxeɨrietɨkari yatɨni hipame wa'etsaripa, kemɨ'ane mɨtiuyuri kepaɨmetɨ mɨtiutitai mɨkɨkɨ katinayukatɨamɨkɨ.   
\p
\v 7 »Xɨka xewitɨ tumini xeime 'uhɨritɨani yu'iwa mi'ɨwiyanikɨ yatɨni tixaɨtɨ piinitɨarika, xɨka tinawayame tiunawani, mɨkɨ tinawayame pɨrayukatuani kepaɨ mɨtiunawa tawari hepaɨna paɨmeme, xɨkatsɨ 'uwiyarieni.   
\p
\v 8 »Xɨka tinawayame 'uyuta'una, mɨkɨ mɨtihɨritɨariekai pɨyemie 'itsɨkame hetsɨa, naime mɨtitaxatɨanikɨ mɨkɨ 'atsimɨkatiuyurikɨ.   
\p
\v 9 »Xɨka xewitɨ tixaɨtɨ tiuyukapiinitɨwani, meta xewitɨ mɨkɨtsiere, mɨkɨ meyuhutatɨ mepuhu 'itsɨkate wahetsɨa. Kemɨ'ane yakɨ mutaineni, mɨkɨ tawarita xeime pɨyetuani tita mɨtiuyukapiinitɨwakai, tuuru, puxu, muxa, kamixa tsepa tita mɨreuyehɨaka xɨka 'iwauka kename tipiinieyatɨkai.   
\p
\v 10 »Xɨka xewitɨ yuhamiku puxu, tuuru, muxa 'uhɨritɨani yatsepa tita tewatsiekame, xɨka tewaya 'umɨni, tiutakwine, yatɨni xɨka 'unawarieni xewitɨ ka'uniere,  
\v 11 tewakame hamikuya Yawé hɨxie puyutaxata kename yutewa ka'ayeitɨa. Kutsiyarieya yuri ketita'eririeni, meta hamikuya pɨkatiyutuani.   
\p
\v 12 »Xɨka hamikuya 'unieretɨtɨ munawarietsie, mɨpaɨ hɨrixɨa pɨrayukatuani.   
\p
\v 13 »Xɨka tewatsiekame 'ɨrawe 'itakwani, hamikuya pɨkarayukatuani xɨka 'umeteya 'ixeiyatsitɨani.   
\p
\v 14 »Xewitɨ xɨka yuhamiku tewa 'utaniɨwirieni, xɨka mɨkɨ rekwine yatɨni xɨka hemɨni, kutsiyarieya kanierekaku, kemɨ'ane mitaniɨ katinayukatuamɨkɨ.   
\p
\v 15 »Xɨka kutsiyarieya nierekaku tiɨyɨni, mitaniɨ pɨkatiyutuani.  
\p »Xɨka tuminikɨ 'itaniɨkaitɨni mɨkɨkɨ xeikɨa pɨrayukatuani.   
\s1 Kemɨreuyewetse hipame watsata 'uyeikatɨ  
\p
\v 16 »Xewitɨ 'uki xɨka 'ɨimari 'utixɨatɨatɨyani 'uki kamaikame, xɨka hamatɨana 'ukahuni, wapaapama katiniwapitɨamɨkɨ kemɨraye'axe, meta kanitiwitɨmɨkɨ.  
\v 17 'Ɨimari paapaya xɨka ka'itaunieka menuwitɨnikɨ, 'uki pɨrayukatuani 'ɨimari mɨkamayɨiya kemɨraye'axe.   
\p
\v 18 »'Uka 'ikewarikɨ mɨtiyɨ'ɨkitɨa pepɨwatakukuyani.   
\p
\v 19 »Yunaitɨ teɨteri tewaxi memɨwakumaɨwa mɨkɨ meketakwikwiwani.   
\p
\v 20 »Kemɨ'ane mawari xeimepɨta kakaɨyari mɨwewirieni, Yawé pɨta 'uwewirienikeme, mɨkɨ ke'umierieni.   
\p
\v 21 »'Axapepɨkatikuhɨaweni waɨriyarika pepɨkati'aitɨaka 'ateewa kiekame, kena'eriwani 'ekɨ meta 'ateɨterima teewatari xepɨhɨkɨtɨkai 'Ekipitu kwieyaritsie.   
\p
\v 22 »Pepɨkatiwa'aitɨaka kwinimieme wiuraxi meta nutuite,  
\v 23 xɨka 'ekɨ mɨpaɨ petiyurieneni meta 'ateɨterima, mɨkɨ parewiya xɨka menetsi'utawawirieni, yurikɨ ne nekanaineni nekaniwaranu'enimɨkɨ xɨka meha'aiwatɨkani:  
\v 24 waɨkawa nehaxɨakɨ nepɨxekwini xeme 'ixiparakɨ. Xe'ɨitama yuxaɨta mepuyuhayewa, xeniwema nutuite mepɨyuhayewa.   
\p
\v 25 »Xɨka xewitɨ xeme, nehetsɨamieme hawerimɨ'ane tumini 'uniɨtɨani, teyuniniɨtɨwamete wahepaɨ xepɨkatewakɨhɨaweni meta 'anamakame xepɨkawawiyani.   
\p
\v 26 »Xɨka xewitɨ yu'iwa 'ɨkarieya 'akahurieni, piyetuirieni taikai kakɨyɨriwekaku.  
\v 27 Mɨkɨ yu'ɨkari xeime xeikɨa mexeiyakɨ tawarita pɨkaheixeiya xeime hetsiena mahuni. Xɨka netsi'utawawirieni parewiya, ne nepiparewieni kemaineni, ne Kakaɨyari nemɨtinekanenimaya nemɨhɨkɨkɨ.   
\p
\v 28 »'Axapepɨka'utaineni Kakaɨyari hepaɨtsita, meta 'axapepɨkarenutahɨaweni teɨteri wahetsiemieme manuyeka.   
\p
\v 29 »Pepɨkatihayewani peti'atɨwatɨ 'iku mawariyari meta winu mawariyari.  
\p »Xeniwema matɨari miemete nehetsɨa mekanimiemetetɨni.   
\p
\v 30 »Meta tewaxi tuurutsixi meta muxatsi nehetsɨa mekanimiemetetɨni. 'Atahuta tukari yumaama matɨa puyeikani, 'atahairieka tukaritsie pepɨnetsiyetuirieni.   
\p
\v 31 »Xeme neteɨterima xemɨpatsie xepɨhɨkɨtɨni.  
\p »Xepɨka'ikwa'ani wai 'ɨrawe 'ikwaixaya. Mɨkɨ tsɨikɨri xepɨwamikwani.   
\c 23  
\s1 'Aitsika kemɨtiheitserie meta naki'eriya hepaɨtsita  
\p
\v 1 »'Itarikakɨ xepɨkatekuxatani.  
\p »'Axamɨtiuka'iyari pepɨkaparewieka, meta niukikɨ pepɨka'iparewieka 'itsɨkame hetsɨa.   
\p
\v 2 »'Axamemɨte'u'iyari pepɨkawa'ɨkeni.  
\p »Tixanetsiekaku teɨteri yumɨiretɨ kememutiyuaneni mɨpaɨ pepɨka'utaineni.  
\p »Tita mɨtiheitserie pepɨka'uku'e'eiriwani, yumɨiretɨ 'axamemutiyuanekɨ xeikɨa.   
\p
\v 3 »Pepɨkati'itaka xɨka haweri mɨ'ane tixanetani haweri mɨ'ane peparewimɨtɨ xeikɨa.   
\p
\v 4 »Xɨka tuuru pehetaxeiya yatɨni puxu heuyewekame, keneyetua, tsepa mɨmatsi'aka'unie mɨtipiinieya.   
\p
\v 5 »Puxu xɨka 'atiweximeni yu'ika kakematɨ, keneuparewi, tsepa mɨmatsi'aka'unie mɨtipiinieya.   
\p
\v 6 »Tixaɨtɨ memɨkatehexeiya xɨka metexanetani, kemɨtiheitserie pepɨkatiuku'e'eiriwani wahetsiemieme.   
\p
\v 7 »Xeime tewi pepɨkaxanetani 'itarikakɨ.  
\p »Pepɨkawatakukuyani teɨteri 'atsimemɨkateyurie yamemɨtekahu, ne kemɨ'ane hetsie mɨrahɨiwa 'atsikatiyuruwame nepɨkahayeitɨa.   
\p
\v 8 »Tumini xɨka xewitɨ 'awie matsi'ɨitɨaka tixaɨtɨ kemɨkatiheitserie pemɨtiyurienikɨ, pepɨka'inaki'erieka, mɨpaɨ 'itsɨkate kemɨkatiheitserie mepɨteyuriwawe.   
\p
\v 9 »Teewanarixi waɨriyarika xepɨkatewa'aitɨaka, xeme 'ari xepɨtemate yuhetsie: 'Ekipitu kwieyaritsie xeme teewanarixi xepɨhɨkɨtɨkai.   
\s1 'Aitsika 'uxipiya hetsiemieme  
\p
\v 10 »'Ataxewime wiyari 'akwie pepuka'etsani pepuka'itsanani,  
\v 11 peru 'atahuta wiyaritsie pepɨka'ika'eni. Pepika'uxipitɨani, haweri memɨ'anene 'akie kiekatari mana memɨtetikwanikɨ meta yeutari memɨtetikwanikɨ tita memɨtehayewa teɨteri.  
\p »Yaxeikɨa pepɨtiyurieni kaxie haraweriyaritsie meta huriwu haraweriyaritsie.   
\p
\v 12 »'Ataxewime tukari pepɨti'uximayaka, 'atahuta tukaritsie mepɨka'uxipieni 'atuurutsixi meta 'apuxuri, yunaitɨ te'uximayatamete mepɨka'uxipieni 'akie memutinunuiwaxɨ meta teewanarixi.   
\p
\v 13 »Xeketenaye'atɨa naimekɨ kenemɨtixe'uta'aitɨa.  
\p »Hatsuaku hipame kakaɨyarixi xepɨkawarahɨaweni. Kememɨtetetewa hatsuaku xepɨkawaraxaxatani.   
\s1 Haika 'ixɨarariyari wiyaritsie mieme  
\p
\v 14 »Xeiwiyaritsie haikakɨa 'ixɨarari pepuwewiximeni nehetsiemieme.   
\p
\v 15 »Paa mɨkakuxaxani 'ixɨarariyari xepiwewiximeni weiya metseriyaritsie, mɨkɨri mana pɨka'inɨarini. Xeme mɨkɨ metseriyaritsie xekanayekɨne 'Ekipitu. Kenemɨtixe'aitɨa, 'atahuta tukari xekanikwakakuni paa mɨkakuxanariyarietɨka.  
\p »'Aixɨa pɨka'ane xewitɨ nehɨxie mɨ'axeni tixaɨtɨ karapitɨ 'imikierite.   
\p
\v 16 »'Itsanari 'ixɨarariyari pekaniwewimɨkɨ kepauka mexɨakame pemɨtikatɨni pemika'e.  
\p »Xepiwewienita 'ixɨarari naime kepauka xemɨteka'itsanatsie, mɨkɨ wiyari 'anayexɨximekaku.   
\p
\v 17 »Yunaitɨ xeme yuxexuitɨ xeiwiyaritsie haikakɨa xepɨ'axeni, Yawé xekakaɨyari hetsɨa.   
\p
\v 18 »Tikuxanariyame xuriya matɨa xepɨka'inɨitɨaka xemɨnetsitimawirieni.  
\p »Xepɨka'iti'utani wiya 'uxa'arieka mieme mayanikɨ 'ixɨararipa xemɨnetsixatɨa.   
\p
\v 19 »Pepi'atɨani Yawé 'akakaɨyari tukita 'aixɨa mɨti'anene matɨari timieme mɨtitixuawere.  
\p »Tsipu nunutsi maamaya retsieyatsie xepɨka'i'etsani.   
\s1 Niuki tuayame Yawé hetsɨa mieme  
\p
\v 20 »Mɨpaɨ ketinemaika 'Ixaheri, ne nepenunɨ'ani 'ahɨxie niuki tuayame, mɨmatsihe'ɨwiyanikɨ huyeta, mɨmatsi'anuwitɨni hakewa 'ahetsiemieme nemɨrekuha'aritɨa.  
\v 21 Keneu'enieka yaketinekamieni. 'Axapepɨkareyurieneni hɨxiena, nehetsiemieme kaniyɨaneni, pɨkamereuyehɨwirieni xɨka mɨpaɨ pereyurieni.  
\v 22 Xɨka pehenu'enieni, xɨka yapetikayani naimekɨ kenemɨti'aita, memɨmatsi'aye'unie ne newaraye'unietɨ nepayani meta kemɨ'ane 'ahɨxie memu'uni wahɨxie nepukeni.  
\v 23 Neniuki tuayame pɨmatsi'anuwitɨni, mɨkɨ nemɨwaka'una wakwieyaritsie pɨmatsi'atɨani: 'amuxeutsixi wakwietsie, hetitsixi, peretseutsixi, kananeutsixi, heweutsixi meta kewutseutsixi.   
\p
\v 24 »Mɨkɨ wakakaɨyarixima wahɨxie pepɨkahetihɨximakiekani. Nenewieri pepɨkawarepitɨaka kememɨtehehu, pepɨkaware'ɨkirieka. Matsi pɨta xekeniwareti'uniri wakakaɨyarixi meta watetexi mɨpatsietɨka xekenetitara.   
\p
\v 25 »Nenewieri kenepitɨaka Yawé 'akakaɨyari, mɨkɨ 'aixɨa piyurieni 'a'ikwai meta 'ahaa.  
\p »Ne naime kwiniya xehetsie nepɨkapitɨani.   
\p
\v 26 »'Akwieyaritsie xewitɨ 'uka pɨka'anuye'iwetsieni meta xewitɨ kaniwewetɨ pɨkahayani. Ne tukari 'atewime nepɨxepitɨani.   
\p
\v 27 »Kepauka pemunuani xeime kwieyaritsie, yanepɨtiyurieni memɨmatsitimakanikɨ, memeuyuyexɨrienikɨ meta memɨyuta'unakɨ.   
\p
\v 28 »'Ahɨxie nepɨwaranɨ'ani mɨrakatsixi, memuyuta'unaxuanikɨ heweutsixi, kananeutsixi meta hetitsixi.  
\v 29 Nepɨkawarayeweiya kwitɨwa xeiwiyaritsie kapa kwie yuxaɨta yuhayewayu me'uyutamɨiriya 'ɨrawetsixi, mexe'utikwani.  
\v 30 Nepɨwaka'una 'anɨari, kepaukake yuniwema waɨkawa xemɨwarexeiyani kwie naime xemukunanikɨ.   
\p
\v 31 »'Akwie 'anepɨtayeuriya, 'atsita Haramara Mɨxeta hetsie paitɨ meta haramara Meritexaniyu paitɨ, makumawetsiepai 'atsita 'Eupɨrate hatuxameyaritsie paitɨ. 'Ekɨ pepɨtiwata'aitɨani yunaime mana memɨkiekatari, pepɨwarayeweiya.   
\p
\v 32 »Mɨkɨ teɨteri wahamatɨa tɨratu xepɨkawewieka, metatsiere wakakaɨyarixima wahamatɨa.   
\p
\v 33 »Xɨka xewarupitɨani xekwiepa memu'uwanikɨ, mɨkɨ mepɨxewiniya wakakaɨyarixi xewarayexeiyatɨ xemakɨnekɨ, mɨpaɨ 'axaxepɨteyurieni nehetsɨa».   
\c 24  
\s1 Tɨratu 'ixaheritsixi wahetsiemieme  
\p
\v 1 Metatsiere Yawé Muitsexi mɨpaɨ katiniutahɨawe: «Hɨritsie kenatiye'a nehetsɨa, meta 'Aruni, Narawi, 'Awihu, metatsiere haika tewiyari heimana tamamata 'ukirawetsixi 'ixaheritsixi. Mɨkɨ mepɨkatunuma'uni yateewa,  
\v 2 peru 'ekɨ xeikɨa Muitsexi pepɨyɨwe 'ahurawa pemayani nehetsɨa. Yunaitɨ hipatɨ mepɨkayɨwawe 'ahurawa memakɨne meta memanatikɨne 'ahamatɨa».   
\p
\v 3 Muitsexi 'anukayaka meta katiniwarutaxatɨani teɨteri naime Yawé kemetayɨ, mɨkɨta mɨpaɨ mekaniutiyuani yunaitɨ: «Yatepɨteyurieni naime Yawé kemetayɨ».  
\v 4 Hikɨ Muitsexi pɨraka'utɨa naime Yawé kemɨreitahɨawixɨ.  
\p 'Uxa'arieka ximeripaitɨ nanukukeni, tenari timawame kaniutawewieni hɨritɨa. Meta tamamata heimana huta 'Ixaheri nuiwarimama 'inɨariyari, tetexi tamamata heimana huta patsiekame kanayeitɨani.  
\v 5 'Ana hipame temari 'ixaheritsixi kaniwarenɨ'ani, Yawé hetsiemieme tsikerutsixi wamawari taiyariyari memɨwewiyukɨ meta kename 'aixɨa memɨteyuxeiyani mawariyari.  
\v 6 Muitsexi hixɨapa 'akame tuuru xuriyaya tekɨxita kaniukatuaxɨani, xeime hixɨapa 'akamekɨ mɨrayutimawatɨre kaniuta'ɨya.  
\v 7 Hikɨ 'arike tɨratu xapayari kaniutihurieni, kanekaterɨwa 'ixaheritsixi wahɨxie, mɨkɨ mɨpaɨ mekatenita'eiya:  
\p —Yawé naimekɨ kemutayɨ yatepɨtekakɨne.   
\p
\v 8 Muitsexi xuriya 'utihanaka, mɨkɨkɨ teɨteri kaniwaru'ɨya, mɨpaɨ 'utaitɨ:  
\p —'Ikɨ xuriya tɨratu 'inɨariyari kanihɨkɨtɨni, Yawé yapɨtiuyuri meta xeme yaxemutiyuakɨ.   
\p
\v 9 Muitsexi, 'Aruni, Narawi, 'Awihu, metatsiere haika tewiyari heimana tamamata 'ukirawetsixi 'ixaheritsixi mekananutikɨne hɨritsie,  
\v 10 hikɨ mekanixeiya 'Ixaheri Kakaɨyarieya. Hetɨana pukumakai tete witsimɨ'ane muyuawi mɨxawatɨ, witsiranuyehekɨatɨ muyuawi hepaɨ.  
\v 11 'Ukirawetsixi 'ixaheritsixi wa'ukiyarima me'ixeiyakatɨtɨ, mepɨka'ukwi, Kakaɨyari mɨkawarumayɨakɨ.   
\p
\v 12 Yawé Muitsexi mɨpaɨ katiniutahɨawe: «Kenatiye'a hɨritsie nehetsɨa, mana keneuyuhayewa. Nepɨmatsiyetuirieni 'inɨari niukiyari, tete wewerimetsie mɨye'uxa meta ne'aitsika nemaka'utɨa para mɨpaɨ xemɨte'u'uwanikɨ».   
\p
\v 13 Muitsexi Kakaɨyari hɨrieyatsie kaneyani yuparewiwame Kutsuhexi hamatɨa,  
\v 14 peru 'ukirawetsixi mɨpaɨ katiniwarutahɨawe: «'Ena xeketanetakwewieka kepaukake temɨ'axɨani. 'Aruni meta Kuxi matɨa mepuyuhayewa 'ena xehamatɨa, xɨka xewitɨ 'uximatɨarika hexeiyani mɨkɨ yaketiwarutahɨawe».   
\p
\v 15 Kepauka Muitsexi manutitɨa haiwitɨri hɨritsie kananukateni.  
\v 16 Yawé tɨrɨkariyaya xawatɨtɨ kanakateni Tsinahi hɨriyaritsie, 'ataxewime tukari haiwitɨri hɨri panukanakai, 'atahutarieka tukaritsie haiwitɨritsata Yawé Muitsexi kaniutahɨawe.  
\v 17 Me'ixeiyakaku 'ixaheritsixi Yawé tɨrɨkariyaya xawatɨtɨ hɨritsie tai mɨtiyutaiya hepaɨ pɨtiyuxexeiyakai.  
\v 18 Muitsexi kaneutahani haitsata kananutiyani hɨritsie, mana pekatei huta tewiyari tukari meta huta tewiyari tɨkari.   
\c 25  
\s1 Mawarite tukita timieme  
\r (Mem 25:1-7 – Mem 35:4-9)  
\p
\v 1 Merikɨtsɨ Yawé Muitsexi katiniutaxatɨani, mɨpaɨ rehɨawetɨ:  
\v 2 «'Ixaheritsixi mɨpaɨ ketiniwaruta'aitɨa mawari mekenetsi'atɨirieni. Kaneuyewekani memi'atɨanikɨ yunaitɨ kemɨ'ane mɨpaɨ mɨtiwakuyuitɨwani.  
\v 3 Mawarite neminaki'erie pɨhɨkɨtɨni: huru tepɨayari, pɨrata, wurunitse,  
\v 4 muxa 'ixurikiyari mɨyɨtsikimaɨyekɨ mu'uarietɨka meta kwimɨxetakɨ metatsiere mɨxetakɨ, rinu 'ixurikiyari witsimɨ'anene, kapura huxarieya 'ɨkariyari,  
\v 5 muxa 'uki nawiyarieya xetamekɨ 'uarietɨkaime, nawi 'aixɨa mɨ'anene, 'akatsiya kɨyeyari,  
\v 6 huriwa hatseitiyari kɨxeme hetsiemieme, witsimɨtiu'ɨatɨka witsitiyu'ɨariyame hatseiti mɨtiyupata meta 'ɨkwa witsimu'ɨa,  
\v 7 'unitse teteyari, meta hipame tetexi witsimɨ'anene mawari wewiwame kamixaya 'etsimɨnena hetsie meuyaxe meta kuka mekatɨni hetsiemieme.  
\v 8 Meta tuki xepɨnetsitawewirieni, xehamatɨa nemuyeikanikɨ.  
\v 9 Tuki xemɨtawewieni naitɨ pɨtiyepika kenemɨmatixeitsitɨani mɨpaɨ ti'aneneme.   
\s1 Kakuni  
\r (Mem 25:10-20 – Mem 37:1-9)  
\p
\v 10 »Kakuni keneutawewi 'akatsiya kɨyeyarikɨ, xeimeturuyari heimana tamamata tsenitimeturuyari tewime, haika tewiyari heimana tamamata tsenitimeturuyari 'atayeume meta yaxeikɨata mɨpaɨ 'utewime.  
\v 11 Huru kenewakuwiri taɨtana meta herie, meta hurukɨ kenatatenitɨa.  
\v 12 Keneutiwewi naukame huru hanirayari 'ɨkateyatsie keneu'uitɨaxɨa, 'etsatana huhutatɨ kana'uixɨamɨkɨ.  
\v 13 Kurumawime 'akatsiya kɨyeyari keneutiwewi, huru keneutiwiri.  
\v 14 Kɨyexi mukurumawi haniratsie keneuye'uitɨaxɨa kakuni 'etsatana mukumanetsie, mukukweiyanenikɨ.  
\v 15 Mɨpaɨ reheikame keneuhayewa pepɨkahenuyehapanani,  
\v 16 mana pepikamana 'inɨari niukiyari nemɨmatsiyetuirieni.   
\p
\v 17 »Hurukɨ xeikɨa wewiyakame keneutawewi kanamikiyari Kakaɨyari ma'axeni, xeimeturuyari heimana tamamata tsenitimeturuyari tewime meta haika tewiyari heimana tamamata tsenitimeturuyari 'atayeume,  
\v 18 Kakaɨyari teɨtamete yuhutame hurukɨ pepɨwatiwewieni, titsunamekɨ mewewiyatɨkaime, kanamikitsie Kakaɨyari ma'axeni 'etsimeuyeyeutsie mema'uni.  
\v 19 'Etsimeuyeyeutsie mepu'uni Kakaɨyari teɨtamete. Mewetɨkaime meyuxewime keniwarayeitɨa Kakaɨyari ma'axeni.   
\p
\v 20 »Kakaɨyari teɨtamete Kakaɨyari ma'axe heimana mepuye'anatɨkani, kɨmana mepenukanaka. Mepanuyutaxeiyani Kakaɨyari ma'axe meheukanenieretɨ.   
\p
\v 21 »Kanamiki kenanukamana kakunitsie, manata kenekamana 'inɨari niukiyari nemɨmatsiyetuirieni.  
\v 22 Ne mana nepɨ'axeni Kakaɨyari teɨtamete wahixɨapa kakuni heima. Mana ne yanepɨmatikɨhɨaweni naime 'ɨkitɨarika pemɨwakuxaxatɨwanikɨ 'ixaheritsixi.   
\s1 'Akatsiya mexayari  
\r (Mem 25:23-29 – Mem 37:10-16)  
\p
\v 23 »'Akatsiya kɨyeyarikɨ mexa keneutawewi, nauka tewiyari heimana tamamata tsenitimeturuyari tewime meta huta tewiyari heimana 'auxɨwi 'atayeume meta haika tewiyari heimana tamamata 'aweme.  
\v 24 Huru keneukawiri, hurukɨtsiere tenimeyaritsie kenata'utɨa.  
\v 25 Xeitewiyari tsenitimeturuyari 'atayeume kenata'utɨa meta tenimeyari kenatawewi 'auriena hurukɨ.   
\p
\v 26 »Naukame huru hanirayari keneutiwewi mexatsiemieme, xexuime keneu'uitɨaxɨa tsikurieyatsie, ma'ɨkatɨkatsie.  
\v 27 Hanira, mexa tenimeyari 'aurie pukumaneni, mana kɨyexi muye'unikɨ mɨkɨtɨkienenikɨ.   
\p
\v 28 »Mɨkɨ kɨyexi mukurumawi 'akatsiya kɨyexiyari pɨhɨkɨtɨni, huru wiriyarietɨkaitɨ.  
\v 29 Xakɨrɨte, 'itɨte, hurukɨ xeikɨa pɨwewiyatɨkani meta tekɨxite, xarite 'amɨnene winu mawariyari tu'ame.  
\v 30 Mexatsie paa yapepɨramanani, nehɨxie yamɨtixuawenikɨ.   
\s1 Kɨxeme 'uitɨwame  
\r (Mem 25:31-39 – Mem 37:17-24)  
\p
\v 31 »Kɨxeme 'uitɨwame hurukɨ keneutawewi, titsunamekɨ wewiyakame. Hetsiena maweni, 'ɨkayari, muwatixaxawa, tuturi yu'iwitsi hexeiyame, tuturiyari yuxewiriyatɨ xeikɨa payani.  
\v 32 'Ataxewime yumamate pexeiyani, tapa haikatɨ tapata haikatɨ.  
\v 33 Xexuime mamateyaritsie haikakɨa puwatixaxawani 'arimetɨra tuturiyari hepaɨ tiyuxexeiyatɨ, tuturi yu'iwitsiyari hexeiyakame meta xawariyari.  
\v 34 Kɨxeme 'uitɨwame peixeiyanita nauka tekɨxiyari 'arimetɨra tuturiyari hepaɨ 'aneneme, meta yuxawari hexeiyatɨkaime.  
\v 35 Xexuitɨ mamateyari peixeiyani xexuime tekɨxi hixɨata, 'ɨkayari mɨrawiyatɨkatsie.  
\v 36 Tekɨxite meta mamateyari puyuxewiriyani kɨxeme 'uitɨwame hamatɨa, huru xeikɨa pɨhɨkɨtɨni titsunamekɨ wewiyakame.   
\p
\v 37 »Keneutiwewiri 'atahuta kɨxemeyari, muwa keneuka'uitɨa yuhɨxie heuyekɨxeme.  
\v 38 Tepɨa hiru xikame kɨxeme hetsiemieme meta tɨɨ yayatsame, huru xeikɨa pɨhɨkɨtɨni.  
\v 39 Mɨkɨ kɨxeme 'uitɨwame mɨtawewierekɨ meta tinaitɨ mɨreukapinire huru xeitewiyari heimana tamamata heimana haika kiruyari kaniyɨmɨkɨ.   
\p
\v 40 »Kenematiuxeiyatsitɨa hɨritsie yemekɨ mɨpaɨ ti'aneneme ketineutiwewi.   
\c 26  
\s1 Tuki  
\r (Mem 26:1-37 – Mem 36:8-38)  
\p
\v 1 »Tuki mɨpatsie keneutawewi tamamata rinu 'ixurikiyarikɨ 'ayeyeumekɨ, meta muxa hiruyari 'uariekame mɨyɨtsikimaɨye meta kwimɨxetakɨ metatsiere mɨxetakɨ, Kakaɨyari teɨtamete mehaxutɨkaime.  
\v 2 Naitɨ rinu 'ixurikiyari yaxeikɨa pɨyeyeuka, tamamata heimana huta meturuyari heimana 'imeriyu pɨtɨni meta xeimeturuyari heimana nauka tewiyari tsenitimeturuyari patayeyeuka.   
\p
\v 3 »Keneutawipa 'ixuriki 'auxɨwime, yuwiwiyame keneuyuri, hipameta 'auxɨwime yaxeikɨa keneuyuri.  
\v 4 Matɨari pemitawipaxɨtsie 'imatɨrieka 'ixurikitsie, hakɨrɨi kenawɨtɨaxɨa muxa witayarikɨ mɨyɨtsikimaɨyekɨ, meta yaxeikɨa ketineuyuri hutarieka miemetsie.  
\v 5 Matɨari pemitawipaxɨtsie kenawɨtɨa huta tewiyari heimana tamamata hakɨrɨi, yaxeikɨata paɨmeme hutarieka miemetsie, naitɨ yaxeikɨa papaɨmeme mexeiyatɨkanikɨ.  
\v 6 Hikɨta huru kwatsituraiyari 'etsipepeme keneutiwewi, huta tewiyari heimana tamamata 'ixuriki 'amɨyeyeu muyuwiyakɨ, tuki hetsie yuxewiriyatɨ mayanikɨ.   
\p
\v 7 »Tamamata heimana xewi tsipuri wahuxari 'ɨkariyari 'ayeyeume keneutiwewi, tuki manukanarekɨ 'ixuriki kiyari hepaɨ tiyuxexeiyatɨ.  
\v 8 Yaxeikɨa pɨyeyeuka naitɨ, tamamata heimana haika meturuyari heimana 'imeriyu tɨtɨkame meta xeimeturuyari heimana nauka tewiyari tsenitimeturuyari 'atayeyeume.  
\v 9 Keneutawipa 'auxɨwime 'ɨkariyari yuxewitɨ mayanikɨ, hipameta 'ataxewime yuxewiriyame, 'ataxewirieka mieme tuki hɨxie muwiere patitunire.   
\p
\v 10 »Huta tewiyari heimana tamamata kenawɨtɨaxɨa hakɨrɨi matɨari pemitawipaxɨtsie 'imatɨrieka 'ɨkariyaritsie, tawarita hutarieka miemetsie yaxeikɨa paɨmeme.  
\v 11 Hikɨta wurunitse kwatsitɨraiyari keneutiwewi 'etsipepeme huta tewiyari heimana tamamata, hakɨrɨi mawɨtɨkatsie keneuyehatɨaxɨa tuki mayanikɨ, yuxewiriyatɨ naitɨ kanayeimɨkɨ.  
\v 12 Mɨkɨ 'ɨkari tamamata mɨhɨkɨ, xewitɨ mɨkɨ naitsata panukawereni 'anuyuhayewatɨ mɨkɨ tuki warita peukawiwieka.  
\v 13 Mɨkɨ 'ixurikitsie panayuhayeikawani huta tewiyari heimana tamamata tsenitimeturuyari tapa kɨtsimeyaritsie meta tapatatsiere, mɨkɨkɨ tukita pɨreunare.   
\p
\v 14 »Heimana manukawerire keneutawewi tuki hetsiemieme, muxatsi wanawiyari xetamekɨ mɨ'uarietɨkakɨ, mɨkɨ heima 'imatɨrieka manukawerire ketsɨ nawiyarieya 'aixɨa mɨ'ane keneuyuri.  
\v 15 Tuki hetsiemiemeta 'akatsiya mexayari keneutixixi, ma'utɨyani.  
\v 16 Xexuitɨ mexa nauka meturuyari heimana 'imeriyu pɨtɨni meta haika tewiyari heimana tamamata tsenitimeturuyari 'atayeyeutɨ,  
\v 17 meta mɨkɨ mexa xeitapa hutakɨa panumɨtsɨni, mexa heitserie mɨti'uwenikɨ yuhepaɨtsita. Naime mexa 'ematayeyeu tukitsie mieme mɨpaɨ pepɨtiwewieni.  
\v 18 Xeitewiyari mexa pɨyɨni, 'ameuyewatsie tatsutɨa mɨyekatsie.   
\p
\v 19 »Huta tewiyari keneutiwewita pɨrata tepɨayarikɨ mexa hetsiena ma'uni, xexuitɨ mexa huhutatame pexeiyatɨkani, huhutatametsie meuka'unikɨ.  
\v 20 Tayeta muyekatsie 'ameuyewatsie miemeta keneutiwewi xeitewiyari mexa 'ematayeyeu tukitsie mieme.  
\v 21 Huta tewiyari pɨrata tepɨayari keneutiwewita mexa xexuitɨ mɨti'unitsie hetɨana pekaniti'uitɨamɨkɨ.  
\v 22 'Etsimeuyewatsieta 'ataxewime mexa keneu'uitɨa, tau makayuyuipike hepatsie,  
\v 23 tawarita xexuime keneuka'uitɨaxɨa mutatsikuritɨkatsie.  
\v 24 Mɨkɨ mexa yu'aurie puti'uka, yuxexuitɨ mituikatɨka pexeiyani, wapaitɨ xeihanirayarikɨ puyutseiriyani. Hutakɨa yaxeikɨa ketineuyuri mutatsikuritɨkatsie,  
\v 25 'atahaika mexayari pɨyɨni meta tamamata heimana 'ataxewi mexatɨa mieme pɨrata tepɨayari, huhutatame xeimexayaritɨamieme.   
\p
\v 26 »'Akatsiya kɨyeyari pepɨtixixieni manukuhini: meta 'auxɨwime mexate tuki 'etsata mieme,  
\v 27 'auxɨwime tapa mieme, 'auxɨwimeta 'etsimauyewatsie mieme tuki manutinieretsie.  
\v 28 Kɨyexi ma'utɨka wahixɨapa mukuhuni mexate heutanetɨkaitɨ kaniyɨmɨkɨ.  
\v 29 Mexa mɨpepetsawi huru keneutiwiri meta huru hanirayari keneutiwewi manukuhini mana mauye'uixɨanikɨ. Yaxeikɨa manukuhini huru keneutiwiri.  
\v 30 Tuki keneutawewi kenematiuxeitsitɨa hɨritsie yemekɨ mɨpaɨ 'anekame.   
\p
\v 31 »'Ixuriki 'ayeume keneutawewi meuwiere mɨyɨtsikimaɨyekɨ, kwimɨxetakɨ meta mɨxetakɨ meta rinu witsimɨ'anekɨ, Kakaɨyari teɨtametemama mehaxutɨkaime hetsiena.  
\v 32 Keneuwi huru kwatsituraiyarikɨ, nauka 'akatsiya 'ikitsaraɨyaritsie huru muwiriyarietɨkatsie tiwiyakame. Naukame pɨrata tepɨayaritsie pepe'uitɨani.  
\v 33 'Ixuriki hixɨapa keneutawi kwaitsituraitekɨ, Muyepatsietsie meta Waɨkawa Muyepatsietsie mukunatɨkanikɨ, tɨratu kakuniyari 'ixuriki warita mayekanikɨ.  
\v 34 Tɨratu kakuniyari kenanukanama kanamikiyarikɨ Kakaɨyari ma'axetsie, Waɨkawa Muyepatsietsie paitɨ,  
\v 35 'ixuriki meuwie hɨxietsie Waɨkawa Muyepatsietsie, tuki 'etsata tayeta muyekatsie mexa keneutiketsa. Kɨxeme 'uitɨwameta mexa hɨxie keneutiketsa tatsutɨa muyekatsie.   
\p
\v 36 »'Ixuriki keneutawewi tuki kitenie mieme mɨyɨtsikimaɨyekɨ, kwimɨxetakɨ meta mɨxetakɨ rinu witsimɨ'anetsie tixukame.  
\v 37 Mɨkɨ 'ixuriki hetsiemieme, 'auxɨwime 'akatsiya kɨyeyari 'ikitsaraɨyari keneutixixi meta huru keneutiwiri, huru kwatsituraiyari hexeiyatɨkaime, meta wurunitsekɨ keneutiwewiri 'auxɨwime hetsiena ma'uni.   
\c 27  
\s1 Mexa mawari taiyariyari wewiwame  
\r (Mem 27:1-8 – Mem 38:1-7)  
\p
\v 1 »Mexa keneutawewi mawari wewiwame 'akatsiya kɨyeyarikɨ, 'utatsikuritɨkaime yaxeikɨa huta meturuyari heimana xeitewiyari heimana tamamata tsenitimeturuyari heutatetewame, meta xeimeturuyari heimana xeitewiyari heimana tamamata tsenitimeturuyari 'awekame.  
\v 2 Naitsata naukakɨa muta'itsikinatɨkatsie kenawewiexɨa 'awateya, mexa matɨa yunaitɨ puyuxewiriyani, meta wurunitsekɨ keneukawiri mexa mawari taiyariyari wewiwame.  
\v 3 Yaxeikɨata ketineutiwewi wurunitsekɨ naime tita mɨreuyewetse mawari matiwewiwa, naxi yetsame, 'itɨ 'amɨpa, tepɨa manuxɨte meta tɨɨ yayatsame.  
\v 4 Meta 'ayexaxawame keneutawewiri wurunitsekɨ, naukakɨa muta'itsikinatɨkatsie hanira kenamanaxɨa.  
\v 5 Mawari taiyariyari wewiwame hetɨa tenimeyari manuka'atɨkatsie kana'uimɨkɨ hanira, mexa hixɨapa kaniuyemarimɨkɨ.  
\v 6 Hutame keneutiwewi kɨyexi kurumawime 'akatsiya kɨyeyarikɨ, mexa mawari wewiwametsiemieme meta wurunitse keneukawiri.  
\v 7 Kɨyexi mɨkurumawi haniratsie peuyehaxɨani, 'a'anuyetɨtɨ mawari wewiwametsie, mɨkɨ kɨmana mukukweiyanenikɨ.  
\v 8 Mawari wewiwame pemɨtawewieni 'uxawame pepɨyurieni, mexakɨ wewiyakame, kenematiuxeitsitɨa hɨritsie mɨpaɨ 'anekame.   
\s1 Takwa timiemetsie  
\r (Mem 27:9-19 – Mem 38:9-20)  
\p
\v 9 »Takwa tuki hetsiemieme pepɨtawewieni. Tahetɨa muyekatsie huta tewiyari heimana 'auxɨwi meturuyari pexeiyani, meta rinu 'ixurikiyari 'aixɨa mɨ'anene hawɨtɨkaitɨ,  
\v 10 xeitewiyari kɨyexi mɨka'uni pexeiyani, xeitewiyari wurunitse tepɨayari kɨyexi hetsiena ma'uni. Kɨyexi pexeiyatɨkani kɨmana naitɨ muyuwiyaxɨani pɨrata tepɨayari meta hanira metatsiere pɨrata karawatuyari.  
\v 11 Yaxeikɨata heutatewame tayetatsie huta tewiyari heimana 'auxɨwi meturuyari pexeiyani, 'ixuriki hawɨtɨkaime meta xeitewiyari kɨyexi mɨka'uni pɨyɨni meta yaxeikɨa paɨmeme hetsiena ma'uni wurunitse tepɨayari. Metatsiere kɨyexi hanira pexeiyatɨkani meta kɨmana muyuwiyaxɨani metatsiere kwatsiturai naitɨ pɨrata tepɨayari pɨtihɨkɨtɨni.   
\p
\v 12 »'Etsimeuyewatsie tau makayuyuipike hepatsie, xeitewiyari heimana huta meturuyari heimana 'imeriyu peutatewani, 'ixuriki meuwɨre pexeiyani, tamamata kɨyexi mɨka'uixɨani meta hepaɨna paɨmetɨ hetsiena ma'uni wurunitse tepɨayari.  
\v 13 Yaxeikɨata tau manatineika hepatsie, xeitewiyari heimana huta meturuyari heimana 'imeriyu pexeiyani.  
\v 14 Mɨranutahakitɨretsie xeitapatsie 'atahuta meturuyari pexeiyani 'ixuriki meuwɨ, haikatɨ kɨyexi pɨyɨni muka'uni meta haikatɨ hetsiena ma'uni,  
\v 15 yaxeikɨata pɨti'aneni xeitapatsie.   
\p
\v 16 »Kuraru kitenie 'ixuriki peuwiere 'atanauka meturuyari tewitɨ, pɨwewiyaka wita mɨyɨtsikimaɨyekɨ, kwimɨxetakɨ, mɨxetakɨ, rinu witsimɨ'ane hetsie raxuiyakame, meta naukame kɨyexi pexeiyani naukameta hetsiena ma'uni.  
\v 17 Naitɨ kɨyexi takwa mukunama, hanira pexeiyatɨkani, meta pɨrata kwatsituraiyari, metatsiere wurunitse tepɨayari mituikaxɨani.  
\v 18 Takwa huta tewiyari heimana 'auxɨwi meturuyari pɨtewini meta xeitewiyari heimana huta meturuyari heimana 'imeriyu patayeuka, rinu 'ixurikiyari 'aixɨa mɨ'anene hexeiyakame huta meturuyari heimana xeitewiyari heimana tamamata tsenitimeturuyari tɨtɨkame, meta mituikatɨka wurunitse pɨhɨkɨtɨni.  
\v 19 Naitɨ manuyemɨtsɨ mɨkatsunirixɨani meta tita tukita mutiyukumauwa wurunitsekɨ pɨtiyɨni, metatsiere kurarutsiemieme mɨkatsunirixɨani.   
\s1 Kɨxeme hatseitiyari  
\r (Mem 27:20-21 – Maw 24:1-3)  
\p
\v 20 »Mɨpaɨ ketiniwaruta'aitɨa 'ixaheritsixi huriwa hatseitiyari hɨkɨame memɨmatsi'atɨirienikɨ, kɨxeme yuheyemekɨ mɨtatɨkanikɨ.  
\v 21 'Aruni meta niwemama tɨkarikɨ yamekatenitaiyakakuni Yawé hɨxie 'ixuriki tukiyarita, 'ixuriki meuwie hɨxie tɨratu kakuniyari muyekatsie. 'Ikɨ 'aitsika 'ixaheritsixi mepaye'atɨaka, yuheyemekɨ wanuiwarima yunaitɨ.   
\c 28  
\s1 Mawari wewiwamete wakemari  
\p
\v 1 »Merikɨte 'a'iwa 'Aruni keneuta'ini meta niwemama Narawi, 'Awihu, 'Eriyatsaxi meta 'Itamaxi. 'Ixaheritsixi watsata mɨkɨ mawari wewiwamete mepɨhɨkɨtɨni.  
\v 2 'A'iwa 'Aruni kamixateya ketineutiwewi mɨpatsietɨka mɨmariwenikɨ 'aixɨa mɨtixeiyariekakɨ.  
\v 3 Ketinewarutaxatɨa temaiwawemete yanemɨtiwarupitɨa, 'Aruni kamixaya memɨtiwewienikɨ 'ixuriki mɨraye'atɨkakɨ, mɨpaɨ 'ana nemɨtipatakɨ nemawari wewiwame mayanikɨ.   
\p
\v 4 »Kemarite pemɨtitiwewieni 'ikɨ pɨtihɨkɨ: kamixa 'etsimɨnena, kuka mekatɨni, kamixa 'emɨtewi, xeime kamixa 'atewime tixukame, hɨiyame meta xupureru. Mɨkɨ kamixate mɨtipatsietɨka 'Aruni pepɨtitiwewirieni meta niwemama nemawari wewiwamete memɨhɨkɨtɨnikɨ.  
\v 5 Mɨkɨ pemɨtitiwewienikɨ huru pepuyurieni, meta 'ixuriki mɨyɨtsikimaɨye, kwimɨxeta meta mɨxeta metatsiere rinu 'ixurikiyari.   
\s1 Kamixa 'etsimɨnena  
\r (Mem 28:6-14 – Mem 39:2-7)  
\p
\v 6 »Kamixa 'etsimɨnena pɨtaxuire hurukɨ, hiru mɨyɨtsikimaɨyekɨ, kwimɨxetakɨ, mɨxeta meta rinu 'aixɨa mɨ'anekɨ.  
\v 7 Naiparieyatsie pawɨtɨkani ya'atayeyeutɨ, mɨkɨkɨ makuwiwierikenikɨ.  
\v 8 Hɨiyame tixukametsiere, kamixa manuhɨayani, hurukɨ, 'ixuriki mɨyɨtsikimaɨye, kwimɨxeta, mɨxeta, meta rinu 'ixurikiyari 'aixɨa mɨ'ane mɨkɨ naitɨ puyuxewiriyani.   
\p
\v 9 »'Unitse teteyari keneutitɨki hutame, mɨkɨtsie keniwara'utɨa 'Ixaheri niwemama tamamata heimana huta memɨyupaɨme  
\v 10 kememɨteheukunuiwa, xeime tetetsie me'ataxewime keniwareu'utɨa, meta me'ataxewime xeimetsie.  
\v 11 Tetexi witsimɨ'anene mɨtixixiwa, katineu'utɨaxɨamɨkɨ tseyu kemɨtiwewiwa hepaɨ: hurutsie piwetsitɨaxɨani,  
\v 12 hikɨ kamixa 'etsimɨnena wiwierieyatsie kanekayatsaxɨamɨkɨ. Mɨpaɨ 'ana 'Aruni yunaiparitsie puwara'utɨatɨkani 'Ixaheri niwemama, Yawé mɨwara'eriwanikɨ.  
\v 13 Keneutiwewita huru 'etsipepeme 'anuyexaxawame mana pemeiyatsaxɨanikɨ,  
\v 14 meta hutame huru kaunariyari keneutiwewi, huru meukateitsie mawɨrixɨanikɨ.   
\s1 Mawari wewiwame kukaya  
\r (Mem 28:15-28 – Mem 39:8-21)  
\p
\v 15 »Tawitsie mieme kuka heitserie mɨtikuxata, pepitawewieni tixukame hurukɨ, hiru mɨyɨtsikimaɨyekɨ, kwimɨxetakɨ, mɨxetakɨ rinu 'aixɨa mɨ'anekɨ, yaxeikɨa rewewiyakame kamixa 'etsimɨnena hepaɨ.  
\v 16 'Ayehutame pepɨyurieni yaxeikɨa heutatetewame, xeitewiyari tsenitimeturuyari 'ayetewime meta xeitewiyari tsenitimeturuyari 'atayeukame.  
\v 17 Pepeiyatsaxɨani naukakɨa tetexi 'anukutetɨkaime witsimɨ'anene. Mexɨakame mukukatsie keneuyatsaxɨa xetamekɨ, taxaɨyemekɨ meta tsiɨraɨyemekɨ mutimerɨkatɨka,  
\v 18 hutariekata, yuawitɨ tsiɨraɨyemekɨ, yuawimekɨ mukutuxie meta tuxamekɨ mutimerɨka,  
\v 19 hairieka miemetsieta, merie xetatɨ taxaɨyemekɨ, tuxamekɨ kapemaɨyemekɨ meta mɨyɨtsikimaɨyekɨ,  
\v 20 naurieka mukukatsieta, taxaɨyetɨ, kwimɨyɨwi meta tsiɨraɨyemekɨ. Hurutsie hatetɨkaime pepeuyatsaxɨani.  
\v 21 Tamamata heimana huta pɨpaɨmeni tetexi, xexuitɨ nuiwaritsie puwa'inɨaritɨni. Xexuime tetetsie 'Ixaheri niwemama tamamata heimana huta memɨyupaɨme mepa'utɨkani tseyu hepaɨ.   
\p
\v 22 »Hurukɨ kuka wiwieriyari keneutiwewi ya'atayeyeume, mukutapierikeni 'awɨtɨkaime.  
\v 23 Kukatsie hutame huru hanirayari kenamanaxɨa tapa mutatsikuritɨkatsie.  
\v 24 Kenawɨtɨaxɨa huru kaunariyari kuka hanirayaritsie.  
\v 25 Huru kaunariyari muhuta mayexaxawa kamixa 'etsimɨnena naiparieyatsie pepekuwiwitɨaxɨani makatɨrekɨ yɨhɨxie.   
\p
\v 26 »Hutameta hanira keneutiwewi, kukatsie hetɨana paitɨ muta'itsikinatɨkatsie kenamanaxɨa kamixa 'etsimɨnenatsie mɨtinakenikɨ.  
\v 27 Yaxeikɨata hutame huru hanirayari keneutiwewi, kamixa 'etsimɨnenatsie kenamanaxɨa naipari hetɨatsie hɨiyame manukuka heima keneuwipaxɨa.  
\v 28 Hanira kuka hetsie mamane kamixa 'etsimɨnena hanirayari hamatɨa pɨhɨire 'ixuriki yuawimekɨ, hɨiyame puwatseiriyani kamixa kuka matɨa muyuwiyanikɨ.  
\v 29 Mɨpaɨ 'Aruni kepauka Muyepatsietsie meutahani yutawitsie pekatɨkɨni, kuka 'aixɨa mɨti'ane mɨtikuxatanikɨ, 'Ixaheri niwemama kememɨtetetewa pɨwara'utɨaka, Yawé muwara'eriwanikɨ.  
\v 30 Tawitsie mieme kuka heitserie mɨtikuxata, muwa pepeikayatsa \it 'urimi\it* meta \it tumimi\it*. Mɨpaɨ kepauka 'Aruni Yawé hɨxie meutahani peixeiyani yutawitsie 'ixaheritsixi wa'inɨari.   
\s1 Hipatɨ kemari mawari wewiwame  
\r (Mem 28:31-43 – Mem 39:22-31)  
\p
\v 31 »'Ixuriki mɨyɨtsikimaɨye pepɨyurieni kamixa 'etsimɨtewi heima mieme,  
\v 32 hixɨapa hewatitenime mu'u rewatinakeme. Mewatitenitsie 'atatenime, kamixa 'etsimɨtewi kemɨrewewiya hepaɨ, mɨka'ukatsanikenikɨ.  
\v 33 'Ixuriki tenimeyaritsie putuni wita mɨyɨtsikimaɨyekɨ kwimɨxetakɨ, mɨxetakɨ wewiyatɨkaime, meta huru kapanayari 'anayewɨtɨkaime.  
\v 34 Naime 'ixuriki tenimeyaritsie kapana meta wita putuniyari kenatawɨtɨa.  
\v 35 Mɨkɨ 'ixuriki 'Aruni penakatɨkɨni kepauka mɨti'uximayaka, kapana mutitiraurɨkanikɨ kepauka Yawé hɨxie Muyepatsietsie mɨyeyeikani, mɨpaɨ mɨkɨ mɨkamɨnikɨ.   
\p
\v 36 »Huru tepɨayari keneutawewi 'etsitsuikame 'etsiyeume, hetsiena ketina'utɨa tseyu hepaɨ re'ukame: “Mɨpatsie Yawé Hetsie Mieme”.  
\v 37 Keneuwipa mukuretsitsie 'ixuriki yɨtsikimaɨyemekɨ, mɨkɨ hɨxiena tikunanakeme.  
\v 38 Mɨkɨ tepɨa tseyuyari 'Aruni yukanata yakatinemakamɨkɨ, mɨkɨkɨ Yawé naime 'ixaheritsixi wamawari mɨnaki'eriekakɨ, mɨpaɨ 'Aruni 'axamɨti'ane yuhetsie pɨtikuhɨweni kepauka mawari memɨyetuayanitsie.   
\p
\v 39 »Kamixa 'amɨtewi meta mukuretsi rinu 'ixurikiyari pepɨyurieni. Hɨiyame pɨ'itseni witsireukuwewiyatɨ.  
\v 40 'Aruni niwewema kamixa 'amɨtɨtɨ pekaniwatiwewiriemɨkɨ, kuxira meta mukuretsi, mɨkɨ naitɨ witsipɨti'aneneni 'aixɨa memɨtexeiyariekakɨ.  
\v 41 Xɨkari pe'itikemaritɨani 'a'iwa 'Aruni meta niwemama, pepɨwakawirieni hatseiti pemɨwahɨritɨani heitserie memexeiyanikɨ mepatsietɨ mete'aitatɨ nemawari wewiwamete memɨhɨkɨtɨnikɨ.   
\p
\v 42 »Metatsiere weruxi keniwarutiwewiri 'etɨtɨme wateurite mɨnakakɨ meta memayɨhɨayatsie 'atɨkaime.  
\v 43 'Aruni meta niwemama kepauka memeutahaxɨani tukita mɨkɨta mepuyewetɨkani, yatɨni kepauka 'aurawa memɨkɨne 'ɨkwa mawariyari matitaiyarɨwatsie meteta'uximayatake Muyepatsietsie, xɨka mɨpaɨ mekate'uyurieni mekanikwikuni. 'Ikɨ 'aitsika kanihɨkɨtɨni 'Aruni hetsiemieme meta nuiwarimama hetsiena memɨyekɨne.   
\c 29  
\s1 Mawari wewiwamete kememɨte'upatsie  
\r (Mem 29:1-37 – Maw 8:1-36)  
\p
\v 1 »Pemɨwapatakɨ nemawari wewiwamete memakɨnekɨ nehetsiemieme, mɨpaɨ pekatiniyurimɨkɨ: Xeime tsikeru pekanimiemɨkɨ xeiwiyari hɨkame meta yuhutame muxatsi 'ukitsi 'aixɨa me'anenekame,  
\v 2 tɨriku mɨtɨxiyarikɨ paa pepɨtiwewieni meta tsuira tikuxanariyame kanɨkame pɨwiyamatɨkani xeikɨa, yaxeikɨata kɨxau tikuxanariyame kanɨkame pepɨtiwewieni wiyamatɨkaime.  
\v 3 Tsikɨiwititsie paa kenekamana, tsuira meta kɨxau metatsiere meyuhutame muxatsi 'ukitsi keneneuxatɨa.  
\v 4 Hikɨ pepɨwaranuwitɨni 'Aruni meta niwemama 'ixuriki tukiyari manuwe hɨxie, mana pepɨwa'ɨya.  
\v 5 'Aruni kemarite ketinanakatɨtɨa kamixa 'amɨtewi meta heriemieme kamixa 'etsimɨnena hɨxiena mieme yunɨkame kukayari meta kamixa tixukame. Kuka tawitsie mieme pɨtapierixɨani hɨiyametsie  
\v 6 mukuretsi mu'uyatsie kenanukuwiri meta tseyu hamakama mɨpatsie.  
\v 7 Hatseiti mɨtiyupata keneukawiri mu'uyatsie.  
\v 8 Hikɨta niwemama keniwarawitɨka kamixa 'amɨtɨtɨ keniwaranakatɨtɨa,  
\v 9 meta mukuretsi hetsiemieme, hikɨta 'Aruni meta niwemama wahɨiyamekɨ pepɨwaranahɨaxɨani. Mɨpaɨ pepɨtiwahɨritɨani, meta mawari wewiwamete mɨkɨ nuiwari wahetsiemieme 'aitsika pɨhɨkɨtɨni yuheyemekɨ.   
\p
\v 10 »Tsikeru kene'atɨa tuki hɨxie mana 'Aruni meta niwemama mu'uyatsie yumamakɨ memeutimenikɨ,  
\v 11 mana Yawé hɨxie pepitimawa tsikeru.  
\v 12 'A'itɨwamekɨ xuriyatsie keneme'i mawari taiyame 'awayatsie keneuxurima, muyuhayewata xuriya mawari taiyame hetɨa pepitiyeurieni.  
\v 13 Nema meta muume muhuta wiyayari mi'eimatɨka keneukaxiteki naime, keneutitaiya mawari taiyametsie,  
\v 14 peru tsikeru waiyari, nawiyari meta kwitaya pepititaiya 'ateewa xemakuteitsie, mɨkɨ mawari memɨ'itiyanikɨ pɨhɨkɨtɨni.   
\p
\v 15 »Xeime muxa 'uki pepɨwahana 'Aruni meta niwemama mu'uyatsie memeutimenikɨ,  
\v 16 hikɨ pepitimawa, xuriyayakɨ mawari taiyame pepɨta'ɨya meta nauka 'etsatanayaritsie.  
\v 17 Muxa keneutixitexɨa, kwinuri petihauxime meta 'ɨkateya, 'etsimɨpepetsie perapime meta muxa mu'uya,  
\v 18 muxa naime pekanitataiyamɨkɨ mawari taiyametsie. Mɨkɨ mawari taiyariyari, 'imikieri taipa warɨkariekame kanihɨkɨtɨni, witsimu'ɨa Yawé minake.   
\p
\v 19 »Xeime muxa tawari kene'atɨa, 'Aruni meta niwemama mu'uyatsie memeutimenikɨ,  
\v 20 hikɨ muxa pekanimiemɨkɨ, 'Aruni nakaya heima 'etsiwa tserietana mieme pekanixurimamɨkɨ yaxeikɨata niwemama, meta wa'itɨwame 'amupapa watserieta miemetsie meta wa'ɨkatsie 'amupapayari watserieta miemetsie. 'Ariketa mawari taiyame xuriyakɨ pekanita'ɨyamɨkɨ meta nauka 'etsatanayaritsie,  
\v 21 meta 'etsiwa xuriyakɨ metatsiere 'etsiwa hatseiti mɨtiyupatakɨ, 'Aruni niwemama yunaime keniwaruti'ɨya wakemaritetsie. Mɨpaɨ 'Aruni meta niwemama mepatsietɨ mepakɨne meta wakemarite tipatsietɨ pɨrayani.   
\p
\v 22 »'Ikɨ muxa mawari wewiwamete mɨwapatakɨ mɨ'ayumiemekɨ, kwaxieya keneuti'uta, kwinurite wiyayari, nema, muume muhuta, meta teuri tserietana mieme.  
\v 23 Paa tsikɨiwititsie mɨyemane tikuxanariyame mɨkanɨitɨarie Yawé hɨxie mama, xeime paa pekananati'ɨimɨkɨ meta tsuira mɨwiyama xeimeta mɨkɨxauni,  
\v 24 naime 'Aruni meta niwemama ketiniwayetuiri teikɨ memeitserakɨ mawari Yawé hetsiemieme mɨhɨkɨkɨ.  
\v 25 Mɨkɨ kwitɨwa mepɨmatsiyetuirieni 'ekɨ Yawé hɨxie pemititaiyakɨ mawari taiyametsie mawari taiyariyari witsimu'ɨa yɨnɨkame, 'ikɨ 'imikieri taipa warɨkariekame kanihɨkɨtɨni Yawé hetsiemieme.  
\v 26 'Ariketa muxa tawieyatsie mieme wai pekananatituimɨkɨ, mɨ'inɨariyarikɨ 'Aruni kemɨranayexeiyarie nemawari wewiwame mayanikɨ, hikɨ mawari Yawé hɨxie pekaniyuitɨwamɨkɨ, 'ikɨ kani'ayumiemetɨni mawari muyuitɨariwa mɨhɨkɨkɨ. Mɨkɨ muyuhayewa 'ahetsiemieme payani.   
\p
\v 27 »Keneuti'uta tsikeru waiyarieya tawitsie mieme mawari muyuitɨariwa mayeitɨarie 'Aruni meta niwemama heitserie memɨpitɨarienikɨ, yaxeikɨata teuri mawari mayeitɨarie, mɨkɨ pɨwahetsiemieme.  
\v 28 'Ipaɨ tipaɨmetɨ xehetsiemieme pɨrayeikani kepauka 'ixaheritsixi 'aixɨa memɨteyuxeiya mawariyari memɨwewie Yawé hetsiemieme, mɨkɨ mepɨteyetuiriyarɨwani 'Aruni meta niwemama.   
\p
\v 29 »'Aruni kemarieya mɨpatsie 'uxa'atɨniwarie nuiwarimama wahetsiemieme payani, heitserie memexeiyanikɨ mepatsietɨ mete'aitatɨ mawari wewiwamete memɨhɨkɨtɨnikɨ.  
\v 30 Tsepa ke'anetɨ mawari wewiwame 'Aruni nuiwarieyatɨtɨ netukita munuani muyepatsietsie mɨtita'uximayatakɨ, mɨkɨ kamixate pɨranakatɨkɨni 'atahuta tukari.   
\p
\v 31 »Mɨkɨ muxa kɨmana memupatsie, keneuka'etsa xaɨtsie muyepatsietsie.  
\v 32 'Ixuriki tukiyari manuwe mɨranutahakitɨretsie, 'Aruni meta niwemama muxa waiyarieya mepɨtikwani meta paa tsikɨiwititsie mɨyemane.  
\v 33 Mɨkɨ 'imikierikɨ mepɨ'itiyaka, mɨkɨkɨ heitserie memexeiyanikɨ mete'aitatɨ meta mepɨpatsie, mɨkɨ xeikɨa mepɨyɨwaweni memitikwani, xewitɨ tawarita pɨkayɨwe, mawari mɨpatsie mɨhɨkɨkɨ.  
\v 34 Xɨka 'uyuhayewa muxa waiyarieya meta paa, 'uxa'arieka keneutitaiya. Pɨkayɨweni mɨtikwaiyanikɨ, mɨkɨ mawari mɨpatsie mɨhɨkɨkɨ.   
\p
\v 35 »Yaketineuyuri kenematiu'aitɨa 'Aruni hetsiemieme meta niwemama wahetsiemieme. 'Atahuta tukari pepuyurieni mɨkɨ hɨritɨarika pemɨwapitɨanikɨ.  
\v 36 Xexuime tukaritsie tsikeru xeime peputimawani kɨmana xemɨ'itiyakakɨ. Pɨ'itiyaka mawari taiyame mawari hetsiena mieme pepɨwewieni, hatseiti mɨtiyupatakɨ pepi'ɨya.  
\v 37 Mɨpaɨ pepɨtiyurieneni 'atahuta tukari. Mɨpaɨ mawari wewiwame meta tita mɨtiyuitɨani 'itiyatɨ payani.   
\p
\v 38 »Xexuime tukaritsie pepɨwarutimawani yuhutame muxatsi xeiwiyari memɨhɨtɨka mawari taiyametsie.  
\v 39 Ximeri kahekɨareyu xeime pekanitimawamɨkɨ, xeimeta taikai.  
\v 40 Ximeri pemitimawa matɨa, huta kiruyari tɨriku mɨtɨxiyari pepɨtimawa meta huriwa hatseitiyari nɨkame, meta winu xeirituruyari.  
\v 41 Xeime taikai pemɨtimawa muxa, mɨkɨ mawari taiyariyari payani, witsimu'ɨa Yawé minake meta tinɨkame ximeri timieme hepaɨ.   
\p
\v 42 »Xenuiwarima memɨtinunuiwa yaxeikɨa Yawé hetsiemieme mawari taiyariyari mepuwewieka. Netuki 'ixurikiyari manuwe hɨxie xepɨteyurieka, ne 'ahamatɨa mana nemɨrataxatatsie,  
\v 43 yaxeikɨa 'ixaheritsixi wahamatɨa nemanetixexeɨriwatsie. Netɨrɨkariya witsimɨ'ane mana katinakupatamɨkɨ.   
\p
\v 44 »Patsiekame nekanayeitɨamɨkɨ mɨkɨ tuki 'ixurikiyari meta mawari wewiwame, meta 'Aruni meta niwemama mepatsiekame nekaniwarayeitɨamɨkɨ memɨte'uximayakakɨ nehetsiemieme mawari wewiwametekɨ.  
\v 45 'Ixaheritsixi wahamatɨa nekaniuyeikamɨkɨ, wakakaɨyari nepɨhɨkɨtɨni.  
\v 46 'Ana mɨpaɨ mepɨtehetimani kename ne Yawé nehɨkɨ wakakaɨyari. 'Ekipitu nemɨwarayewitɨ wahamatɨa nemuyeikanikɨ. Ne Yawé xekakaɨyari nekanihɨkɨtɨni.   
\c 30  
\s1 'Ɨkwa witsimu'ɨa taiyame mexayari  
\r (Mem 30:1-5 – Mem 37:25-28)  
\p
\v 1 »'Ɨkwa taiyame witsimu'ɨa mexayari keneutawewi 'akatsiya kɨyeyarikɨ.  
\v 2 Yaxeikɨa hatewatɨkaime, huta tewiyari heimana 'auxɨwi tsenitimeturuyari 'ayetewime meta yaxeikɨa mɨpaɨ 'atayeukame meta nauka tewiyari heimana tamamata tsenitimeturuyari 'aweme. 'Awateya naitɨ kaniyuxewiriyakamɨkɨ mɨkɨ mexa matɨa.  
\v 3 Herie keneukawiri huru hɨkɨame metatsiere naitsarie 'etsatana meta 'awateya, tenimeyaritsie hurukɨ kenata'utɨa.  
\v 4 Tenimeyari manukaniere hanira kenamanaxɨa naitsata 'etsatana mana kɨyexi meuye'unikɨ mɨkukweiyanenikɨ.  
\v 5 Kɨyexi 'akatsiya kɨyeyari keneuyuri, huru keneutiwiri.  
\v 6 'Ɨkwa witsimu'ɨa mexayari 'ixuriki meuwie hɨxie keneutaketsa kakuni meukunama, kakuni kanamikieya hɨxie, ne mana nepɨmatsikɨhɨaweni.   
\p
\v 7 »Mukatatarenitsie 'Aruni, kepauka kɨxeme 'aixɨa mukuyuruwanitsie, 'ɨkwa witsimu'ɨa yakatinikutaiyamɨkɨ 'ɨkwa witsimu'ɨa mexayaritsie,  
\v 8 meta taikai kepauka mikutaiyanitsie. Xenuiwarima memɨtixuawere 'ɨkwa witsimu'ɨa yamekateniutitaiyakuni Yawé hetsiemieme.  
\v 9 Tawarita xeime 'ɨkwa yɨkɨ'aneme pepɨkataiyani mɨkɨ 'ɨkwa witsimu'ɨa mexayaritsie, meta mana mawari taiyariyari pepɨkakuwewiwani, meta hatsite mawarikayari meta mana winu pepɨkaheutitu'ani.  
\v 10 Xeiwiyari 'anukayeikakaku 'Aruni 'itiya mawariyari pukuwewiwani memɨtinunuiwa wahetsiemieme memɨ'itiyanikɨ. Mawari taiyame 'awateya kanitixurimamɨkɨ 'axamɨtiuyuri mɨ'itiyanikɨ. Mɨkɨ mawari taiyame yuheyemekɨ patsietɨ kanayeimɨkɨ Yawé hetsiemieme».   
\s1 Tuminikɨ kememɨte'itiyaka  
\p
\v 11 Yawé Muitsexi katiniutaxatɨani mɨpaɨ katinitahɨawe:  
\v 12 «Kepauka memaka'utɨarieni 'ixaheritsixi, yuxexuitɨ Yawé hetsɨa mekateniyutuakuni yutukaritsiemieme, memɨkatetikwikwinenikɨ kepauka memɨti'inɨatsieni.  
\v 13 Yuxexuitɨ memaka'utsie mekateniyutuakuni Yawé hetsiemieme 'ataxewime kɨramuyari pɨrata, tuki kemɨti'inɨata hixɨapa 'akame.  
\v 14 Yunaitɨ memaka'utsieni xeitewiyari wiyari memɨhɨtɨka mɨkɨ mawari mekaniyetuakuni Yawé hetsiemieme.  
\v 15 Yutukari memɨtawikweitsitɨanikɨ, yunaitɨ yaxeikɨa paɨpaɨmeme mekaniyetuaxɨakuni, waɨkawa mɨrexeiya meta mɨkarexeiya.  
\v 16 'Ekɨ mɨkɨ pɨrata pekananɨ'ɨimɨkɨ 'ixaheritsixi memiyetuani, pekaniyetuamɨkɨ 'ixuriki tukiyari hetsiemieme mayanikɨ. Mɨpaɨ xɨka xete'uyurieni Yawé 'ixaheritsixi kɨmana memɨte'uyutua kanixeiyakamɨkɨ memɨkakwinikɨ».   
\s1 Katsu maimawame  
\p
\v 17 Yawé Muitsexi katiniutaxatɨani, mɨpaɨ katinitahɨawe:  
\v 18 «Katsu maimawame keneutawewi 'ayeume wurunitse tepɨayarikɨ, meta 'ɨkayari yaxeikɨa wurunitsekɨ wewiyakame, 'ixuriki tukiyari manuwe meta mawari taiyame wahixɨapa keneutaketsa. Haa kenakatu'a,  
\v 19 kɨmana 'Aruni meta niwemama mekaniukamaimawakuni meta yɨ'ɨkate mekanitihauxinakuni.  
\v 20 Kepauka memeutahaxɨani tukita, yatɨni kepauka mɨratimawatɨre hepa memukɨne taiyarika mawariyari Yawé hetsiemieme mewewienike, mana meheuyuhauxinatɨ  
\v 21 yumamatetsie meta yɨ'ɨkatetsie memɨkakukuwenikɨ. 'Ikɨ 'aitsika hawaikɨ pɨkahau'axe 'Aruni hetsiemieme meta nuiwarimama wahetsie».   
\s1 Hatseiti mɨpatsie memukawiriyarɨwani  
\p
\v 22 Yawé Muitsexi katiniutaxatɨani, mɨpaɨ katinitahɨawe:  
\v 23 «Naime 'ikɨ ketineukuxeɨri witsimɨtiu'ɨatɨka 'aixɨa mɨti'anene: 'ataxewime kiruyari mixaxi mɨhaxiki, haika kiruyari witsimu'ɨa kanera, haika kiruyari 'uwá witsimu'ɨa,  
\v 24 'ataxewime kiruyari katsiya kararayari witsimu'ɨa, nauka rituruyari huriwa hatseitiyari, kemɨti'inɨarikai tukita 'ana.  
\v 25 Mɨpaɨ tipaɨmemekɨ hatseiti pekanikawewimɨkɨ, witsimɨtiu'ɨatɨka tiwewiwame hepaɨ. Mɨkɨ hatseiti mɨpatsie kanayeimɨkɨ.  
\v 26 Mɨkɨkɨ 'ixuriki tukiyari pekanikawirimɨkɨ meta tɨratu kakuniyari,  
\v 27 mexa meta naime mana mɨrapine, kɨxeme 'uitɨwame meta naime tita mɨreutinɨ'ɨ, 'ɨkwa witsimu'ɨa mexayari,  
\v 28 mawari taiyariyari wewiwame naime tita mɨreutinɨ'ɨ, meta maimawame yaxeikɨata 'ɨkaya hetsiena muyema.  
\v 29 Mɨpaɨ petiyurieme mɨkɨ yemekɨ tipatsietɨ katinayeimɨkɨ, xɨka mɨkɨ piinite tiukumayuani patsietɨta kanayeimɨkɨ.   
\p
\v 30 »'Aruni meta niwemama keniwarukawiri, mepatsiekame keniwarayeitɨa nemawari wewiwamete memɨhɨkɨtɨnikɨ.  
\v 31 'Ixaheritsixi mɨpaɨ pekatiniwatahɨawimɨkɨ: “'Ena mɨreutiyune, 'ikɨ nehatseiti mɨpatsie kanihɨkɨtɨkamɨkɨ.  
\v 32 Hipameta teɨteri xepɨkawakawiriwani, meta hatseiti hepaɨna reukuwewiyakame xepɨkawewieka. Mɨkɨ hatseiti mɨpatsie kanihɨkɨtɨni, mɨpaɨ xeketenemaika.  
\v 33 Kemɨ'ane xeme hepaɨna 'aneme witsimu'ɨa mɨkawewieni, xeime kemɨ'ane mɨkamawari wewiwame mɨkawirieni, mɨkɨ yukiekaritsie kanayeweiyariemɨkɨ”».   
\s1 'Ɨkwa witsimu'ɨa  
\p
\v 34 Yawé Muitsexi mɨpaɨ katiniutahɨawe: «Yaxeikɨa tipapaɨmeme ketineukuxeɨri hipame kɨyexi tsuayari, meta 'amɨwaxi, kariwanu meta 'ɨkwa hɨkɨa,  
\v 35 mɨkɨ naime ketineunɨitɨa 'ɨkwa witsimuku'ɨare mayanikɨ, 'ɨkwa witsimu'ɨa wewiwamete wahepaɨ. 'Una kenanutiwiwi, 'ɨkwa hɨkɨa mɨpatsie mɨhɨkɨtɨnikɨ.  
\v 36 Yapaɨmeme keneutɨxi tumuanime kenayeitɨa, 'ixuriki tukiyarita kakuni hɨxie kenamana, hakewa ne 'ahamatɨa nemɨretixaxatani. Mɨkɨ xehetsiemieme 'ɨkwa witsimu'ɨa yemekɨ pɨpatsieka,  
\v 37 tawarita hepaɨna reukuwewiyatɨ pɨkayuwewieneni, mɨkɨ Yawé hetsiemieme kanihɨkɨtɨni. Xeme mɨpaɨ xeketenemaika patsiekame xekenayeitɨaka.  
\v 38 Kemɨ'ane mɨkɨ 'ɨkwa witsimu'ɨa mɨkawewieni 'i'ɨkwimɨtɨ, mɨkɨ yukiekaritsie kanayeweiyariemɨkɨ».   
\c 31  
\s1 Wetsareri 'Ahurihawi matɨa  
\r (Mem 31:2-6 – Mem 35:30-35)  
\p
\v 1 Yawé Muitsexi katiniutaxatɨani mɨpaɨ katinitahɨawe:  
\v 2 «Mɨpaɨ ketinemaika Wetsareri nepanayexei, 'Urihi nu'aya meta Kuxi teukarieya, Kura xiɨyarieya,  
\v 3 nekanihɨniyani Kakaɨyari 'Iyarieyakɨ, mɨtimaiwenikɨ, mɨtimatenikɨ, kemɨtiuyurieni kaniyɨweni,  
\v 4 waɨkawa mɨtiwewiwenikɨ hurukɨ, pɨratakɨ meta wurunitsekɨ,  
\v 5 tetexi witsimɨ'anene mɨxitewenikɨ, meta meitayatsawenikɨ, kɨyexi haruruanime mɨtiwewiwanikɨ, naime mɨtitiwewiwanikɨ tita mɨtimate.   
\p
\v 6 »Meta xeime 'iparewiwame nepanayexei 'Ahurihawi mɨtitewa 'Akitsamaki nu'aya, Rani xiɨyarieya, meta nepɨwarupitɨa memɨtematenikɨ yunaime tewewiwamete yemekɨ yamemɨteyurienikɨ kenemɨmatiuta'aitɨa:   
\li1
\v 7 tuki 'ixurikiyari,  
\li1 tɨratu kakuniyari,  
\li1 meta kanamikiyari,  
\li1 meta tukita naitɨ piinite mɨtiyukumayuani,   
\li1
\v 8 mexa meta xakɨrɨte  
\li1 meta kɨxeme 'uitɨwame hurukɨ wewiyakame,  
\li1 meta 'ɨkwa witsimu'ɨa mexayari,   
\li1
\v 9 meta mawari taiyariyari matiwewiwa meta ketipaɨmetɨ muwa mɨtiyukumaɨwa,  
\li1 yaxeikɨa maimawame meta 'ɨkaya,   
\li1
\v 10 kemarite mɨ'itsarietɨka, meta 'Aruni kamixateya mɨtipatsietɨka metatsiere niwemama wakemarite,   
\li1
\v 11 meta hatseiti memɨwakawiriwa  
\li1 meta 'ɨkwa witsimu'ɨa Muyepatsietsie mieme.  
\p »Naime mepɨtetiwewieni ne kenematiuta'aitɨa».   
\s1 Xawati tukariyari  
\p
\v 12 Yawé Muitsexi mɨpaɨ katiniuta'aitɨani:   
\p
\v 13 «Mɨpaɨ 'ixaheritsixi ketiniwarutahɨawi: “Xekena'eriwani xawati 'uxipiya tukaritsie. Nuiwarite memahu wahetsiemieme, xawati tukari 'inɨari pɨhɨkɨtɨni nehetsiemieme meta xehetsiemieme, mɨpaɨ xemɨtemaikakɨ ne Yawé nemenayexei mɨkɨ tukaritsie xemɨnetsihahɨawenikɨ.   
\p
\v 14 »”Xawati tukariyari pɨpatsieka xehetsiemieme. Xekena'eriwani.  
\p »”Kemɨ'ane mɨkaha'eriwani ke'umierieni.  
\p »”Kemɨ'ane mɨti'uximayaka 'ana, tahamatɨa pɨka'uyeikani.   
\p
\v 15 »”'Ataxewi tukari xepɨte'uximayaka, peru xawati 'uxipiya pɨhɨkɨtɨni pɨpatsieka Yawé hetsiemieme.  
\p »”Xewitɨ xɨka ti'uximayaka xawatikɨ ke'umierieni”.   
\p
\v 16 »'Ixaheritsixi mekehe'eriwani xawati 'uxipiya tukari. Wanuiwarite wahetsiemieme tɨratu yuheyemekɨ kanayeimɨkɨ,  
\v 17 'inɨari yamɨreuyuhane pɨhɨkɨtɨni mɨkɨ meta ne.  
\p »Kaniyuritɨni, 'ataxewi tukari Yawé katiniutawewieni, muyuawi taheima mieme meta kwie, 'atahutarieka tukaritsie puka'uxipi».   
\b  
\p
\v 18 Kepauka mɨtiutahayewaxɨ tikuxatatɨ Tsinahi hɨriyaritsie Muitsexi matɨa, hutame tetexi pi'ɨitɨa 'inɨari niukiyari maye'uxa pɨhɨkɨtɨkai Kakaɨyari mɨraka'utɨa mana yumamakɨ.   
\c 32  
\s1 Huru tsikeruyari  
\p
\v 1 Merikɨtsɨ Muitsexi 'ekatineutewikaitɨni kanuawetɨ Tsinahi hɨriyaritsie heyeikatɨ, hikɨ 'Aruni hɨxie 'ixaheritsixi me'u'axɨaka mɨpaɨ mekatenitahɨawe:  
\p —Peuyewetse kakaɨyarixi pemɨtatsitiwewirieni memɨtatsi'uwitɨximenikɨ, Muitsexi 'Ekipitu mɨtatsi'ayewitɨ, 'atsitepɨkatemate kemeyɨ kemɨreyɨnixɨ.   
\p
\v 2 'Aruni mɨpaɨ katiniwaruta'eiya:  
\p —Huru nakɨtsayari xekeniwarutawawiri yu'ɨitama, yuniwema 'ukitsi meta 'ukari, nehetsɨa xekene'atɨa.   
\p
\v 3 Yunaitɨ 'ixaheritsixi huru nakɨtsayari memexeiyakai, menenuyexɨnaxɨani 'Aruni mekaniyetuirieni,  
\v 4 huru hanutɨkɨka kanitikwaniya, 'ipɨnaka kakaɨyari kaniutawewieni, tsikeru hepaɨ 'aneme. Hikɨ yunaitɨ teɨteri mɨpaɨ mekaniutiyuani: «'Ixaheri, 'ikɨ 'akakaɨyari kanihɨkɨtɨni 'Ekipitu mɨmatsi'ayewitɨ».   
\p
\v 5 'Aruni 'ixeiyatɨ tuuru, mawari taiyame kaniutawewieni tsikeru hɨxie, hikɨ mɨpaɨ kaniutayɨni:  
\p —'Uxa'a 'ixɨarari tekaniwewikuni Yawé hetsiemieme.   
\p
\v 6 'Uxa'arieka ximeripaitɨ 'ixaheritsixi mekananuku'uni mekateni'atɨani mawari taiyariyari meta kename 'aixɨa memɨteyuxeiyanikɨ mawariyari. Hikɨ yunaitɨ mekananukayaxe mekateniukwani mekaniuti'ieni, kemɨtiwanake mekaniyɨakaitɨni.  
\v 7 Merikɨtsɨ Yawé Muitsexi mɨpaɨ katiniutahɨawe:  
\p —Xeiya kenanukaye'a teɨteri 'Ekipitu pemɨwarayewitɨ 'axamepɨteyurie.  
\v 8 Yapauka mepeuyexɨri huye mepuku'eiri, kenemɨtiwaruhɨritɨa, huru me'ukwaniyaka yukakaɨyari xeikɨa mepɨka'utawewi tsikeru hepaɨ 'anekame, matsi hɨxienata mepukatunuma'ui, mawari mepiwewiri, meta mɨpaɨ meputiyua: “'Ixaheri, 'ena 'akakaɨyari 'Ekipitu mɨmatsi'ayewitɨ”.   
\p
\v 9 Yawé tawarita Muitsexi mɨpaɨ katiniutahɨawe:  
\p —'Ari nepɨretima 'ikɨ teɨteri mepɨtsetse'i.  
\v 10 'Ekɨ wahetsie pepɨkanuaka. Nehaxɨa nepɨtatuani wahetsie, nepɨwakwini yunaime. Peru 'ahetsie nuiwari nepɨwatamɨiriya.   
\p
\v 11 Muitsexi Yawé yukakaɨyari kaninɨtɨamɨkɨkaitɨni mɨpaɨ katinitawawirieni:  
\p —Neuxei Yawé, ¿'ateɨterima wahepaɨtsita pepɨkaha'aka, pemɨwarayewitɨ 'Ekipitu 'atɨrɨkariyakɨ waɨkawa petiyurienetɨ?  
\v 12 ¿Mɨpaɨ memɨka'utiyuanenikɨ 'ekipitutari, kari mɨkɨ pɨwarayewitɨ wakwimɨtɨ yeuta paitɨ, 'ena kwiepa memeuyewenikɨ? Pepɨkaha'aka ketineunewi. Keneuyɨnɨtɨa, 'ateɨterima wahetsiemieme 'axapepɨkatiyurieneni.  
\v 13 Keniwara'eriwani kepemɨtiwarutahɨawixɨ, 'Apɨrahami, 'Itsahaki, 'Ixaheri meta. 'Ekɨ mɨpaɨ peputayɨ kename wanuiwari pewatamɨiriyakekai, kememɨteyuxexeiya xurawetsixi muyuawitsie, 'ekɨ pepɨwaruxatɨa kwie wanuiwari wahetsiemieme mayanikɨ yuheyemekɨ.   
\p
\v 14 Hikɨ Yawé kaniuhaxɨapieni, katiniuhayewa yuteɨterima kemɨwayurienikekai.   
\p
\v 15 Merikɨtsɨ Muitsexi kaninuani hɨritsie 'akaneka. Kepauka munua tetexi kana'ɨkaitɨni hutame wewerime, mɨkɨtsie 'inɨari niukiyari kana'utɨkateitɨni naitsata.  
\v 16 Mɨkɨ tetexi meta mɨra'utɨkatei, Kakaɨyari wewiyaya kanihɨkɨtɨkaitɨni.   
\p
\v 17 Kutsuhexi kepauka teɨteri wahiwari mu'eni, Muitsexi mɨpaɨ katiniutahɨawe:  
\p —Tematiteitsie hiwari waɨkawa pexuawe pɨreyukwine.   
\p
\v 18 Peru Muitsexi mɨpaɨ katinitahɨawe:  
\q1 «Kepemɨti'ena memɨtehayu'iwarɨmekɨ mepɨkatehehiwa,  
\q1 meta meha'iwarietɨ mehetitsuatɨ mepɨkatehehiwa,  
\q1 matsi pɨta kwikari pekatiniu'enieni».   
\p
\v 19 Kepauka Muitsexi hɨritsie 'akaneka munua mematiteitsie meta kepauka tsikeru muxei meta teye'amete, kaniuyeha'ani waɨkawa, mɨkɨ tetexi ma'ɨkai kaneixɨrieni, kaniutitare 'etsipepetɨ kaneutaxɨriexɨani hɨritɨa.  
\v 20 Hikɨ tsikeru memutawewiekai taipa kaneuhɨani, 'ariketa 'itataraka temɨxikiyari 'uhatuiyaka kaniwaruharitɨani 'ixaheritsixi teɨteriyari.  
\v 21 Meta 'Aruni mɨpaɨ katiniutahɨawe:  
\p —¿Kememate'utahɨawixɨ 'ikɨ teteɨteri? ¿Ketitayari teɨteri petiwarupitɨa 'axamemɨteyurienikɨ?   
\p
\v 22 'Aruni mɨpaɨ katinita'eiya:  
\p —Neuxei ne'iwa, pepɨkaha'aka, 'ekɨ pekatinimaika 'ikɨ teɨteri 'axamepɨte'u'iyari xeikɨa.  
\v 23 Mɨkɨ mɨpaɨ mekaneteniutahɨawe: “Peuyewetse kakaɨyarixi pemɨtatsitiwewirieni memɨtatsi'uwitɨximenikɨ, Muitsexi 'Ekipitu mɨtatsi'ayewitɨ, 'atsitepɨkatemate kemeyɨ kemɨreyunixɨ”.  
\v 24 Ne mɨpaɨ nepɨtiwarutahɨawixɨ, yunaitɨ kemɨ'ane huru xemexeiya xekeneukuxeɨri. Mɨkɨ mekaneni'atɨirieni, neta taipa nekaneixɨrieni, hikɨ mɨkɨ tsikeru hepaɨ 'anetɨ kanayani.   
\p
\v 25 Hikɨ Muitsexi 'ixaheritsixi teɨteriyari wamaitɨ ke'axamemɨteku'eriwakai pɨta, meta 'Aruni kemɨtiwarupitɨakai 'atsieriwamete memakɨnekɨ memɨwaraye'unie wahetsiemieme,  
\v 26 hikɨ memakutei kitenie 'utakeka mɨpaɨ kaniutayɨni: «Keyupaɨmetɨ xemɨyuwaɨriya Yawé hetsiemieme, nehetsɨa xekenakɨni». Yunaitɨ rewitsixi mekaniukɨne hetsɨana.   
\p
\v 27 Merikɨtsɨ Muitsexi mɨpaɨ katiniwarutahɨawe: «Yawé, 'Ixaheri Kakaɨyarieya, mɨpaɨ katina'aitani: “Yuxexuitɨ yukutsira xekeneukuha'aritɨaka xekeneukakɨni naitsarie 'ena xematiteitsie, kemɨ'ane xemanukunake xewatakukuyatɨ tsepa mɨxe'iwa, mɨxehamiku, tsepa xe'aurie kiekame”».  
\v 28 Muitsexi kemɨtiwaruta'aitɨa mɨkɨ rewitsixi mɨpaɨ mekatenikakɨne, mɨkɨ tukaritsie haika miriyari 'ixaheritsixi mekaniwarukwini.  
\v 29 Hikɨ Muitsexi mɨpaɨ kaniutayɨni: «Hikɨ xeme tɨrɨkariya xekaniupitɨarieni Yawé hetsiemieme, 'ikɨ tukaritsie 'aixɨa xekaniu'itɨarieni xeme, yu'iwama meta yuniwema xemɨwarukwi».   
\p
\v 30 'Uxa'arieka tukaritsie, Muitsexi mɨpaɨ katiniwarutahɨawe 'ixaheritsixi teɨteriyari: «Xemetsɨ kwinimieme 'axaxekateniuyurieni. Peru hikɨ hɨritsie nekanimieni Yawé nemetahɨawekɨ, heiwatɨ xereuyehɨwirieni Kakaɨyari ke'axaxemɨte'uyuri».   
\p
\v 31 Hikɨ Muitsexi heyaka Yawé mɨpaɨ katinetahɨawe:  
\p —Waɨkawamekɨ 'axamepɨte'uyuri 'ikɨ teɨteri, huru kakaɨyarixiyari mewarutiwewieka.  
\v 32 Peru, nepɨmatsiwawirie wahetsiemieme pemɨtiwareuyehɨwirienikɨ 'axakememɨte'uyuri. Peru xɨka 'ekɨ pekatiwareuyehɨwirieni, neta kenenakayeitɨa 'axapatsie pemɨraka'utuatsie.   
\p
\v 33 Yawé Muitsexi mɨpaɨ katiniuta'eiya:  
\p —Ne nekanekayeitɨamɨkɨ nexapatsie, kemɨ'ane xeikɨa 'axamɨtiuyuri.  
\v 34 'Ekɨ kenemie, keniwaranuwitɨki 'ikɨ teɨteri hakewa nematsihetaxatɨa. Niuki tuayame 'ahɨxie kaniumiemɨkɨ. Tukari kanaye'amɨkɨ kepauka nemɨwa'uximatɨani 'axamemɨte'uyurikɨ, 'ana mɨpaɨ pɨtiyɨni.   
\p
\v 35 Mɨpaɨ katiniɨyɨni, tsikeru 'Aruni mutawewikɨ, Yawé kwiniya kaniwareyenɨ'airieni teɨteri 'ixaheritsixi wahetsie.   
\c 33  
\p
\v 1 Merikɨtsɨ Yawé Muitsexi mɨpaɨ katiniutahɨawe: «Xekeneuhuni 'ekɨ meta teɨteri 'Ekipitu pemɨwareyewitɨ, mɨkɨ kwieyaritsie nemɨwaruhɨritɨa, 'Apɨrahami, 'Itsahaki, Kakuwu newaxatɨatɨ, yunuiwarima xemɨwayetuirienikɨ.  
\v 2 Niuki tuayame nepanunɨ'ani 'ahɨxie 'anuyekaitɨ mumienikɨ, nepɨwataweiya mɨkɨ kananeutsixi, 'amuxeutsixi, hetitsixi, peretseutsixi, heweutsixi meta kewutseutsixi.  
\v 3 Xekaniyehuni mɨkɨ kwieyaritsie mana waɨkawa kanexuaweni retsi meta xiete. Ne xehamatɨa nepɨkayemie, xɨka xehamatɨa neheyani, huyeta nekanixehekwiweni, xemɨkaheu'enanakɨ».   
\p
\v 4 Hikɨ 'ixaheritsixi mɨkɨ niuki me'u'enieka mekaniutitsuani mekaniyukahiwerieni waɨkawa, yukuka mepɨka'atitɨxɨa 'anatɨtɨ,  
\v 5 Yawé mɨpaɨ Muitsexi mɨtiutahɨawekaikɨ: «Mɨpaɨ ketiniwaretahɨawi 'ixaheritsixi, teɨteri memɨkaheu'enana mepɨhɨkɨ. Xɨka 'etsiwa wahamatɨa neheyani, nekaniwarekwiweni. Mɨpaɨ ketiniwaretahɨawi yukuka meke'atixɨnaxɨani, 'arike yapɨtayɨni kexemiyurieni».  
\v 6 'Ayumieme, kepauka Huré 'ixaheritsixi memɨyekɨtsietɨtɨ yukukate mepɨkatehatitɨxɨa.   
\s1 'Ixuriki kiiyari tixaxatame  
\p
\v 7 Merikɨtsɨ Muitsexi 'ixuriki kiiyari kaniutawewieni mematiteitsie yateewa. «'Ixuriki kiiyari Yawé hamatɨa tixaxatame» katiniterɨwa. Kepauka xewitɨ Yawé hamatɨa mɨreuxatamɨkɨni, mɨkɨ payeyeikakai mematiteitsie mɨkɨ xamaru manuwe pɨye'ani.  
\v 8 Kepauka Muitsexi xamaru hepa meyeikakai, yunaitɨ teɨteri yukitenie mekaniti'uwekaitɨni me'ixeiyake, kepaukake 'ixuriki kiiyarita meutahakekai mɨrewatixaxatatsie.  
\v 9 Kepauka Muitsexi meutahani, hai 'amuwe nakatetekekaitɨni kitenie katineunarɨmakaitɨni, kepauka Yawé Muitsexi hamatɨa mɨtikuxatani.  
\v 10 Kepauka 'ixaheritsixi haiwitɨri memɨxeiya xamaru tixaxatame kiiyari kitenie 'uweme, 'ana yunaitɨ mekaniukatunuma'uwekaitɨni yukitenie Yawé nenewieri me'ipitɨatɨ.  
\v 11 Yawé pɨtiutixaxatakai Muitsexi hamatɨa yuhɨxie me'utinenieretɨ, xewitɨ yuhamiku hamatɨa mɨtikuxatani hepaɨ. Metetixatameri Muitsexi kanewayeyeikakaitɨni, 'iwamama memakuteitsie kani'axekaitɨni, perutsɨ temaikɨ Kutsuhexi 'iparewiwameya 'ixuriki kiiyari tixaxatame muwa pɨkawayeyeikakai pɨka'iku'e'eiriwakai.   
\s1 Yawé xawatɨriyaya  
\p
\v 12 Muitsexi Yawé mɨpaɨ katiniutahɨawe:  
\p —'Ekɨ peyutemawietɨ pepɨnetikɨhɨawe kename newarayewitɨni 'ikɨ teɨteri, perutsɨ 'atsipepɨkanerahɨawe kemɨ'ane pepanunɨ'ani nehamatɨa. Mɨpaɨta peputaine kename ne 'ahamiku nehɨkɨ meta kename penetsiparewiwame.  
\v 13 Xɨka yurikɨ mɨpaɨ 'aneni, yakenetineutahɨawi kenemɨtiyurieni. Mɨpaɨ 'ana nepɨretimani kename penetsiparewiwame. Mɨpaɨ ketinemaika kename 'ixaheritsixi me'ateɨterima.   
\p
\v 14 Yawé mɨpaɨ kaniutayɨni:  
\p —Ne 'ahamatɨa nepɨyemie meta nepɨmatsika'uxipitɨani.   
\p
\v 15 Muitsexi mɨpaɨ katinitahɨawe:  
\p —Xɨka teyunaime tahamatɨa pekayemieni, ¿titayari tsɨkamɨ petarenɨ'awani?  
\v 16 Xɨka tahamatɨa pekaheyani, ¿'ateɨterima meta ne kemetehetimani, kename petatsiparewie? ¿Ketitakɨ tetepatsieka hipame teɨteri kwiepa memɨtama watsata?   
\p
\v 17 Yawé mɨpaɨ Muitsexi katiniutahɨawe:  
\p —'Aixɨa pɨ'ane mɨpaɨ nepɨtiyurieni kepemaine, 'ekɨ pepɨnetsiparewiwame meta pepɨnehamiku.   
\p
\v 18 Muitsexi tawarita mɨpaɨ katinitahɨawe:  
\p —Keneneuxeiyatsitɨa kepemɨtixawatɨ.   
\p
\v 19 Yawé mɨpaɨ katinita'eiya:  
\p —Ne 'aixɨa nepɨtiuka'iyari nepɨnewaɨriya nepɨmatsixeitsitɨani meta kenemɨtitewa pepeitimani. 'Aixɨa nepɨtiuka'iyari kemɨ'ane hamatɨa nemɨnewaɨriya, nepinenimaya kemɨ'ane nemeunenimayatamɨkɨ.  
\v 20 Perutsɨ mɨpaɨ nepɨmatitahɨawe pepɨkanetsixeiya kenemɨraka'erie, xewitɨ pɨkayɨwe mɨnetsixeiya, xɨka netsi'uxeiya kaniumɨmɨkɨ.   
\p
\v 21 Yawé mɨpaɨ katinitahɨawe:  
\p —Yateewa tete pɨkaka wayexawatɨ mɨkɨta pepayekani.  
\v 22 Kepauka 'a'aurie nemuyeyani waɨkawa nexawatɨtɨ, muwa terɨtɨa pe'ayekaime nemamakɨ nepɨmatsiheutinaka, kepaukake nemanuyeyani.  
\v 23 'Anake nepɨmatsiheukuyepieni pemɨnetsi'anaxeiyakɨ xeikɨa 'etsiwa, peru nehɨxie pepɨkanetsixeiya.   
\c 34  
\s1 Hutariekamieme tetexi mɨraka'utɨarie  
\p
\v 1 Merikɨtsɨ Yawé Muitsexi mɨpaɨ katiniutahɨawe: «Hutame tetexi wewerime keneutixixi matɨari kemɨ'anenekai pemititaraxɨ. Mana nepɨraka'utɨani meripaitɨ kemɨre'ukai.  
\v 2 Ximeripaitɨ pepɨ'akuha'aritɨani pemɨyemiekɨ hɨritsiepai Tsinahi, manutitewatsiepai mana nehɨxie kenenua.  
\v 3 Xewitɨ 'ahamatɨa pɨkaheyeikani, yaxeikɨata hɨritsie mepɨka'u'uwani. Meta muxatsi mepɨkatewaremitɨweni meta wakaitsixi mɨkɨ hɨri hɨxie 'ahurawa».   
\p
\v 4 Hikɨ Muitsexi hutame tetexi 'utiwewieka 'etsitsutsuime meripaimieme kemɨ'anenekai hepaɨ, kwi ximeripaitɨ kaneyani hɨritsiepai Tsinahi, Yawé kemɨtitahɨawixɨ.  
\v 5 Hikɨ Yawé haiwitɨritsie kananukateni Muitsexi 'aurie kaniyuhayewa. Kemɨtitewa katinitaxatɨani:  
\v 6 hɨxiena 'uyemietɨ mɨpaɨ kaniutayɨni:  
\p —Yawé, Yawé, Kakaɨyari 'aixɨa mɨtiuka'iyari, nepɨkayumexɨitɨa nemɨyeha'anikɨ, pɨmariwe nenaki'eriya, ne'iyarikɨ 'aixɨa nepɨtiuka'iyari,  
\v 7 nepɨtiuyukanaki'erie 'atsita xeimiriyari nuiwariyaritsiepai 'arike, nepɨyɨweta xeime nemɨreuyehɨwirienikɨ xɨka 'axatiuyurieni, xɨka kahau'enani, meta xɨka xurikime hexeiyani, peru nepɨkayɨwe nemihayewa kemɨ'ane mɨrapine nemɨkatikwinitɨanikɨ, matsi paapaya, nu'aya, teukarieya, meta tutsieya nuiwariyaya pɨwa'uximatɨwa.   
\p
\v 8 Hikɨ 'ana kwitɨwa Muitsexi kaniukahɨximakeni yutanenewienike,  
\v 9 mɨpaɨ katiniuyunenewieni:  
\p —Ti'aitame, xɨka yemekɨ penetsiparewiwametɨni tahamatɨa keneuyuhayewa. Nepɨtimate 'ikɨ teɨteri yu'iyaritsie mepɨtsetse'i, hikɨ ketatineuyehɨwiri 'axatemɨte'uyurikɨ, 'ahetsɨa miemete ketanayeitɨa.   
\p
\v 10 Yawé mɨpaɨ katinita'eiya:  
\p —Tsiparatsɨ tɨratu xeyunaime xehamatɨa nepɨwewieni, 'ixaheritsixi wahɨxie mariweme nepɨtiyurieni, hatsuaku hawaikɨ mɨkareyɨwe hepaɨ. Teɨteri mepɨneniere wahamatɨa pemuyeika 'ahetsie mariweme ne Yawé yanemɨtiyurieni.  
\v 11 Xɨka xeme yaxetekahuni kenemɨtixe'utahɨawixɨ, xɨka yaxetekakɨne. Nepɨwataweiya 'ahɨxie 'amuxeutsixi, kananeutsixi, hetitsixi, peretseutsixi, heweutsixi meta kewutseutsixi.  
\v 12 Xeme hakewa kwie nemɨxeyetuirieni mana tɨratu xepɨkawewietɨweni hipame teɨteri mana kiekatari wahamatɨa xematiyaxetsie, mexɨka mɨpaɨ xete'uyurieni xewiniyari ke'ayani xehetsiemieme.  
\v 13 Hakewa mawari mematiwewiwatɨkatsie xekeneuti'unaxɨa, 'Atserá kakaɨyarixiyari xekeniwarutitara meta tetexi mɨpatsietɨka memɨwarayexeiya.  
\v 14 Hipame kakaɨyarixi pepɨkawarayexeiyani, ne Yawé nekani'ɨtetsaka. Kakaɨyari mɨ'ɨtetsa katinitewaka.   
\p
\v 15 »Tɨratu xepɨkawewieka mana kiekatari wahamatɨa, mɨkɨ 'axamekateniyurieka yukakaɨyarixi mewarayexeiyatɨ, kepauka memɨtetimawa yukakaɨyarixi wahetsiemieme, mɨkɨ mekanixeti'inietɨkɨnikuni yuhetsɨa.  
\v 16 Xɨka xeniwema mewarutiwitɨni mɨkɨ 'ukari, kepauka mɨkɨ 'axamɨtiyurieni yukakaɨyarixi waruweiyatɨ, xeniwema mepɨta'inierieni wahepaɨ memɨyɨakakɨ.   
\p
\v 17 »Tepɨa kakaɨyariyari pepɨka'awewirieka.   
\p
\v 18 »Paa mɨkakuxanariyarie 'ixɨarariyari xekeneutiwewiwani, mɨkɨ xekeneutikwa'ani 'atahuta tukaritsie, kenematiuta'aitɨa. Mɨkɨ 'ixɨarari keneuwewiximeni weiya metseriyaritsie, mɨkɨ metseritsie 'Ekipitu xemayekɨkɨ.   
\p
\v 19 »Tɨɨri mexɨakate memɨtinunuiwa nehetsɨa mepɨmiemetetɨni, wakaitsixi meta muxatsi wamexɨakate.  
\v 20 Tɨɨri mexɨakate wahetsie pemɨtanuani pɨyɨweni. Puxu mexɨakame hetsie pepɨtanuani muxa mawariyarikɨ, xɨka mɨpaɨ pekatiuyurieni kɨipieya pekaniwakutaramɨkɨ.  
\p »Nixewitɨ nehetsɨa pɨkahamieni tixaɨtɨ karapitɨ.   
\p
\v 21 »'Ataxewime tukaritsie xeikɨa pepɨti'uximayaka, 'atahutariekatsie pekani'uxipiekamɨkɨ. Tsepa xemukwietsanatɨwe tsepa xemɨ'itsanatɨwe, peuyewetse mɨkɨ tukaritsie yemekɨ xemɨkate'uximayaka.   
\p
\v 22 »Tsemana 'ixɨarariyari xekeneutiwewiwani matɨari mɨtiutixuxuawere, meta 'itsanaxa 'ixɨarariyari xekeneutiwewiwani xeiwiyari 'anayexɨruwekaku.   
\p
\v 23 »Yunaitɨ 'ukitsi meputa'axeni, haikakɨa xeiwiyaritsie nehɨxie, ne Yawé 'Ixaheri Kakaɨyarieya hetsɨa.  
\v 24 Hikɨ 'ana nuiwarite 'ahɨxie nekaniwarayeweiyaxɨamɨkɨ, 'akwie nepɨ'ɨwiyani xewitɨ 'axapɨka'iyurieni.   
\p
\v 25 »Kepauka tewa mawariyari xemɨnetsiwewirieni, xuriyayatsie tikuxanariyame xepɨka'enutinɨitɨwani.  
\p »Muxa Patsikwa 'ixɨararipa mieme pɨkayukuhayeikawani 'uxa'arieka mieme mayanikɨ.   
\p
\v 26 »'Ikwaxi matɨari mieme 'aixɨa mɨ'anene Yawé kiita pepɨyetuani 'akakaɨyari hetsɨa.  
\p »Tsipu nunutsi maamaya retsieyatsie xepɨka'i'etsani».   
\b  
\p
\v 27 Yawé Muitsexi mɨpaɨ katiniutahɨawe:  
\p —'Ikɨ niukiyari kenaka'utɨa mɨkɨ tɨratu nepɨwewie 'ahetsiemieme meta 'ixaheritsixi wahetsiemieme.   
\p
\v 28 Hɨritsie Muitsexi puyuhayewaxɨ, Yawé hamatɨa, huta tewiyari tukari huta tewiyari tɨkari, katikwatɨ kaharetɨ. Mana tete wewerimetsie katinaka'utɨani tɨratu kememɨte'uwewi, tatsɨari tamamata 'aitsikayari.   
\s1 Muitsexi kemɨrayexawatɨkai  
\p
\v 29 Hikɨ Muitsexi kepauka Tsinahi hɨriyaritsie makane hutame tetexi 'a'ɨtɨ 'inɨari niukiyari maye'utɨka. Yawé hamatɨa mɨtiutaxatakaikɨ kanayexawatɨkaitɨni peru mɨkɨ 'atsipɨkatimaikai.  
\v 30 Kepauka 'Aruni meta 'ixaheritsixi Muitsexi memuxei 'ayexawatɨme, meputimama 'ahurawa mepɨkakɨnikukai.  
\v 31 Matsi Muitsexi 'Aruni kaniuta'inieni meta memanuyetei, mɨkɨ hetsɨana mekaniu'axɨani memɨtetixatakɨ.  
\v 32 'Ixaheritsixi 'ahurawa mekaniukɨne, Muitsexi mɨpaɨ katiniwaruta'aitɨani memɨ'enananikɨ Yawé kemɨrehɨawekai Tsinahi hɨriyaritsie.   
\p
\v 33 Hikɨ kepauka mɨtiutahayewaxɨ Muitsexi tikuxatatɨ, yuhɨxie kaneuyukunani 'ixurikikɨ.  
\v 34 Kepauka meutahakekai Yawé hamatɨa retixatake kaneuyukuyepiwakaitɨni mexi kawayeyeiweni. Wayeyame katiniwarutixaxatɨwakaitɨni 'ixaheritsixi Yawé kemɨtita'aitɨani kemɨtiwatahɨawe.  
\v 35 'Ixaheritsixi memixeiyakaikɨ 'ayexawatɨme, Muitsexi tawarita kaneuyuku'eimakaitɨni kepauka Yawé hamatɨa mɨtitixata.   
\c 35  
\s1 'Inɨari niukiyari xawatitsiemieme  
\p
\v 1 Merikɨtsɨ Muitsexi kaniwarukuxeɨrieni yunaime 'ixaheritsixi, mɨpaɨ katiniwarutahɨawe: «'Ikɨ Yawé kani'aitsikayatɨni mɨpaɨ temɨtekakɨnekɨ:  
\v 2 'Ataxewime tukari xeikɨa xekateni'uximayakakuni. 'Atahutarieka tukaritsie, xawatikɨ, mɨkɨ tukaritsie xepɨkate'uximayaka Yawé hetsiemieme kanipatsieka. Kemɨ'ane mɨti'uximayaka mɨkɨ tukaritsie kanimieriemɨkɨ.  
\v 3 Xawatikɨ nixewitɨ pɨka'atinanaiyani yukie».   
\s1 Tukitsie timieme  
\r (Mem 35:4-19 – Mem 25:1-7, 39:32-41)  
\p
\v 4 Muitsexi mɨpaɨ katiniwarutahɨawe 'ixaheritsixi yunaime: «Yawé mɨpaɨ katatini'aitɨaka:  
\v 5 Xekateniyetuakuni tita xemɨtehexeiya Yawé hetsɨa timieme mɨrayanikɨ huru, pɨrata, wurunitse,  
\v 6 muxa huxarieya 'uarietɨkaime mɨyɨtsikimaɨyekɨ, kwimɨxetakɨ meta mɨxetakɨ, rinu 'ixurikiyari 'aixɨa mɨ'ane, kapura huxarieya,  
\v 7 muxatsi 'amemɨpapa wanawiyari mɨxeta, ketsɨ 'amɨpa nawiyarieya, 'akatsiya kɨyeyari,  
\v 8 huriwa hatseitiyari kɨxemetamieme, witsimu'ɨatɨka hatseiti memɨwakawiriwa hetsiemieme meta 'ɨkwa witsimu'ɨa hetsiemieme,  
\v 9 'unitse teteyari meta hipame witsimɨ'anene kamixa 'etsimɨnena hetsiemieme mayanikɨ meta kuka mekatɨni hetsiemieme.   
\p
\v 10 »Yunaitɨ naimekɨ memɨteheutawewiwawe mana memɨxuawe mekanahuni 'ena mɨkɨ mepɨyɨwaweni memɨtetiwewieni Yawé kemɨti'aita:  
\v 11 tuki, heimana manuka'eimire, meta 'ixuriki 'amɨyeyeu, yukwatsiturai hexeiyatɨkaime, mexa 'amatayeyeu, manuyehini, meta mɨka'uni meta hetsiena ma'uni,  
\v 12 kakuni meta kɨyexi manukuhini hexeiyame, kanamikieya, meta 'ixuriki kakuni meukunakakɨ,  
\v 13 mexatsie meta kɨyexi manukuhini hexeiyakame, mana mɨrapinire, paa mana mamare.  
\v 14 Kɨxeme 'uitɨwame mɨkɨxenikɨ meta tita mɨrakapine, kɨxemete, hatseitiyari,  
\v 15 'ɨkwa witsimu'ɨa mexayari kɨyexi hexeiyame manukuhini, hatseiti memɨkawiriyarɨwa, 'ɨkwa witsimu'ɨa, 'ixuriki kitenie meuwiere.  
\v 16 Tuurutsixi mematitaiyarɨwa mayexaxawa hexeiyakame wurunitsekɨ wewiyakame, kɨyexi manukuhini meta naitɨ mana mɨreuyewetse, maimawame wurunitsekɨ wewiyakame meta hetsiena muyemare hexeiyame.  
\v 17 Takwa 'ixuriki mawɨretɨyani, kɨyexi meuka'uixɨani, 'ixuriki takwa kitenietsiemieme,  
\v 18 xamaru makɨwɨrixɨani kɨyexi mukatsunirixɨani, meta kurarutsie mieme, meta kaunariyarite.  
\v 19 Mawari wewiwamete wakamixate 'atɨtɨme wipetɨkaime me'enakatɨtɨ memɨteta'uximayatakɨ tukita, kamixateta mɨpatsietɨka 'Aruni hetsiemieme meta niwemama wahetsiemieme».   
\p
\v 20 Hikɨ 'ixaheritsixi yunaitɨ meneutayeixɨani Muitsexi hɨxie,  
\v 21 hikɨ yuxexuitɨ kememɨte'uyuitɨarie meyuwaɨriyatɨ yamekateniuyurieni Yawé 'imikieri mekaniyetuirieni tuki 'ixurikiyari mɨtawewiyanikɨ, meta naime tita mɨtiyɨnikekai, meta kemarite mɨtiwewiyanikɨ mɨpatsietɨka.  
\v 22 Yaxeikɨata, yunaitɨ kememɨte'uyuitɨarie meyuwaɨriyatɨ yu'iyaritsie, 'ukitsi 'ukari, hurute mekateniyetuani mawari mayanikɨ: tupunite, kuka, hanira, meta hipatɨ yɨkɨ mɨreukuwewiyatɨka hurukɨ mɨtiwewiyatɨka. Yunaitɨ mɨkɨ huru mawariyari mekaniyetuaxɨani Yawé hetsiemieme teikɨ hetserarietɨ muyuitɨariwa mayanikɨ,  
\v 23 yaxeikɨata tita memɨteheuxeiyakai mekatenepini: muxa huxarieya mɨyɨtsikimawi, kwimɨxeta meta mɨxeta, rinu 'ixurikiyari 'aixɨa mɨ'ane, kapura huxarieya, muxatsi wanawi mɨxeta mɨraye'atɨka meta ketsɨte 'amemɨpapa wanawiyari.  
\v 24 Pɨrata memexeiyakai meta wurunitse Yawé mekaniyetuirieni wamawari mayanikɨ, yaxeikɨata 'akatsiya kɨyeyari memexeiyakai mekaniyetuani, mɨpaɨ mekateniyetuani 'etsiwa mɨtitiwewiyanikɨ.  
\v 25 'Ukari waɨkawa memɨtematekai mekateniyetuaxɨani, hiru mɨyɨtsikimawi, kwimɨxeta meta mɨxeta, mɨkɨ memeitikaunakai meta rinu 'ixurikiyari.  
\v 26 Hipatɨta waɨkawa memɨtematekai, mɨkɨta mekaniuyuitɨarieni para memiyetuanikɨ, mɨkɨ tsipuri wahuxariyari kakaunime.  
\v 27 Memanuyetei 'ixaheritsixi wa'ukiyarima 'unitse teteyari mekani'atɨani meta hipame tetexi witsimɨ'anene, para mawari wewiwame kamixayatsie mieme meta kukaya mɨtawewiyanikɨ mekatɨkɨnikɨ.  
\v 28 Yaxeikɨata witsimu'ɨatɨka mekaniyetuani meta huriwa hatseitiyari mekanehapani kɨxeme hetsiemieme, meta memɨkawiriyarɨwani, yaxeikɨata 'ɨkwa witsimu'ɨa.  
\v 29 Yunaitɨ 'ixaheritsixi kememɨtekuyuitɨariwakai mawari mekaniyetuani Yawé hetsiemieme 'ukitsi meta 'ukari, Yawé hetsiemieme mɨtita'uximayatsienikɨ, Muitsexi yatiwakɨhɨawekaku kememɨteyurienikekai.   
\s1 Wetsareri meta 'Ahurihawi  
\r (Mem 35:30-35 – Mem 31:2-6)  
\p
\v 30 Muitsexi mɨpaɨ katiniwarutahɨawe 'ixaheritsixi: «Mɨpaɨ xeketenemaika Yawé Wetsareri kanenayexeiya 'Urihi nu'aya Kuxi teukarieya, Kura nuiwarieyatsie mieme,  
\v 31 Kakaɨyari 'Iyarikɨ kanihɨniyani, mɨtimaiwenikɨ, mɨtimatenikɨ, kemɨtiuyurieni kaniyɨweni,  
\v 32 katiniwewiweni hurukɨ, pɨratakɨ meta wurunitsekɨ,  
\v 33 tetexi witsimɨ'anene kanixiteweni meta mitayatsakɨ, kɨyexi haruruanime kaniwewiweni, meta naime mɨtitiwewiwanikɨ tita mɨtimate.  
\v 34 Mɨkɨ Kakaɨyari kanipitɨani meta 'Ahurihawi 'Akitsamaki nu'aya, Rani nuiwarieyatsie mieme, hipame memɨtewa'ɨkitɨawawenikɨ.  
\v 35 Pɨwarupitɨa waɨkawa memɨtemaiwawenikɨ memɨtetiwewiwanikɨ tinaime, muxa huxarieyakɨ memɨteheutawewiwawenikɨ, mɨyɨtsikimaɨyekɨ, kwimɨxetakɨ, meta mɨxetakɨ, metatsiere rinu 'ixurikiyarikɨ. Mepɨteheutatsaiwawe yemekɨ mepɨtemate tsepa tita mɨtiutawewi.   
\c 36  
\p
\v 1 »Hikɨ, Wetsareri meta 'Ahurihawi hamatɨa yametenikakɨnikuni tinaime 'uximayatsikatsie tuki hetsiemieme, yemekɨ Yawé kemɨtiuta'ai, yunaitɨ yaxeikɨa meteku'eriwatɨ kememɨtepitɨarie, meta kemɨ'ane Yawé metemaiweme meta meteheutawewiwaweme mɨwarupitɨa witsiti'anenekame memɨtetiwewiwanikɨ tukita timieme».   
\p
\v 2 Muitsexi kaniwarutahɨawe Wetsareri meta 'Ahurihawi, meta yunaime kemɨ'ane yaxeikɨa memɨtepitɨariekai, meta kemɨ'ane Yawé metemaiwaweme meta meteheutawewiwame mɨwarupitɨa, yuxexuitɨ kememɨte'uyuitɨarie meyuwaɨriyatɨ mekaniu'axɨani memɨteta'uximayatakɨ,  
\v 3 mɨkɨ katiniwayetuirieni mawari 'ixaheritsixi memɨteyetuakai tuki mɨtawewiyanikɨ. Peru 'ixaheritsixi mekatehayewakaku meteyetuayatɨ 'imikierite,  
\v 4 yunaitɨ memɨtewewiekai tuki hetsiemieme memɨtemate, mekateniuhayewa,  
\v 5 mɨpaɨ Muitsexi memɨtehɨawiyukɨ: «Teɨteri kwinimiemeri tipaɨmeme mepɨtekuxeɨrixime, 'ari mɨpaɨ tipaɨmeme xeikɨa, Yawé kemaine pɨtinake».   
\p
\v 6 Hikɨ Muitsexi mɨpaɨ katiniuta'aita memɨteyukaxatɨanikɨ naitsarie memakuteitsie: «'Ari 'imikieri xepɨkayetuayani tuki hetsiemieme, 'ukitsi meta 'ukari xepɨkatehe'uximayakari». 'Anake 'ixaheritsixi mekateniuhayewa meteyetuayatɨ,  
\v 7 memɨte'atɨakai pɨtiwaɨkawakai mɨkɨkɨri pɨtitinɨrekekai naitɨ 'uximayatsika.   
\s1 Tuki  
\r (Mem 36:8-38 – Mem 26:1-37)  
\p
\v 8 Yunaitɨ tewewiwamete xei'iyariyari mehexeiyaɨ tuki mekaniutawewieni, tamamata rinu 'ixurikiyarikɨ 'aixɨa mɨ'anenekɨ, muxa huxarieya mɨyɨtsikimaɨyekɨ 'uariekame, kwimɨxetakɨ, meta mɨxetakɨ, Kakaɨyari teɨtametemama mehaxutɨkaime.  
\v 9 Naitɨ 'ixuriki yaxeikɨa patayeyeukai, tamamata heimana huta meturuyari heimana 'imeriyu tɨtɨme meta xeimeturuyari heimana nauka tewiyari tsenitimeturuyari patayeyeuka.  
\v 10 'auxɨwime 'ixuriki mekaniutawipa yuwiyakame, hipameta 'auxɨwime yaxeikɨa mekaniuyurieni.  
\v 11 Mexɨakame mɨwipetsie 'ixuriki, hakɨrɨi mekanawɨtɨaxɨani muxa huxarieyakɨ mɨyɨtsikimawikɨ 'uariekame, yaxeikɨata mekateniuyurieni hutarieka miemetsie.  
\v 12 Mexɨakame mɨwipetsie mekanawɨtɨani huta tewiyari heimana tamamata hakɨrɨi, hutarieka miemetsieta yaxeikɨa, naitɨ yaxeikɨa papaɨmeme pexeiyatɨkatei 'anuyutaxeiyatɨkaitɨ.  
\v 13 'Ariketa huru kwatsituraiyari mekaniutiwewieni huta tewiyari heimana tamamata 'ixuriki muyutawiyakɨ, tuki muyuxewiriyanikɨ.   
\p
\v 14 Tamamata heimana xewi tsipuri wahuxari 'ɨkariyari mekaniutiwewieni, tuki manukananikɨ 'ixuriki kiyari hepaɨ rekuweretɨ.  
\v 15 Yaxeikɨa pɨyeyeukai naitɨ tamamata heimana xewi 'ixuriki mauwɨre, tamamata heimana haika meturuyari heimana 'imeriyu meta xeimeturuyari heimana nauka tewiyari tsenitimeturuyari 'atayeyeume.  
\v 16 Hutame mekaniutiwipa 'ɨkari, xeime 'auxɨwime, xeimeta 'ataxewime.  
\v 17 Huta tewiyari heimana tamamata mekaniutiwewieni hakɨrɨi matɨari memitawipaxɨtsie 'imatɨrieka 'ɨkari manunieretsie mekanewɨtɨaxɨani, meta hutarieka miemetsie yaxeikɨa paɨmeme.  
\v 18 Wurunitse kwatsitɨraiyari mekaniutiwewieni huta tewiyari heimana tamamata, tuki yuxewiriyatɨ mayanikɨ.  
\v 19 Nawi mekaniutawipa tukitsiemieme muxatsi wanawiyari xetamekɨ 'uarietɨkaime, mɨkɨ heimana manukawerire mekaniutawewieni ketsɨte wanawiyari 'aixɨa mɨ'anenekɨ.   
\p
\v 20 Tuki hetsiemieme 'akatsiya mexayari mekaniutixixieni pepetsawime, mekanika'uitɨani.  
\v 21 Xexuitɨ mexa nauka meturuyari heimana 'imeriyu pɨtɨkai meta haika tewiyari heimana tamamata tsenitimeturuyari 'atayeyeutɨ,  
\v 22 hutakɨa 'ukakukunitɨkaime. Naime mɨkɨ mexate tuki hetsiemieme mɨpaɨ mekateniuwewieni:   
\li1
\v 23 Xeitewiyari mexate putiwewi, 'ameuyewatsie tatsutɨa muyekatsie mieme,  
\v 24 huta tewiyari kaniuyɨni pɨrata tepɨayari mexa mutuikaxɨani, xexuime mexatɨa huhutatame,   
\li1
\v 25 tayeta miemeta xeitewiyari mexate 'ematayeyeu tuki hetsiemieme,  
\v 26 huta tewiyari pɨrata tepɨayari wahetɨa meutayaxe, mexa xexuime hetɨa huhutatatɨ,   
\li1
\v 27 'etsimeuyewatsieta 'ataxewitɨ mexate kaniuyɨni, tau makayuyuipike hepatsie,   
\li1
\v 28 mutatsikuritɨkatsie huhutatatɨ kaniuka'uni 'etsimeuyewatsie.   
\p
\v 29 Mɨkɨ mexate yu'aurie kaniuti'utɨkateitɨni 'axeikɨa 'ati'utɨ, wapaitɨ xeihanirayaritsie heuyehatɨkaitɨ. Yaxeikɨa puyɨxɨa naitsata 'etsikinatsie,  
\v 30 'atahaika mexate kaniuyɨni, meta tamamata heimana 'ataxewi mexatɨa mieme pɨrata tepɨayari, huhutatatɨ xexuime mexatɨa.   
\p
\v 31 'Akatsiya kɨyeyari mekaniutixixieni manuyehini: 'auxɨwime mexate tuki 'etsata mieme,  
\v 32 'auxɨwimeta tapa mieme, 'auxɨwime mexate 'etsimauyewatsie tuki manutinieretsiemieme.  
\v 33 Kɨyexi ma'utɨka wahixɨapa mukuhuni kɨye heutanetɨkaime mepuyuri.  
\v 34 Mexate mɨti'utɨka huru mekanitiwirieni, meta huru hanirayari mekanawewiexɨani manukuhini mana meuyehaxɨanikɨ. Meta manukuhini hurukɨ mekanitiwirieni.   
\p
\v 35 'Ixuriki mekaniutawewieni muxa huxarieya mɨyɨtsikimawikɨ, kwimɨxetakɨ meta mɨxetakɨ rinu 'aixɨa mɨ'anekɨ, Kakaɨyari teɨtametemama mehaxutɨkaime hetsiena.  
\v 36 Naukame 'akatsiya kɨyeyari mɨka'uni mekaniutixixieni huru mekanitiwirieni, huru kwatsituraiyari mekana'uitɨaxɨani, naukame pɨrata tepɨayari mekaniutiwewieni kɨyexi mɨka'uni hetsiena ma'uni.  
\v 37 'Ixuriki mekaniutawewieni tuki kitenie mieme muxa huxarieya 'uarietɨkaime mɨyɨtsikimawikɨ, kwimɨxetakɨ meta mɨxetakɨ rinu 'aixɨa mɨ'anekɨ, 'itsariekame meta tixukame,  
\v 38 'auxɨwime kɨyexi mekaniutixixieni kwatsiturai hexeiyatɨkaime, meta wurunitse tepɨayari 'auxɨwime kɨyexi muka'uni 'amɨpapa hetɨamieme, meta huru herie mekanikawirieni.   
\c 37  
\s1 Kakuni  
\r (Mem 37:1-9 – Mem 25:10-20)  
\p
\v 1 Wetsareri kakuni kaniutawewieni 'akatsiya kɨyeyarikɨ, xeimeturuyari heimana tamamata tsenitimeturuyari tewime, haika tewiyari heimana tamamata tsenitimeturuyari 'atayeume meta yaxeikɨata mɨpaɨ heutitewame.  
\v 2 Huru taɨtana kanewakuwirieni meta herie, meta hurukɨ kanetatenitɨani.  
\v 3 Naukame huru hanirayari kaniutiwewieni kakunitsie mieme, 'ɨkateyatsie ne'uitɨani, tapa 'etsatana hutatɨ na'uni tapata hutatɨ.  
\v 4 Meta kurumawime 'akatsiya kɨyeyari kaniutiwewieni, huru kanitiwirieni,  
\v 5 haniratsie kaneiye'uitɨaxɨani kakuni 'etsata mukumanetsie, mukukweiyanenikɨ.   
\p
\v 6 Hurukɨ xeikɨa kanamikiyari kaniutawewieni Kakaɨyari ma'axe, xeimeturuyari heimana tamamata tsenitimeturuyari tewime meta haika tewiyari heimana tamamata tsenitimeturuyari 'atayeume.  
\v 7 Kakaɨyari teɨtametemama pɨwarutiwewi hurukɨ, titsunamekɨ mewewiyatɨkaime, kanamiki Kakaɨyari ma'axe 'etsimeuyeyeutsie mema'unikɨ yuxexuitɨ.  
\v 8 Xewitɨ 'etsimeuyewatsie kanakeni, xewitɨta tapa, Kakaɨyari teɨtametemama memɨyuhuta, meyuxewiriyame kaniwarayeitɨani Kakaɨyari ma'axeni mame.  
\v 9 Kakaɨyari teɨtamete Kakaɨyari ma'axe heima mepuye'anatɨkatei, kɨmana mepenukanakai. Mepanuyutaxeiyakai Kakaɨyari ma'axe meheukanenieretɨ.   
\s1 'Akatsiya mexayari  
\r (Mem 37:10-16 – Mem 25:23-29)  
\p
\v 10 Wetsareri mexa kaniutawewieni 'akatsiya kɨyeyarikɨ, nauka tewiyari heimana tamamata tsenitimeturuyari tewime meta huta tewiyari heimana 'auxɨwi tsenitimeturuyari 'atayeume, meta haika tewiyari heimana tamamata tsenitimeturuyari 'aweme.  
\v 11 Huru kanikawirieni, hurukɨtsiere kaneta'utɨani.  
\v 12 Metatsiere xeitewiyari tsenitimeturuyari 'atayeume kanatawewieni tenimeyari, mɨkɨta hurukɨ kaneta'utɨani.  
\v 13 Naukame huru hanirayari kaniutiwewieni 'ɨkateyatsie kane'uitɨaxɨani, 'etsatana huhutatatɨ kana'uixɨani 'ɨkateya ma'utɨkatsie.  
\v 14 Hanira, mexa tenimeyari hetɨa neimana, mana kɨyexi muye'unikɨ mukukweiyanenikɨ.  
\v 15 Mɨkɨ 'akatsiya kɨyexiyari pɨhɨkɨtɨkai huru wiriyarietɨkaitɨ.  
\v 16 Naime hurukɨ xeikɨa pɨtiutiwewi tita mana mɨrapinirekekai xakɨrɨte, 'itɨte, tekɨxite, ye'ɨrɨte 'amɨnene winu memutimawakai hetana.   
\s1 Kɨxeme 'uitɨwame  
\r (Mem 37:17-24 – Mem 25:31-39)  
\p
\v 17 Wetsareri kɨxeme 'uitɨwame kaniutawewieni hurukɨ xeikɨa, titsunamekɨ wewiyakame. Hetsiena maweni meta 'ɨkayari, muwatixaxawa, tekɨxiyari meta tuturiyari naitɨ puyuxewiriyakai.  
\v 18 Kɨxeme 'ataxewime yumamate pexeiyakai, tapa haikatɨ tapata haikatɨ.  
\v 19 Xexuime mamateyaritsie haikakɨa hewatixaxawame 'arimetɨra tuturiyari hepaɨ tiyuxexeiyatɨkaime, tuturi yu'iwitsi hexeiyakame meta xawariyari.  
\v 20 Kɨxeme 'uitɨwame peixeiyakaita naukame tekɨxiyari 'arimetɨra tuturiyari hepaɨ tiyuxexeiyame, yu'iwitsi meta yuxawari hexeiyame.  
\v 21 Mexɨakame mamateya paritsiyari hetɨatsie peixeiyakai xeime yutekɨxi, hutarieka paritsiyari hetɨatsie peixeiyakai hutarieka tekɨxi, meta hairieka paritsiyari hetɨatsie peixeiyakai hairieka mieme tekɨxi.  
\v 22 Tekɨxite meta mamateyari puyuxewiriyakai kɨxeme 'uitɨwame matɨa, hurukɨ xeikɨa titsunamekɨ wewiyakame.   
\p
\v 23 'Atahuta kɨxeme hurukɨ xeikɨa kaniutiwewieni, meta kɨmana mɨtaire meta naxiyari makawiwieni.  
\v 24 Mɨkɨ kɨxeme 'uitɨwame mɨtawewierekɨ meta tinaitɨ mɨreukapine xeitewiyari heimana tamamata heimana haika kiruyari huru kaniuyɨni.   
\s1 'Ɨkwa witsimu'ɨa mexayari  
\r (Mem 37:25-28 – Mem 30:1-5)  
\p
\v 25 Wetsareri 'ɨkwa witsimu'ɨa taiyame mexayari kaniutawewieni 'akatsiya kɨyeyarikɨ. Yaxeikɨa huta tewiyari heimana 'auxɨwi tsenitimeturuyari tewime meta huta tewiyari heimana 'auxɨwi tsenitimeturuyari 'atayeume, meta nauka tewiyari heimana tamamata tsenitimeturuyari 'aweme. 'Awateya naitɨ kaniyuxewiriyakaitɨni mɨkɨ mexa matɨa.  
\v 26 Herie kanikawirieni huru metatsiere naitsarie 'etsatana meta 'awateyatsie, hurukɨ xeikɨa tenimeyaritsie kanetawirieni.  
\v 27 Tenimeyari manukaniere hanira kanamanaxɨani mana kɨyexi meuye'unikɨ mukukweiyanenikɨ.  
\v 28 Kɨyexi 'akatsiya kɨyeyari kanihɨkɨtɨkaitɨni, huru wiriyarietɨkaitɨ.   
\p
\v 29 Wetsareri hatseiti mɨpatsie kaniukawewieni meta 'ɨkwa witsimu'ɨa, witsimɨtiu'ɨatɨka wewiwamete wahepaɨ katiniwewieni.   
\c 38  
\s1 Mexa mawari taiyariyari wewiwame  
\r (Mem 38:1-7 – Mem 27:1-8)  
\p
\v 1 Merikɨtsɨ Wetsareri 'akatsiya kɨyeyarikɨ mawari taiyariyari wewiwame kaniutawewieni. Yaxeikɨa kaneutatetewakaitɨni, huta meturuyari heimana xeitewiyari heimana tamamata tsenitimeturuyari tewime meta mɨpaɨ 'atayeume, meta xeimeturuyari heimana xeitewiyari heimana tamamata tsenitimeturuyari 'aweme.  
\v 2 Naitsata 'awate kanawewiexɨani muta'itsikinatɨkatsie, mɨkɨ naitɨ puyuxewiriyakai mexa mawari taiyariyari wewiwame matɨa, meta wurunitsekɨ mexa kaniukawirieni naime herie.  
\v 3 Katiniutiwewienita wurunitsekɨ tita mɨreuyewekai: naxi yetsame, 'itɨ 'amɨpa, tepɨa manuxɨte, tepɨa 'amɨpa manuxutetɨka, meta tɨɨ yayatsame.  
\v 4 Mawari matitaiyarɨwa hetɨa mieme kaniutawewieni 'ayexaxawame wurunitsekɨ wewiyakame, tenimeyari hetɨa kaniyemani, kemawekai hixɨapa 'uyemakame.  
\v 5 Wurunitse hanirayari naukame kaniutiwewieni, memanaxɨanikɨ naitsata mayexaxawa 'etsikinayaritsie, kɨyexi mana muye'unikɨ,  
\v 6 kɨyexi xexeurawime kaniutiwewieni 'akatsiya kɨyeyarikɨ, wurunitse kanitiwirieni herie  
\v 7 manuyexaxawatsie kaneiyehatɨaxɨani, naitsata heitituatɨkaitɨ kanayani mɨkɨkɨ mukukweiyanenikɨ. Mawari taiyame yutaɨta puxawakai mexakɨ pɨwewiyakai.  
\v 8 'Ukarawetsixi 'ixuriki tukiyari kitenie memɨte'uximayakai wurunitse xikɨriyari mekani'atɨirieni, mɨkɨkɨ kanitawewieni maimawame meta 'ɨkaya hetsiena muyemare.   
\s1 Takwa timieme  
\r (Mem 38:9-20 – Mem 27:9-19)  
\p
\v 9 'Ariketa takwa 'amakuyewa mekaniutawewieni. Tatsutɨa hepatsie huta tewiyari heimana 'auxɨwi meturuyari pɨtewikai, rinu 'ixurikiyari 'aixɨa mɨ'anene pawɨtɨkatei,  
\v 10 kɨyexi muka'utɨka xeitewiyari pexeiyakai, meta xeitewiyari wurunitse tepɨayari hetɨana mieme, pɨrata kwatsituraiyari hexeiyatɨkaime kɨyexi meta hanira.  
\v 11 Tapata tayeta hepatsie huta tewiyari heimana 'auxɨwi meturuyari pɨtewikai, xeitewiyari muka'utɨka kɨyexi pexeiyakai, xeitewiyarita wurunitse tepɨayari hetɨana mieme, pɨrata kwatsituraiyari hexeiyatɨkaime kɨyexi meta hanira.   
\p
\v 12 'Etsimeuyewatsie tau makayuyuipike hepatsie xeitewiyari heimana huta meturuyari heimana 'imeriyu patayeukai, meta 'ixuriki peuwɨkai meta tamamata kɨyexi muka'uixɨani meta tamamata hetsiena ma'utɨkatei, kɨyexi pɨrata kwatsituraiyari pexeiyatɨkatei.  
\v 13 Tau manatineika hepatsieta, xeitewiyari heimana huta meturuyari heimana 'imeriyu patayeukai.  
\v 14 Mɨranutakɨkatɨretsieta tapa 'ixuriki peuwɨkai 'atahuta meturuyari 'ayetɨtɨ, haikatɨ kɨyexi muka'utɨka, meta haikatɨ hetsiena ma'uni,  
\v 15 meta tapatsieta 'ixuriki peuwɨkai 'atahuta meturuyari 'ayetɨtɨ, haikatɨ kɨyexi muka'utɨka, meta haikatɨ hetsiena ma'uni.  
\v 16 'Ixuriki naitɨ maweretɨkatei takwa, mɨkɨ rinu 'ixurikiyari 'aixɨa mɨ'anene kanihɨkɨtɨkaitɨni.  
\v 17 Kɨyexi mutuikatɨka wurunitsekɨ pɨwewiyatɨkatei, kwatsiturai meta hanira kɨyexi hetsie mawetɨkatei pɨratakɨ pɨwewiyatɨkatei, meta mu'uteyatsie pɨratakɨ kaniwiriyarietɨkateitɨni. Naitɨ kɨyexi mukawetɨkatei pɨrata hanirayari pexeiyatɨkatei.   
\p
\v 18 'Ixuriki mɨranutakɨkatɨretsie meuwiekai mɨyɨtsikimaɨyekɨ pɨ'uariekai, kwimɨxetakɨ meta mɨxetakɨ, rinu 'ixurikiyari 'aixɨa mɨ'ane, witsireuku'itsetɨ. 'Atanauka meturuyari pɨtewikai meta huta meturuyari heimana xeitewiyari heimana tamamata tsenitimeturuyari 'atayeutɨ, mɨyatɨniketɨ mɨpaɨ heutitewatɨ, mɨkɨ 'ixuriki takwa mieme hepaɨ,  
\v 19 naukame pexeiyakai kɨyexi muka'uni meta naukame pexeiyakai wurunitse tepɨayari hetɨana mieme. Kwatsituraiyari meta hanirayari pɨratakɨ pɨwewiyatɨkatei, meta mu'uyatsie pɨrata pɨkawiriyarietɨkatei.  
\v 20 Naitɨ mukatsunetɨkatei 'ixuriki manukawere makuwɨrekɨ, meta mana takwa kuraru makatsie mieme wurunitse tepɨayari pɨhɨkɨtɨkatei.   
\s1 Ketipaɨmetɨ mɨtiuyɨ  
\p
\v 21 'Ikɨ katinihɨkɨtɨni ketipaɨmemekɨ mɨtiutiwewiya, para tuki muyepatsie tɨratutsie mieme mɨtawewiyanikɨ. Rewitsixi mɨpaɨ mekatenaka'utɨani, Muitsexi mɨpaɨ mɨtiwaru'aitɨakɨ meta 'Itamaxi 'Aruni mawari wewiwame nu'aya yatiwakɨhɨawekaku.  
\v 22 Wetsareri, 'Urihi nu'aya Kuhuxi teukarieya, Kura nuiwarieyatsiemieme, Yawé Muitsexi kemɨtiuta'aitɨakai mɨpaɨ katiniuyurieni naime.  
\v 23 Yaxeikɨata piparewiekai 'Ahurihawi, 'Akitsamaki nu'aya, Rani nuiwarieyatsie mieme, mɨkɨ naime pɨtitiwewiwakai, pɨtitiwipakai muxa huxarieya mɨ'uarietɨkakɨ mɨyɨtsikimawikɨ, kwimɨxetakɨ meta mɨxetakɨ, meta rinu 'ixurikiyarikɨ.   
\p
\v 24 Kepaɨmetɨ muyɨ huru mɨyetuiya, kepauka tuki mutawewiyatsie xeimiriyari kiruyari kaniuyɨni, kemɨti'inɨatakai 'ana tuki.   
\p
\v 25 Pɨrata kememɨteyetua yuxexuitɨ 'ixaheritsixi mekanaka'utsieni, haika miriyari heimana 'auxɨwime tsienituyari (3.500) kiruyari kanayani kemɨti'inɨatakai tuki 'ana.  
\v 26 Yunaitɨ xeitewiyari wiyari memɨhɨtɨkatei mekanaka'utɨarieni, mɨkɨ yunaitɨ mepakɨ 'ataxewime tsienituyari heimana haika miriyari heimana 'auxɨwime tsienituyari heimana huta tewiyari heimana tamamata (603.550), mɨkɨ mɨpaɨ meyupaɨmetɨ mekaniyetuaxɨani yuxexuitɨ, 'ataxewime kɨramuyari pɨrata, tuki 'ana kemɨti'inɨatakai.  
\v 27 Haika miriyari heimana haika tsienituyari kiruyari pɨrata kaniuyɨni, xeitsienituyari kɨyexi mukawetɨka hetɨa mieme mutiwewiya, mɨkɨ xexuitɨ pɨreuhapanakai xeitewiyari heimana tamamata heimana haika kiruyari.  
\v 28 Pɨrata muyuhayewaxɨ putiwewiya kwatsiturai meta hanira kɨyexi muka'uni hetsiemieme, meta mu'uyatsie manutineniere mekaniutiwirieni.   
\p
\v 29 Naitɨ wurunitse kaniyetuiyani huta miriyari heimana haika tsienituyari heimana huta tewiyari kiruyari,  
\v 30 'ixuriki tukiyari kitenie kɨyexi hetsiena ma'uni kaniutiwewiyani, meta mawari taiyariyari wewiwame, mayexaxawa meta naitɨ tita mɨreuyehɨwa,  
\v 31 takwa kuraru makatsie kɨyexi hetsiena ma'uni kaniutiwewiyani meta mukatsunirixɨa tuki hetsiemieme meta kuraru makatsiemieme.   
\c 39  
\s1 Mawari wewiwamete wakemari  
\p
\v 1 Kemarite mɨti'itsetɨka tukita te'uximayatamete wahetsiemieme, kaniutiwewiyani muxa huxarieya mɨyɨtsikimaɨyekɨ, kwimɨxetakɨ meta mɨxetakɨ mu'uarietɨkakɨ. 'Aruni meta kemariteya kaniutiwewiyani mɨpatsietɨka hetsiena mieme, Yawé Muitsexi kemɨtiuta'aitɨakai.   
\s1 Kamixa mɨpatsie  
\r (Mem 39:2-7 – Mem 28:6-14)  
\p
\v 2 Wetsareri 'Aruni kamixaya 'etsimɨnena kaniutawewieni hurukɨ, muxa huxarieya 'uariekame mɨyɨtsikimaɨyekɨ, kwimɨxetakɨ meta mɨxetakɨ, metatsierie rinu 'ixurikiyari 'aixɨa mɨ'anekɨ.  
\v 3 Huru mekaniutitsuna wewerime mekanayeitɨani, 'etsi'atayeyeume mekaniutixiteni kamixatsie kɨmana memɨtewipakɨ muxa huxarieya yunɨkame mɨyɨtsikimaɨyekɨ, kwimɨxetakɨ meta mɨxetakɨ meta rinukɨ.  
\v 4 Naiparieyatsie mieme wiwieri meputiwewi kamixa hetsiemieme naitsata kanakayaxixɨani.  
\v 5 Mɨkɨ hɨiyameya yaxeikɨa 'anemekɨ kaniwewiyakaitɨni, mɨkɨ naitɨ puyuxewiriyakai kamixa matɨa, hurukɨ kaniwewiyakaitɨni meta muxa huxarieya mɨyɨtsikimaɨyekɨ, kwimɨxetakɨ meta mɨxetakɨ, metatsiere rinu 'ixurikiyari 'aixɨa mɨ'anekɨ, mɨpaɨ katiniuyurieni Muitsexi Yawé kemɨtita'aitɨa.   
\p
\v 6 'Unitse teteyari mekaneuyatsaxɨani huru hetsie, mɨkɨtsie meha'utɨkaime 'Ixaheri niwemama, tseyu kemɨtiwewiwa hepaɨ.  
\v 7 Hikɨ kamixa 'etsimɨnena wiwierieyatsie mekanekayatsaxɨani, para 'Ixaheri tɨɨriyamama mema'eriwanikɨ, Yawé Muitsexi kemɨtita'aitɨa.   
\s1 Kuka tawitsie mieme  
\r (Mem 39:8-21 – Mem 28:15-28)  
\p
\v 8 Wetsareri kuka kaniutawewieni tawitsie mieme, pɨ'itsekai kamixa 'etsimɨnena hepaɨ, huru hiruyarikɨ xuiyakame, muxa huxarieya mɨyɨtsikimaɨyekɨ, kwimɨxetakɨ meta mɨxetakɨ metatsiere rinu 'ixurikiyari 'aixɨa mɨ'anekɨ pɨwewiyakai,  
\v 9 payehutakai, yaxeikɨa heutatetewatɨ, xeitewiyari tsenitimeturuyari heutatetewatɨ.  
\v 10 Mana peuyatsarie tetexi witsimɨ'anene naukakɨa panukutetɨkatei. Matɨari miemetsie mana patekai tetexi witsi'anenetɨ xetamekɨ, taxaɨyemekɨ, meta tsiɨraɨyemekɨ 'utimerɨkatɨkaitɨ.  
\v 11 Hutarieka manukukatsie, yuawitɨ tsiɨrauyemekɨ, yuawimekɨ mukutuxie meta tuxamekɨ mutimerɨka.  
\v 12 Hairieka miemetsieta, merie xetatɨ taxaɨyetɨ, tuxamekɨ kapemaɨyemekɨ meta yɨtsikimaɨyetɨ.  
\v 13 Naurieka mukukatsieta, taxaɨyetɨ, kwimɨyɨwi, meta tsiɨraɨyetɨ. Mɨkɨ hurutsie witsimɨ'anene pamanekai,  
\v 14 tamamata heimana huta teteyari pɨhɨkɨtɨkai, mɨkɨ xexuitɨ 'Ixaheri niwemama pɨwa'inɨaritɨkai, tamamata heimana huta nuiwarite mepa'utɨkatei tseyu hepaɨ.   
\p
\v 15 Hurukɨ kuka wiwieriyari kaniutiwewiyani, tsarietɨkaitɨ yatɨtɨ.  
\v 16 Hutatɨ hanira hurukɨ kaniutiwewiyani meta witsi'anenetɨ hetsiena meumarixɨanikɨ, kuka mutatsikuritɨkatsie,  
\v 17 hikɨ mana kanewɨtɨaxɨani huru kaunariyari, haniratsie kaneuyehaxɨani kuka hetsie mamanetɨkatsie,  
\v 18 mɨkɨ huru kaunariyari hutame mayexaxawatsie kenewiyatsitɨaxɨa kamixa 'etsimɨnenatsie hɨxiena mɨkatɨre.  
\v 19 Tawarita hutatɨ hanira hurukɨ kaniutiwewiyani, kanewɨtɨaxɨani kuka taɨta miemetsie kamixa 'etsimɨnena hetsie.  
\v 20 Tawarita hutame hanira kaniutiwewieni hurukɨ, naiparie mukaneniere kanawɨtɨariexɨani kamixa mɨpatsie hɨiyameyari manakuka 'aurie.  
\v 21 Muxa huxarieya witayarikɨ mɨyɨtsikimaɨyekɨ mɨkɨ hanira mekaniutiwiwitɨani, kamixa mɨpatsie hanirayari meta kuka hanirayari mekaniuhɨaxɨani, kuka hɨiyameyari manukuka muyuhayewanikɨ, mɨkakuyuanenikɨ kamixa mɨpatsietsie, Yawé Muitsexi kemɨtita'aitɨakai.   
\s1 Hipameta wakemari mawari wewiwamete  
\r (Mem 39:22-31 – Mem 28:31-43)  
\p
\v 22 Wetsareri 'ixuriki mɨyɨtsikimaɨyekɨ kamixa 'etsimɨnena mɨpatsie kaniutawewieni 'itsariekamekɨ, kamixa 'etsimɨnena heima mieme.  
\v 23 Hixɨapa hewatitenime kaniuyurieni, mu'u rewatinakeme, muwatixawatsie 'atatenime mɨkayetsanikenikɨ.  
\v 24 'Ixuriki tenimeyaritsie petayatsaxɨ putuni, yɨtsikimawime, kwimɨxetakɨ, mɨxetakɨ, meta rinu 'ixurikiyarikɨ 'aixɨa mɨ'ane.  
\v 25 Meta kapana 'etsipepeme hurukɨ xeikɨa wewiyatɨkaime, tenimeyaritsie kanatawɨre, putunite matawɨrixɨa tsata.  
\v 26 Kapana 'etsimupepe meta putunite kanatawɨre 'anayeyaxiketɨ, mɨkɨ 'ixuriki tenimeyaritsie, ti'uximayatame menakatɨni hetsiemieme, Yawé Muitsexi kemɨrahɨawekai.   
\p
\v 27 'Aruni hetsiemieme meta niwemama wahetsiemieme, kamixa kaniutiwewiyani 'amɨtɨtɨ rinukɨ 'itsarietɨkaitɨ.  
\v 28 Kamixa meta mukuretsi rinu 'ixurikiyari pepɨyurieni, hɨiyame 'itsarietɨ pɨyuwiyani naitɨ.  
\v 29 Hɨiyame rinu 'ixurikiyari kanihɨkɨtɨkaitɨni 'aixɨa mɨ'anekɨ 'itsarietɨ mɨyɨtsikimaɨyekɨ, kwimɨxetakɨ meta mɨxetakɨ, Yawé Muitsexi kemɨtiuta'aitɨa.   
\p
\v 30 Huru tepɨayari mɨpatsie 'etsiyeume tseyu hepaɨ 'anekame kaniutawewieni, mana katineu'utsieni, «Mɨpatsie Yawé hetsiemieme».  
\v 31 Hikɨ muxa witayarikɨ yɨtsikimaɨyemekɨ kaniuwiwitɨarieni mukuretsitsie makuwierekɨ, Yawé Muitsexi kemɨtiuta'aitɨa.   
\s1 Muitsexi tuki 'unɨrieku kemɨtiutixei  
\r (Mem 39:32-41 – Mem 35:10-19)  
\p
\v 32 Naitɨ tuki kaniunɨrieni, 'ixaheritsixi yamekateniwewieni Yawé kehepaɨ 'anekame Muitsexi muta'aitɨakai,  
\v 33 Muitsexi kaniuxeitsitɨarieni tuki, heimana manuka'eimire, 'ixuriki 'amɨyeyeu meta muwa mɨtiyepine, kwatsiturai, mexate 'amatayeyeu, manukuhini, muka'uni meta hetsiena ma'uni,  
\v 34 muxatsi wanawiyari 'ɨkariyari mɨxeta, ketsɨte 'amemɨpapa wanawiyari 'ɨkariyari meta 'ixuriki kakuni meukunakai,  
\v 35 kakuni meta kɨyexi hetsiena manukuhe meta kanamikieya,  
\v 36 mexa mana rapitɨ tita mana mɨtimieme meta paa yamɨramane,  
\v 37 kɨxeme 'uitɨwame hurukɨ xeikɨa mɨwewiya meta kɨxeme manuye'u metatsiere tita mana mɨtimieme, meta hatseiti kɨxeme hetsiemieme.  
\v 38 Mawari taiyame hurukɨ xeikɨa mɨwewiya, 'ɨkwa witsimu'ɨa, hatseiti mu'utsie mieme mɨpatsie meta 'ixuriki tuki kitenie mieme,  
\v 39 mawari taiyariyari wewiwame wurunitsekɨ mɨwewiya meta mayexaxawa hexeiyame, kɨyexieya meta naitɨ tita mɨkɨ mɨreuyehɨwa, maimawame meta hetsiena muyema,  
\v 40 takwa kuraru makatsie mieme 'ixuriki mawɨtɨka, kɨyexi muka'utɨka meta hetsiena mawetɨka, 'ixuriki kuraru kitenie meuwie, kaunarite, kɨyexi mukatsutsune kuraru heima mɨranukawerire hetsiemieme, naitɨ tita mɨtiyɨnikekai tuki muyepatsie hetsiemieme 'ixuriki tukiyari,  
\v 41 meta kamixate mɨ'itsarietɨka tukita memɨteta'uximayata wahetsiemieme, meta mawari wewiwame 'Aruni kamixateya mɨpatsietɨka meta niwemama mawari wewiwamete wakamixate.   
\p
\v 42 'Ixaheritsixi yamekateniutiwewieni Yawé kehepaɨ'anekame Muitsexi muta'aitɨakai.  
\v 43 Muitsexi, katiniutixeiya tita mɨtiutiwewiyakai, tiuxeiyaka Yawé kehapaɨ ti'aneneme mɨtita'aitɨakai, 'aixɨa katinixeiya.   
\c 40  
\s1 Yawé tukieya kemɨtiunɨrie  
\p
\v 1 Yawé Muitsexi mɨpaɨ katiniutahɨawe:  
\v 2 «Mexɨakame metseriyaritsie meta mexɨakame tukaritsie, tuki muyepatsie keneutawewi, 'ixuriki tukiyari.  
\v 3 Muwa kiita kakuni tɨratuyari keneutateka, 'ixurikikɨ keneukunama.  
\v 4 Meta mexa muwa keneutaketsa 'aixɨa ketineuketsa. Meta tukita keneutaketsa kɨxeme 'uitɨwame, kɨxeme keneutaiyaxɨa.  
\v 5 'Ɨkwa taiyame kakuni hɨxie keneutaketsa, meta 'ixuriki keneuwi tuki kitenietsie.   
\p
\v 6 »Mawari taiyame tuki hɨxie keneutaketsa, 'ixuriki tukiyari hɨxie,  
\v 7 meta maimawame mana keneutaketsa, mawari taiyame meta 'ixuriki tukiyari wahixɨapa, haa meta kenakatu'a hetsiena.  
\v 8 Kuraru kenateka waritanatsie, 'ixuriki meta keneuwi kuraru kitenietsie.   
\p
\v 9 »Hatseiti mɨtiyupatakɨ ketineu'ɨya, tuki keneukawiri meta naime ketineti'ɨya ketita muwa mɨreyepine, para naitɨ tipatsietɨ mɨrayanikɨ piinite.  
\v 10 Hatseiti keneuwirita mawari taiyame meta naime mana mɨtiyepine, tinaitɨ tipatsietɨ mɨrayanikɨ.  
\v 11 Yaxeikɨata maimawame keneuyuri, patsiekame kenayeitɨa meta 'ɨkayari hetsiena muyemare.   
\p
\v 12 »Hikɨ 'Aruni kenanuwitɨkita meta niwemama 'ixuriki tukiyari kitenie, mana meke'uti'ɨwa,  
\v 13 meta 'Aruni kamixate mɨpatsietɨkakɨ keneutikemaritɨa. Hatseiti keneukawiri mɨtiyupata, mɨtita'uximayatakɨ nemawari wewiwame mayanikɨ.  
\v 14 Hikɨta niwemama kamixa 'amɨtɨtɨ keniwaranakatɨtɨa,  
\v 15 mɨkɨta keniwarukawiri hatseiti mɨtiyupatakɨ wapaapa hepaɨ, mɨkɨ memɨteta'uximayatakɨ nemawari wewiwametekɨ. Kememɨte'ukawiriyarie mɨkɨ pɨ'inɨaritɨni yuheyemekɨ wanuiwari 'umemahu nemawari wewiwamete mepɨhɨkɨtɨni».   
\p
\v 16 Muitsexi yapɨtiuyuri naime Yawé kemɨtita'aitɨa.  
\v 17 Mɨpaɨ pauka tuki kaniunɨrieni mexɨakame metseritsie mexɨakame tukaritsie meta hutarieka wiyari 'aye'aku.  
\v 18 Kepauka tuki Muitsexi mukatsutɨa, kɨyexi hetsiena ma'uni kaniuka'uitɨani, mexa 'amatayeyeu na'uitɨatɨyani meta manukuhini, tuki hɨxie kɨyexi kaniuka'uitɨani,  
\v 19 hikɨ 'ixuriki tukitsie kananukawera, heimana tawarita 'a'ayetsuime kananukawera nawi, Yawé kemɨtita'aitɨakai.   
\p
\v 20 Hikɨ Muitsexi, tɨratu maye'uxa xapayari 'utihurieka kakunitsie kanikayeni, meta kɨyexi kananuye'uitɨani, metatsiere kanamikieya kananukamani.  
\v 21 Kakuni tukita kaneutateni, 'ixurikikɨta kaneikunani. Mɨkɨ mɨpaɨ katinikweriwayuriekaitɨni kakuni tɨratuyari, Yawé kemɨtita'aitɨakai.   
\p
\v 22 Muitsexi mexa 'ixuriki tukiyarita 'etsatanatsie kanitikeni tayeta hepatsie, 'ixuriki warita,  
\v 23 Yawé hɨxieta paa kanamana pareku rekumaneme, Yawé kemɨtita'aitɨakai hepaɨ.  
\v 24 Kɨxeme 'uitɨwameta tukita kaneutakeni, mexa hɨxie, tuki 'etsatatsie tatsutɨa muyekatsie,  
\v 25 'anari kɨxeme kaniutaiyaxɨani Yawé hɨxie, Yawé meripaitɨ kemɨtita'aitɨakai.  
\v 26 Meta 'ixuriki tukiyarita mɨratimawatɨre hurukɨ xeikɨa mɨwewiya, 'upaitɨ 'ixuriki meuwie hɨxie kaniutakeni,  
\v 27 mɨkɨtsie 'ɨkwa witsimu'ɨa kaniutaiya, Yawé kemɨtita'aitɨakai.  
\v 28 'Ariketa yatiuyurieka 'ixuriki kaneuwieni tuki kitenie.   
\p
\v 29 Muitsexi meta mawari taiyame 'akaniutakeni 'ixuriki tukiyari kitenietsie, mana mɨkɨtsie mawarika kaniutitaiya meta hatsi mawariyari, Yawé kemɨtita'aitɨakai.  
\v 30 Meta maimawame 'akaniutakeni, 'ixuriki tukiyarita meta mawari taiyame wahixɨapa kanitakeni, haa mɨkɨtsie kanikatuani maimawame,  
\v 31 hikɨ mana Muitsexi 'Aruni meta yunaitɨ niwemama yumamate yu'ɨkate mekaniutihauxini.  
\v 32 Kepauka memeutahakekai 'ixuriki tukiyari kitenie yatɨni kepauka mawari taiyame hetsie 'ahurawa memɨkɨkakai mepɨtimaimawakai, Yawé kemɨtiwa'aitɨakai.   
\p
\v 33 'Ariketa Muitsexi takwa kaniutawewieni tuki warie kematewatɨka meta mawari taiyame, meta kuraru kitenie 'ixuriki kaneuwieni. Muitsexi 'uximayatsika mɨpaɨ katiniutinɨni.   
\s1 Yawé xawatɨriyaya  
\p
\v 34 Merikɨtsɨ 'ana kwitɨwa haiwitɨri 'ixuriki tukiyari kananukanani, tukita Yawé xawatɨriyaya kaniuyeyerɨni.  
\v 35 Muitsexi pɨkayɨwekai 'ixuriki tukiyarita meutahani haiwitɨri menukanakaikɨ, meta Yawé xawatɨriyaya tukita mɨhɨnekaikɨ.   
\p
\v 36 Kepauka tuki hetsie haiwitɨri manuku'ekekai, 'ana 'ixaheritsixi mepuyukuha'aritɨwakai mepekɨkakai.  
\v 37 Kepauka haiwitɨri mɨka'anuku'ekekai, mepɨkayɨwawekai memɨyekɨne yukiita kayuwatɨ mepɨtetekai.  
\v 38 Kepauka 'ixaheritsixi memuhukai, Yawé haiwitɨrieya tuki heima kanakatetekekaitɨni tukarikɨ, tɨkarikɨta tai hepaɨ 'anetɨ payeikakai, yunaime 'ixaheritsixi wahɨxie.   